hadiths[527]{hadithnumber,text}:
"4628","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ nay aadm alyh alslam kw apny swrt pr pyda kya، an ka qd sath hath tha، jb anhyn pyda kya tw frmaya: jao as grwh kw slam krw، frshtwn ka ayk grwh jw bytha hwa tha، awr jw jwab wh tmhyn dytay hyn asay ghwr say snw، kywnkh yh tmhara slam krna hw ga۔ tw wh gya awr an say kha: alslam alykm! anhwn nay jwab dya: alslam alykm wrhm allh! anhwn nay apnay jwab myn 'wrhm allh' kay alfaz ka azafh kya، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \jw bhy jnt myn dakhl hw ga wh aadm ky shkl myn hw ga، as ka qd sath hath hw ga۔ an kay bad tkhlyq ab tk mslsl ghtty ja rhy hay۔‘‘ mtfq alyh۔"""""
"4629","abdallh bn amrw rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh ayk aadmy nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha: aslam kay kwn say aadab bhtryn hyn؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: (yh kh) tm (dwsrwn kw) khlatay hw، awr jn kw tm jantay hw awr jnhyn tm nhyn jantay dwnwn kw slam krtay hw۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4630","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ayk momn kay dwsray momn pr chh hqwq hyn: jb wh bymar hw jayay tw as ky ayadt kray، jb wh mr jayay tw as kay jnazay myn shryk hw، jb wh tmhyn blayay tw as ky dawt qbwl krw، jb tm as say mlw tw as kw slam krw، jb wh slam khay، awr jb allh taalyٰ khay tw slam khay“۔ yrhmk allh، awr as ky mwjwdgy myn awr as ky ghyr mwjwdgy myn as kay lyay khyr ky tmna krw۔\ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay nsayy awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔ mshkw kay msnf khtay hyn: awr myn nay asay shyhyn myn nhyn paya awr nh hy ktab alhmydy myn، lykn jama alaswl kay msnf (abn asyr) nay asay nsayy ky rwayt say zkr kya hay۔"""""
"4631","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm jnt myn as wqt tk dakhl nhyn hw sktay jb tk kh tm mwmn nh hw jao awr tm as wqt tk mwmn nhyn hw sktay jb tk kh tm ayk dwsray say mhbt nh krw، kya myn tmhyn ayk aysy chyz kay baray myn nh btaon js pr aml krnay say tm ayk dwsray say mhbt krnay lgw؟ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4632","Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Radi Allahu Anhu) rivayat karte hain ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: \Sawar ko paidal chalne wale ko"","" paidal chalne wale ko baithne wale ko aur kam tadaad wale ko zyada tadaad wale ko salam karna chahiye.\"" Muttafiq alaih."""""
"4633","Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Radi Allahu Anhu) rivayat karte hain ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: \Chhota bade ko salam kare"","" paidal chalne wala baithne wale ko salam kare aur kam tadaad wale zyada tadaad wale ko salam kare.\"" Bukhari."""""
"4634","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Radi Allahu Anhu) rivayat karte hain ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Sallam) kuch bachchon ke paas se guzre aur unhein salam kiya. Muttafiq alaih."
"4635","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yhwd w nsaryٰ say slam ky abtda nh krw، awr jb tm an myn say ksy say rastay myn mlw tw asay as kay tng tryn hsay myn lay jao“۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4636","abn amr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb yhwdy tmhyn slam krtay hyn tw an myn say ayk khta hay: alsm alyk (tm pr mwt hw)، tw tm an kw jwab dw: walyk (awr tm pr)۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4637","Hazrat Anas (Radi Allahu Anhu) rivayat karte hain ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: \Jab Ahl-e-Kitaab tumhein salam karein to tum 'Wa Alaikum' kaho.\"" Muttafiq alaih."""""
"4638","aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh yhwdywn kay ayk grwh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say mlaqat ky ajazt chahy tw anhwn nay kha: ”tm pr mwt hw۔ myn nay kha: blkh tm pr mwt awr lant hw۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \aayshh، bay shk allh nrm hay awr hr maamlay myn nrmy kw psnd krta hay۔\"" myn nay kha: kya tm nay nhyn sna kh anhwn nay kya kha؟ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \""myn nay jwab dya: 'awr tm pr (mwt hw)'۔\"" awr dwsry rwayt myn hay: alfaz \""tm pr\"" hyn awr anhwn nay \""awr\"" ka zkr nhyn kya۔ awr bkhary ky rwayt myn hay: aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha: \""yhwdy nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay awr kha: \""tm pr mwt hw،\"" nby sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya: \""awr tm pr.\"" aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha: \""tm pr allh ky lant hw، tm pr lant hw۔\"" (yh sn kr) rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \""aayshh! rwkay rhw، nrmy akhtyar krw، awr skhty awr bd zbany say bchw۔\"" as nay kha: kya tm nay nhyn sna kh anhwn nay kya kha؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya tm nay nhyn sna kh myn nay kya kha، myn nay an kw jwab dya awr an kay hq myn myry daa qbwl hwyy awr myray khlaf an ky daa qbwl nhyn hwyy۔ awr mslm ky rwayt myn hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” galy nh dw، kywnkh allh taalyٰ bay hyayy awr zbrdsty bay hyayy kw psnd nhyn krta“۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"""""
"4639","Hazrat Usama bin Zaid (Radi Allahu Anhuma) se rivayat hai ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Sallam) aik aisi majlis ke paas se guzre jis mein Musalmaan, mushrikeen aur Yahood bethe thay, to aap ne unhein salam kiya. Muttafiq alaih."
"4640","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap nay frmaya: ”srkwn pr bythnay say bchw۔ shabh nay arz kya ya rswl allh! whan bythna hmaray lyay zrwry hay، hm as kay bghyr nhyn kr sktay، hm whan byth kr batyn krtay hyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: agr bythna hy hay tw srk ka hq ada kr dw۔ anhwn nay pwchha ya rswl allh! rastay ka hq kya hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ngahyn nychy rkhna، nqsan nh phnchana، slam ka jwab dyna، nyky ka hkm dyna awr brayy say mna krna۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4641","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say sabqh hdys myn mzkwr qsay kay hwalay say rwayt krtay hyn kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”awr rasth dkhana“۔ amam abwdaod nay abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh say rwayt krnay waly hdys kay bad asy trh rwayt ky hay۔ as ka slslh achha hay۔ asay abw daod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4642","amr rzy allh anh as waqah kay baray myn nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn kh aap nay frmaya: ”mzlwm ky mdd krw awr as ky rhnmayy krw jw rasth bhtk gya hay۔ amam abwdaod nay abwhryrh rzy allh anh ky hdys kay bad asy trh rwayt ky hay awr myn nay yh dwnwn hdysyn shyhyn myn nhyn payy hyn۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4643","aly rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ayk mslman kay dwsray mslman pr dstwr kay mtabq chh hqwq hyn: jb wh as say mlay tw asay slam kray، jb wh asay blayay tw asay qbwl kray، jb asay chhynk aayay (awr alhmdllh khay)، jb wh gray tw allh taalyٰ ky ayadt kray، awr jb wh as say mlay tw asay slam kray۔ jb wh mr jayay tw as kay jnazay myn shrkt kray awr apnay lyay why psnd kray۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4644","Imran bin Husain (Radi Allahu Anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: \Assalamu Alaikum.\"" Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne us ka jawab diya"","" phir woh baith gaya. Phir aap (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \""Das (nekiyan) hain.\"" Phir doosra aadmi aaya aur kaha: \""Assalamu Alaikum wa Rahmatullah.\"" Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne jawab diya"","" aur jab woh baith gaya to aap ne farmaya: \""Bees (nekiyan) hain.\"" Phir teesra aadmi aaya aur kaha: \""Assalamu Alaikum wa Rahmatullahi wa Barakatuh.\"" Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne jawab diya"","" aur jab woh baith gaya to aap ne farmaya: \""Tees (nekiyan) hain.\"" Is ki sanad Hasan hai. Tirmidhi aur Abu Dawood ne riwayat kiya."""""
"4645","maaz bn ans rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say asy mfhwm ky ayk hdys byan ky، anhwn nay mzyd kha kh phr ayk awr aadmy aaya awr khnay lga: alslam alykm wrhm allh wbrkath w mghfrth! rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: (as kay lyay) chalys (nykyan) hyn۔ awr frmaya: \fzyltyn aysy hyn۔\"" as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4646","abwamamh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: slam ky abtda krnay wala allh kay sb say zyadh qryb hay۔ shyh، asay ahmd، trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4647","Hazrat Jarir bin Abdullah (Radi Allahu Anhu) se rivayat hai ke Nabi-e-Kareem (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Sallam) kuch auraton ke paas se guzre aur aap ne unhein salam kiya. Yeh chain hasan hai. Ise Imam Ahmed ne rivayat kiya."
"4648","aly bn aby talb rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh jb lwgwn ka ayk grwh whan say gzrta hay tw an myn say ayk shkhs ka slam krna kafy hay awr jw bythay hwyay hyn an myn say ayk shkhs ka jwab dyna kafy hay۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn mrfwa kha hay۔ awr abwdaod nay as hdys kw byan krnay kay bad kha: hsn bn aly nay asay mrfwa kha hay awr wh abwdaod kay astad hyn۔ hsn kw byhqy nay shab alayman awr abwdaod myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4649","amrw bn shayb apnay wald say awr wh apnay dada say rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: js nay hmaray alawh ksy ky mshabht akhtyar ky wh hm myn say nhyn hay۔ yhwd w nsaryٰ ky mshabht nh krw kywnkh yhwd ka slam anglywn say asharh krna hay awr aysayywn ka slam hthylywn say asharh krna hay۔ (trmzy) awr frmaya: as ka slslh zayf hay۔ as ky snd zayf hay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4650","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say kwyy apnay (mslman) bhayy say mlay tw asay slam krna chahyay، agr an kay drmyan kwyy drkht، dywar ya pthr aa jayay awr wh dwbarh mlyn tw asay dwbarh slam krna chahyay۔ as ka slslh shyh hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4651","qtadh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm ksy ghr myn dakhl hw tw as kay bashndwn kw slam krw awr jb nklw tw as kay bashndwn kw slam say alwdaa krw۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn mrsl hdys qrar dya hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4652","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”byta! jb tm apnay ghr walwn kay pas jao tw an kw slam krna، (as trh) tm pr awr tmharay ghr walwn pr rhmtyn nazl hwn gy۔ as ky snd zayf hay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4653","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”phlay slam phyrw، phr bat krw۔ trmzy، awr frmaya: yh hdys mnkr hay۔ as ka slslh bht kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4654","amran bn hsyn rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn: zmanh jahlyt myn jb hm (ksy say) mltay thay tw khtay thay: allh tmhary aankh kw thnda rkhay، awr tm tazh dm awr khwsh hw kr bydar hw۔ jb aslam aaya tw hmyn as say mna kya gya۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4655","ghalb byan krtay hyn: hm hsn bsry rhm allh alyh kay drwazay pr bythay hwyay thay kh ayk aadmy aaya awr khnay lga: myray wald nay myray dada say rwayt ky hay، anhwn nay kha: myray wald nay mjhay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas bhyja awr kha: an kay pas jao awr myra slam khw۔ anhwn nay kha: myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas phncha awr kha: myray wald aap kw slam bhyjtay hyn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm pr awr tmharay wald pr slamty hw۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4656","abw alaaly bn hzrmy rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh alaa hzrmy rzy allh anh bhryn kay gwrnr thay jnhyn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mqrr kya tha awr jb wh aap kw khtwt lkhtay thay tw apnay nam say shrwa krtay thay۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4657","sydna jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say kwyy kht lkhay tw asay mty myn mla day، kywnkh aysa krnay say kam jldy awr aasany say hw jata hay۔ (trmzy) awr frmaya: yh hdys mnkr hay۔ as ka slslh bht kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4658","zyd bn sabt rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn hazr tha، aap kay samnay ayk katb tha۔ myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: \qlm apnay kan pr rkhw، kywnkh aysa krnay say mqsd awr ntyjh kw jld yad krnay myn mdd mlty hay۔\"" (trmzy) awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay awr as ky snd zayf hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4659","zyd bn sabt rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay shamy zban sykhnay ka hkm dya۔ ayk awr rwayt myn hay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh mjhay yhwdywn ka lkhna sykhna chahyay، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: mjhay yhwdywn kay lkhnay say dr lgta hay۔ zyd bn sabt rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay aadhay mhynay say bhy km wqt myn an ky zban sykh ly۔ jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm yhwdywn kw kht lkhtay tw myn anhyn lkhta awr jb wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw kht lkhtay tw myn aap sly allh alyh wslm kw an kay kht prh kr snata۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4660","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say kwyy mjls myn aayay tw slam kray، phr agr bythna chahay tw byth jayay، awr jb athnay kay lyay jayay tw slam kray، phlay (slam krnay ka) dwsray say zyadh hq nhyn۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4661","Abu Hurairah (RA) se rivayat hai ke Rasool Allah (SAW) ne farmaya: \Raston par baithne mein koi bhalaai aur faayda nahi"","" magar uske liye jo raasta bataye"","" salam ka jawab de"","" nigah niche kare"","" aur sawaar par boojh laadne mein madad kare.\"" Aur Abu Jurayy se jo hadith marwi hai wo \""Fazl e Sadqa\"" ke bab mein aayegi. Iski sanad bahut zaif hai; yeh Sharh al-Sunnah mein hai."""""
"4662","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb allh taalyٰ nay aadm alyh alslam kw pyda kya awr an myn rwh phwnky tw anhyn chhynk aayy awr kha alhmdllh (tmam taryfyn allh kay lyay hyn)، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay allh taalyٰ ky hmd w sna byan frmayy، tw allh taalyٰ nay frmaya: ”aay allh nay apnay rb ky hdayt pr frmaya: aay allh! aadm!' frshtwn kay as grwh kay pas jao jw bythay hwyay hyn awr an say khw: alslam alykm! tw wh gya awr kha: alslam alykm! anhwn nay jwab dya: 'walykm alslam wrhm allh!' phr wh apnay rb ky trf lwta، js nay kha: yh tmhara slam hay awr tmhary awlad ka aaps myn slam hay۔ allh nay asay hkm dya jb as kay dwnwn hath bnd thay: 'an myn say jsay chahw chn lw۔' as nay kha: 'myn nay apnay rb kay dahnay hath kw chn lya hay، awr myray rb kay dwnwn hath sydhay awr mbark hyn۔' phr allh nay apna dahna hath phylaya awr as myn aadm awr an ky awlad thy۔ as nay kha: aay rb! yh kwn hyn؟' as nay jwab dya: yh aap ky awlad hyn۔ hr ansan ky amr as ky aankhwn kay drmyan lkhy hwyy thy awr an myn ayk aysa shkhs bhy tha jw an myn sb say zyadh rwshn tha۔ as nay kha: aay rb! yh kwn hay؟' as nay jwab dya: 'yh aap ka byta daod hay awr myn nay as ky amr chalys sal lkhy hay۔' as nay kha: aay rb! as ky amr brhao۔' allh nay frmaya: 'yh why hay jw myn nay as kay lyay lkha hay۔' as nay kha: aay rb! myn nay asay apny amr say sath sal dyay hyn۔ allh nay frmaya: 'yh tmhara fyslh hay۔' rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: phr jb tk allh nay chaha jnt myn rhay، phr whan say ataray gyay، awr aadm alyh alslam apny amryn shmar krtay thay۔ jb mwt ka frshth as kay pas aaya tw as nay kha: tm jldy aagyay، kywnkh myry amr hzar sal lkhy gyy thy۔ as nay jwab dya: 'han، lykn aap nay apnay bytay daod alyh alslam kw sath sal dyyay۔' as nay ankar kya awr asy trh as ky awlad nay bhy ankar kya۔ awr wh bhwl gya tw as ky awlad bhy bhwl gyy۔' rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as dn say lkhnay awr gwahy dynay ka hkm dya gya۔“ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4663","asmaa bnt yzyd rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hmary awrtwn kay ayk grwh kay pas say gzray awr hmyn slam kya۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay abwdaod، abn majh awr aldarmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4664","tfyl bn aby bn kab rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh wh abn amr rzy allh anhma kay pas aaya krtay thay، wh sbh kay wqt an kay sath bazar jatay thay۔ rawy khtay hyn: jb hm bazar jatay tw abdallh bn amr rzy allh anhma hr as shkhs kw slam krtay jw whan say gzrtay، chhwtay karwbar krnay walay، maldar، ghryb awr kwyy awr۔ tfyl byan krtay hyn: ayk dn myn abdallh bn amr rzy allh anhma kay pas aaya tw anhwn nay mjh say kha kh bazar jao۔ myn nay as say kha: bazar myn kya krw gay؟ tm ksy khryd w frwkht pr nhyn rktay، nh ksy lyn dyn kay baray myn pwchhtay hw، nh qymt pwchhtay hw، nh bazar ky mhflwn myn bythtay hw۔ tw brah krm yhyn thhryn awr hmyn bat krnay dyn۔ rawy khtay hyn: abdallh bn amr rzy allh anhma nay mjh say kha: aay pyt walay! rawy khta hay: tfyl ka pyt bra tha۔ hm slam kay lyay jatay hyn (slam khna)؛ hm hr ayk kw slam krtay hyn js say hm mltay hyn۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay malk awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4665","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk aadmy nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn hazr hwa awr kha: myray bagh myn flan ka khjwr ka drkht hay awr as khjwr ky wjh say wh mjhay nqsan phnchata hay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an ky trf pygham bhyja kh apna khjwr ka drkht mjhay bych dw۔ as nay kha: nhyn، rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: phr yh mjhay thfay myn day dw۔ as nay kha: nhyn، rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: asay mjhay jnt myn khjwr kay ayk drkht kay bdlay bych dw۔ as nay kha: nhyn، tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn nay tm say zyadh bkhyl ksy kw nhyn dykha، swayay as kay jw slam myn bkhl krta hw۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay ahmd awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4666","Narrated by Abdullah (may Allah be pleased with him): The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \The one who initiates the greeting of peace is free from arrogance.\"" Narrated in Shu'ab al-Iman; chain is weak."""""
"4667","abwsayd khdry rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh abw mwsyٰ rzy allh anh hmaray pas aayay awr kha kh mjhay amr rzy allh anh nay apnay pas blaya، myn nay an kay drwazay pr aakr tyn bar slam kya، mjhay kwyy jwab nh mla tw myn waps aagya، aap nay mjhay (amr rzy allh anh) say rwka، aap nay pwchha: kya aap nay hmyn rwka؟ myn nay kha: myn nay aap kay drwazay pr tyn bar slam kya، lykn aap nay jwab nhyn dya، ps myn waps chla gya، kywnkh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay hkm dya tha: \jb tm myn say kwyy tyn bar ajazt tlb kray awr ajazt nh dy jayay tw wh waps lwt jayay، amr rzy allh anh nay kha: as ky dlyl pysh krw۔\"" abw sayd rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn an kay sath khra hwa awr amr rzy allh anh kay pas gya awr gwahy dy۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"""""
"4668","abdallh bn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjh say frmaya: ”tmhara mjh say ajazt tlb krna yh hay kh tm prdh athao awr myry njy batwn kw snw (tw andr aao) yhan tk kh myn tmhyn as say mna kr dwn۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4669","jabr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myn nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm kay pas apnay wald kay qrz kay baray myn hazr hwa، myn nay drwazh khtkhtaya۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kwn hay؟ myn nay jwab dya: \yh myn hwn۔\"" aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ’’myn hwn، yh myn hwn۔‘‘ gwya aap sly allh alyh wslm nay as kw napsnd kya۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"""""
"4670","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath ghr myn dakhl hwa tw aap kw ayk pyalay myn dwdh mla۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \abwhryrh! ahl sfh kay pas jao awr anhyn myray pas lay aao۔\"" myn an kay pas gya awr anhyn blaya۔ wh aayay awr (dakhl hwnay ky) ajazt chahy، tw aap nay anhyn ajazt day dy، ps wh andr dakhl hwgyay۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4671","kldh bn hnbl rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh sfwan bn amyh rzy allh anh nay (myray hath say) dwdh ya ayk phwnk awr ayk kkry nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn bhyjy، jb kh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm balayy alaqay myn thay۔ rawy khta hay: myn as kay pas gya lykn nh slam kya awr nh ajazt ly۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: waps jao awr khw: alslam alykm! kya myn andr aa skta hwn؟ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4672","sydna abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say ksy kw dawt dy jayay awr wh dawt dynay walay kay sath aayay tw yh as kay lyay ajazt hay۔ awr as ky rwayt myn mzkwr hay: \ayk aadmy ka dwsray aadmy kay pas rswl bhyjna khwd ajazt hay۔\"" zayf، asay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔ shyh، abwdaod nay rwayt ky hay۔"""""
"4673","Narrated by Abdullah bin Busr (may Allah be pleased with him): When the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) came to someone's door, he would not face the door directly, rather he would come to its right or left corner and say: \As-salamu Alaikum! As-salamu Alaikum!\"" Narrated by Abu Dawood; chain is Hasan. Narrated from Anas: The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \""As-salamu Alaikum wa Rahmatullah\"" is mentioned in the chapter of Hospitality."""""
"4674","ataa bn ysar rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh ayk aadmy nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say ayk maamlay kay baray myn pwchha: kya myn apny waldh (an kay pas jatay wqt) say ajazt lay lwn؟ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: han۔ aadmy nay kha: myn as kay sath ghr myn rhta hwn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: phr bhy as say ajazt lay lw۔ aadmy nay kha: myn as ka khadm hwn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: phr bhy ajazt lay lw، kya tm asay brhnh halt myn dykhna psnd krtay hw؟ as nay kha: nhyn، rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: phr as say ajazt lay lw۔ amam malk rhm allh alyh nay asay mrsl qrar dya hay۔ as ka slslh zayf hay، as myn kwyy rsalh nhyn، asay malk nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4675","aly rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh mjhay rat awr dn myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky zyart krnay ky ajazt thy۔ jb myn rat kw jata tw aap (sly allh alyh waalh wslm) myray lyay ( ajazt ky alamt kay twr pr ) khanstay thay۔ slslh zayf hay jsay nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4676","Narrated by Jabir (may Allah be pleased with him): The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \Do not grant permission to the one who does not begin with salam (greeting of peace) when seeking permission.\"" Narrated in Shu'ab al-Iman; chain is weak."""""
"4677","Narrated by Qatadah (may Allah have mercy on him): I asked Anas (may Allah be pleased with him): \Was there (the practice of) handshaking among the companions of the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him)?\"" He replied: \""Yes.\"" Narrated by al-Bukhari."""""
"4678","1.\nAbu Hurairah (radiyallahu anhu) rivayat karte hain ki Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ne Hasan bin Ali (radiyallahu anhuma) ko bosa liya. Us waqt Aqra’ bin Habis (radiyallahu anhu) bhi un ke saath maujood thay. Aqra’ (radiyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Mere das bache hain, aur maine un mein se kisi ko bosa nahi liya. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ne un ki taraf (hairani se) dekha, phir farmaya: “Jo reham nahi karta, us par reham nahi kiya jayega.” Muta’faqun alaih. Aur Abu Hurairah (radiyallahu anhu) se riwayat kardah hadees: ((A-thamma Luka‘)) insha’Allah, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wa sallam) ke Ahl-e-Bait ki fazilat ke baab mein zikr ki jayegi. Jabke Umm Hani (radiyallahu anha) se riwayat kardah hadees tahaffuz ke baab mein zikr ki ja chuki hai."
"4679","braa bn aazb rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb dw mslman aaps myn mltay hyn awr msafhh krtay hyn tw jda hwnay say phlay anhyn maaf kr dya jata hay۔ (ahmd، trmzy، abn majh)۔ awr abw daod ky rwayt myn hay: \jb dw mslman mlyn awr msafhh kryn، allh ky hmd w sna kryn، awr as say astghfar kryn، tw an ky bkhshsh hw jaty hay۔\"" as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay ahmd، trmzy، abn majh awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4680","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh ayk aadmy nay pwchha ya rswl allh jb hm myn say kwyy apnay bhayy ya as kay dwst say mlay tw kya as kay aagay sr jhkana chahyay؟ as nay jwab dya kh nhyn۔ as nay pwchha kya wh asay glay lga kr bwsh day؟ as nay jwab dya kh nhyn۔ as nay pwchha kh kya wh as ka hath lay kr as say msafhh kray؟ as nay jwab dya kh han۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4681","Narrated by Abu Umamah (may Allah be pleased with him): The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \Visiting a sick person is fulfilled in such a way that one of you places his hand on the patient’s forehead or on his hand and asks him: 'How are you?' And your complete greeting among yourselves is to exchange salutations and shake hands.\"" Narrated by Ahmad"","" Tirmidhi; chain is weak."""""
"4682","aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh zyd bn harsh rzy allh anh mdynh mnwrh tshryf layay jbkh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm myray ghr myn mwjwd thay۔ wh aap kay pas aaya awr drwazay pr dstk dy۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm shdyd mhbt myn bghyr qmys kay apna kpra ghsyttay hwyay as ky trf brhay۔ allh ky qsm! myn nay aap kw as say phlay ya as kay bad kbhy qmyz kay bghyr nhyn dykha tha۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay glay lgaya awr bwsh dya۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4683","aywb bn bshyr qbylh anzh kay ayk shkhs say rwayt krtay hyn kh anhwn nay kha: myn nay abwzr rzy allh anh say pwchha: jb aap rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say mltay thay tw kya aap sly allh alyh wslm aap say msafhh krtay thay؟ as nay jwab dya: myn jb bhy an say mla tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjh say msafhh kya۔ ayk dn as nay mjhay blaya lykn myn ghr pr nhyn tha۔ jb myn aaya tw mjhay atlaa dy gyy tw myn nay apnay aap kw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay samnay pysh kya jb aap sly allh alyh wslm ayk charpayy pr bythay hwyay thay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay glay lgaya۔ yh (glay lgana) bht achha tha، bht achha۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4684","2.\nIkrimah bin Abi Jahl (radiyallahu anhu) rivayat karte hain: Jis din main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas Islam par bai’at karne aaya, to Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Muhajir sawaar ka khush amdeed hai.\"" Is ki sanad za’eef hai"","" Tirmidhi ne rivayat kiya hai."""""
"4685","asyd bn hzyr rzy allh anh ka talq ansar kay ayk qbylh say tha۔ wh byan krtay hyn: ayk dn wh lwgwn say batyn kr rhay thay، an ky tbyat mzahyh thy، awr wh apny batwn say anhyn hnsata tha۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay asay chhry say phlw myn thwns dya۔ as nay kha: mjhay bdlh lynay dw۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”antqam lay lw۔ as nay kha: tm qmys phntay hw jbkh myn qmys nhyn phnta۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay apny qmys athayy، tw myn nay aap kw glay lgaya awr aap sly allh alyh wslm kay phlw kw chwmnay lga، awr arz kya: ya rswl allh! myn yhy chahta tha۔ shyh، abw daod nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"4686","shaby rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay jafr bn aby talb rzy allh anh ka astqbal kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn glay lgaya awr an ky aankhwn kay drmyan bwsh dya۔ abwdaod، byhqy، shab alayman (mrsl) myn۔ mshkw kay baz nskhwn awr shrh alsn myn yh slslh albyazy kay zryaay mrbwt hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay abwdaod awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4687","Ja'far bin Abi Talib (RA) se rivayat hai, mulk Habsha se wapasi ke waqya ke mutalliq, unhone kaha: Jab hum Madinah pahunche to Rasool Allah (SAW) ne mera istiqbal kiya aur mujhse mulaqaat ki, phir farmaya: \Mujhe nahi pata ke main Khaiber ki fatah par zyada khush hun ya Ja'far ki aamad par.\"" Ittifaqan unki aamad Khaiber ki fatah ke din hui thi. Zaif"","" Sharh al-Sunnah mein rivayat hai."""""
"4688","zry rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh wh abdalqys kay wfd myn shaml thay: jb hm mdynh mnwrh phnchay tw apny swarywn say jldy say atray awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay hath paon chwmay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay abw daod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4689","Aisha (RA) rivayat karti hain: Mainne Rasool Allah (SAW) se zyada kisi ko aap (SAW) ki seedh (chalne ka tareeqa), khaslat, aur surat mein, ek riwayat mein, guftaar mein, Fatimah (RA) se milta julta nahi dekha. Jab wo aap ke paas aati thin to Nabi (SAW) unke istiqbal mein khade ho jate, unka haath pakadte, (mather par) chumte aur apni jagah bitha dete. Aur jab aap (SAW) unke paas jate to wo bhi aap ke istiqbal mein khadi ho jati thin, aap ka haath pakadti thin, aap ko chumti thin aur apni jagah bitha deti thin. Sahih, Abu Dawood ne rivayat kiya."
"4690","3.\nBara’ (radiyallahu anhu) rivayat karte hain: (Ek ghazwa se wapasi par) sab se pehle main aur Abu Bakr (radiyallahu anhu) Madinah pahunchay, aur un ki beti Aisha (radiyallahu anha) bimaar thi aur bukhaar mein letee hui thin. Abu Bakr (radiyallahu anhu) un ke paas aaye aur kaha: “Pyaari beti! Kaisi ho?” Aur un ke gaal par bosa liya. Is ki sanad saheeh hai. Abu Dawood ne rivayat kiya hai."
"4691","Narrated by Aisha (may Allah be pleased with her): The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) kissed a child and said: \Listen! These (children) are a cause of stinginess and cowardice"","" and indeed they are a gift from Allah.\"" Narrated in Sharh al-Sunnah; chain is weak."""""
"4692","4.\nYala (radiyallahu anhu) rivayat karte hain ki Hasan aur Husayn (radiyallahu anhuma) Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf tezi se daudte huye aaye, to aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un dono ko gale laga liya aur farmaya: \Beshak bache bukhl aur buzdili ka baais hote hain.\"" Is ki sanad Hasan hai. Ahmad ne rivayat kiya hai."""""
"4693","ataa khrasany rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh waalh wslm nay frmaya: aaps myn msafhh krw، as say bghz khtm hw jata hay، ayk dwsray kw thfay dw، tmharay drmyan mhbt pyda hw jayay gy awr dshmny awr kynh khtm hw jayay ga۔ amam malk nay asay mrsl rwayt kya hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ malk nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"4694","braa bn aazb rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay zhr ky nmaz ky char rkatyn zhr say phlay ada ky tw gwya as nay shb qdr ky yh rkatyn ada kyn، awr jb dw mslman msafhh krtay hyn tw sb gr jatay hyn“۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4695","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh jb bnw qryzh nay sad rzy allh anh kay fyslay kw qbwl krnay pr rzamndy zahr ky tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an kay pas ksy kw bhyja، wh qryb hy tha۔ chnanchh wh gdhay pr swar hw kr aaya awr jb msjd kay qryb phncha tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ansar say frmaya: apnay srdar kay lyay khray hw jao۔ pr atfaq hwa۔ awr yh hdys asyrwn kay hkm kay bab myn pwry trh byan hwchky hay۔"
"4696","sydna abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kwyy aadmy ksy dwsray aadmy kw apny jgh say nh athayay kh wh whan byth jayay، blkh ayk dwsray kw jgh dyn awr jgh dyn۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4697","sydna abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs apny jgh say atha awr phr as ky trf lwt gya tw wh as jgh ka zyadh hqdar hay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4698","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh shabh kram rzy allh anhm kw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say zyadh mhbwb kwyy shkhs nh tha، phr bhy jb wh aap sly allh alyh wslm kw dykhtay tw khray nh hwtay، kywnkh wh jantay thay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm asay napsnd krtay thay۔ awr frmaya: yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔ shyh، trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4699","maawyh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs yh psnd kray kh lwg as kay samnay khray hwn tw asay chahyay kh apna thkanh jhnm myn bnayay“۔ hsn، asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4700","abwamamh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm asa pr tyk lgayay bahr tshryf layay tw hm aap kay lyay khray hw gyay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \as trh nh khray hw js trh ajmy ayk dwsray ky tazym kay lyay khray hwtay hyn۔\"" as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4701","sayd bn abwalhsn rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh abwbkrh rzy allh anh hmaray pas ayk gwahy kay slslay myn tshryf layay tw ayk aadmy an ky tazym kay lyay khra hwa۔ as nay whan bythnay say ankar kr dya awr kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as say mna frmaya hay awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as bat say bhy mna frmaya hay kh kwyy shkhs ksy dwsray kay kpray say apna hath pwnchhay jw as nay apnay awpr nh phna hw۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4702","abw drdaa rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm bythtay tw hm aap kay grd byth jatay۔ phr jb aap sly allh alyh wslm khray hwtay awr wapsy ka aradh krtay tw apny jwty atar dytay ya apny kwyy chyz whan rkh dytay js say shabh smjh jatay (kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm waps aa jayyn gay) awr wh whyn bythay rhtay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4703","abdallh bn amrw rzy allh anh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ksy aadmy kay lyay jayz nhyn kh wh dw aadmywn kw an ky ajazt kay bghyr alg kr day (awr an kay drmyan byth jayay)“۔ as ka slslh achha hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4704","amrw bn shayb apnay wald say awr wh apnay dada say rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: dw aadmywn kay drmyan an ky ajazt kay bghyr nh bythw۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4705","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hmaray sath msjd myn bythtay awr hm say gftgw krtay، jb aap khray hwtay tw hm dyr tk khray rhtay yhan tk kh hm nay dykha kh aap sly allh alyh wslm apny ksy shryf bywy kay ghr myn dakhl hwyay hyn۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4706","waslh bn khtab rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh ayk aadmy rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya jb aap msjd myn bythay hwyay thay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm as kay lyay apny jgh say ht gyay۔ as aadmy nay kha ya rswl allh! kafy jgh hay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk mslman ka yh hq hay kh jb as ka bhayy asay dykhay tw as kay lyay (thwra) hrkt kray۔ amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn dwnwn hdysyn zkr ky hyn۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4707","abn amr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw dykha kh aap shn kabh myn apnay dwnwn hath ghtnwn myn lptay hwyay thay۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4708","abadh bn tmym apnay chcha say rwayt krtay hyn، anhwn nay kha: myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw msjd myn apny pyth kay bl lytay hwyay dykha، aap ky ayk tang dwsry pr rkhy hwyy thy۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4709","jabr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay aadmy kw mna frmaya kh wh apny pyth kay bl lyt jayay awr ayk tang dwsry pr rkhay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4710","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm myn say kwyy apny pyth kay bl nh lytay awr ayk paon dwsray pr nh rkhay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4711","Narrated by Abu Huraira (may Allah be pleased with him): The Messenger of Allah said: \Once a man"","" dressed in a suit"","" was walking arrogantly"","" and his soul had made him conceited. He was caused to sink into the earth"","" and he will continue descending until the Day of Resurrection.\"""""""
"4712","jabr bn smrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw dykha kh aap bayyn janb tkyay pr tyk lgayay hwyay thay۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4713","Narrated by Abu Saeed Khudri (may Allah be pleased with him): When the Messenger of Allah would sit in the mosque, he would clasp his hands together. Narrated by Razeen; chain is weak."
"4714","Qilah bint Makhramah (RA) rivayat karti hain ke unhone Rasool Allah (SAW) ko masjid mein qurfusaa' (paniyon ke bal baith kar apne baazuo se pindliyaa'n gher li hui) ki halat mein baitha hua dekha. Wo kehti hain, jab mainne Rasool Allah (SAW) ko aajizi aur inkeshari ki halat mein dekha to main dar se larzane lagi. Iski sanad zaif hai. Abu Dawood ne rivayat kiya."
"4715","jabr bn smrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm jb fjr ky nmaz prhtay tw apny jgh pr tangyn lgayay bythay rhtay، yhan tk kh swrj achhy trh tlwa hw jata۔ shyh، abw daod nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"4716","hzrt abw qtadh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm jb rat kw khymh lgatay tw apnay dayyn krwt pr lyt jatay awr jb sbh say kchh dyr phlay prao daltay tw apny khny kw shara dytay awr apna sr apny hthyly pr rkhtay۔ shyh، shrh alsnn myn rwayt hay۔"
"4717","am slmh rzy allh anha kay khandan myn say ksy nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka bstr srf as kpray kay brabr tha js myn ksy myt kw qbr myn rkha jata hay، awr msjd (baz nay kha: nmaz ky chtayy) aap kay sr kay qryb thy۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4718","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk aadmy kw msjd myn pyt kay bl lyta dykha tw frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ kw yh jhwt psnd nhyn hay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay jsay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4719","ysh bn tkhfh bn qys ghfary apnay wald say rwayt krtay hyn jw ahl sfh myn say thay۔ as nay kha: myn apnay synay myn drd ky wjh say pyt kay bl lyta hwa tha kh achank ayk aadmy nay mjhay apnay paon say ttwlna shrwa kr dya awr kha: as trh jhwt bwlnay say allh taalyٰ naraz hwta hay۔ myn nay dykha tw yh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm thay۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4720","Ali bin Shiban (RA) rivayat karte hain ke Rasool Allah (SAW) ne farmaya: \Jo shaks raat ko ghar ki chhat par bagair kisi rukawat (chhat par)"","" aur ek riwayat mein"","" bagair patthar ke soye"","" to (hifazat ki) zimmedari us se door ho gayi.\"" Abu Dawood aur Ma'alim as-Sunan mein Al-Khattabi ne ((Hajji)) ka lafz naqal kiya hai. Hasan"","" Abu Dawood ne rivayat kiya."""""
"4721","jabr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ksy shkhs kw aysy chht pr swnay say mna frmaya js pr kwyy rkawt nh hw۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4722","hzyfh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh jw shkhs mjls kay drmyan bytha as pr mhmd sly allh alyh wslm ky zban pr lant hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4723","Narrated by Abu Sa'id al-Khudri (may Allah be pleased with him): The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \The best gathering is the one which is spacious.\"" Narrated by Abu Dawood; chain is Hasan."""""
"4724","jabr bn smrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm tshryf layay awr aap kay bzrg shabh rzy allh anhm bythay hwyay thay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya wjh hay kh myn tmhyn alg bytha dykh rha hwn؟ shyh، abw daod nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"4725","sydna abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say kwyy sayh myn hw tw (sayh) as say ht jata hay awr as kay jsm ka kchh hsh dhwp myn awr kchh sayh myn hwta hay، phr asay chahyay kh (whan say) athay۔ hsn، abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4726","5.\nSharh al-Sunnah mein Abu Hurairah (radiyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ki Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se koi shakhs saaye mein ho aur saaya us se hat jaye"","" to woh shakhs wahan se uth jaye"","" kyunki woh shaitaan ka ikattha hone ki jagah hai.\"" Mu’ammar ne isi tarah mawquf riwayat kiya hai. Is ki sanad za’eef hai. Sharh al-Sunnah mein rivayat kiya gaya."""""
"4727","abw sayd alansary rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh jb aap msjd say nkl rhay thay tw rastay myn mrd awrtwn say ghl ml gyay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay awrtwn say frmaya: ”srk kay knaray chlw، tmhyn srk kay bych myn chlnay ka kwyy hq nhyn، lhza srk kay knarwn pr chlw۔ tw (yh hkm sn kr) wh awrt chlty hwyy dywar kay as qdr qryb jaty kh as ka lbas dywar say chpk jata۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4728","sydna abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mrd kw dw awrtwn kay drmyan chlnay say mna frmaya۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4729","Jabir bin Samurah (may Allah be pleased with him) reports: When we would present ourselves before the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), each one of us would sit wherever he found a place. Chain is weak, narrated by Abu Dawood. And two hadiths narrated from Abdullah bin Amr (may Allah be pleased with him) have been mentioned in the chapter on Standing, and two hadiths narrated from Ali and Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with them) we will mention, if Allah wills, in the chapter on the Names and Attributes of the Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him)."
"4730","amrw bn shwryd apnay wald say rwayt krtay hyn، anhwn nay kha: myn as trh bytha hwa tha kh myn nay apna bayan hath apny pyth kay pychhay rkha hwa tha awr apnay dayyn hath kay angwthay ky bnyad pr gwsht pr tyk lgayay hwyay tha۔ asy halt myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm myray pas say gzray awr frmaya: kya tm an lwgwn ky trh bythtay hw jn pr ghzb nazl hwa (yany yhwd)؟ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4731","abwzr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm myray pas say gzray jb myn pyt kay bl lyta tha۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay apnay paon say dhka dya awr frmaya: \jndb! yh jhnmy jhwt bwltay hyn۔\"" shyh، abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4732","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk allh taalyٰ chhynk kw psnd krta hay awr jmayy kw napsnd krta hay، jb tm myn say ksy kw chhynk aayay awr alhmdllh khay، tw hr as mslman pr wajb hay kh wh allh taalyٰ kw slam kray۔ tm pr rhm kya jayay tw yh shytan ky trf say hay، jb tm myn say ksy kw jmayy aaty hay tw wh asay rwknay ky pwry kwshsh kray، kywnkh jb tm myn say kwyy jmayy lyta hay tw shytan as pr hnsta hay۔\ (bkhary) awr shyh mslm ky rwayt myn hay: \""kywnkh jb tm myn say kwyy jmayy lytay hwyay aawaz nkalta hay tw shytan as pr hnsta hay۔\"" asay bkhary w mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4733","Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \When any one of you sneezes"","" he should say 'Alhamdulillah' (All praise is due to Allah)"","" and his (Muslim) brother or companion should say to him 'Yarhamukallah' (May Allah have mercy on you). When he says to him 'Yarhamukallah'"","" then (the one who sneezed) should say: 'May Allah guide you and set your condition right.'\"" Narrated by al-Bukhari."""""
"4734","Anas (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates: Two men sneezed in the presence of the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him). He responded to the sneeze of one of them but did not say anything to the other. The latter said, \O Messenger of Allah! You prayed for him but did not pray for me.\"" The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \""Because he said 'Alhamdulillah' (All praise is due to Allah)"","" but you did not say 'Alhamdulillah'.\"" Agreed upon."""""
"4735","Abu Musa (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) say: \When one of you sneezes and says 'Alhamdulillah' (All praise is due to Allah)"","" then you should supplicate for him. But if he does not say 'Alhamdulillah'"","" then do not supplicate for him.\"" Narrated by Muslim."""""
"4736","slmh bn akwa rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh ayk aadmy kw aap kay samnay chhynk aayy، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay as say frmaya: ” allh tm pr rhm kray۔ phr as aadmy kw dwsry bar chhynk aayy tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as aadmy kw zkam hay۔ awr trmzy ky rwayt myn hay kh jb asay tysry bar chhynk aayy tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: asay zkam hay۔ asay mslm awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4737","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say ksy kw jmayy aayay tw apna hath apnay mnh pr rkhay، kywnkh shytan (mnh myn) dakhl hw jata hay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4738","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw jb chhynk aaty thy tw apnay hath ya kpray say chhrh dhanp lytay thay awr as say apny aawaz kw pst krtay thay۔ trmzy، abwdaod awr amam trmzy nay kha: yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔ as ky snd hsn hay jsay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4739","sydna abw aywb rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say ksy kw chhynk aayay tw wh khay: hr hal myn tmam taryfyn allh kay lyay hyn، awr jw as ky bat ka jwab day asay yh khna chahyay: allh tjh pr rhm kray، awr wh (js kw chhynk aayay، allh taalyٰ aap kw hdayt day) khay: as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4740","abwmwsyٰ rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh yhwdy rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas as amyd say chhynk lytay thay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm an say khyn gay: allh tm pr rhm kray۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm frmaya krtay thay: \allh tmhyn hdayt day awr tmharay maamlat drst kray۔\"" as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4741","hlal bn ysaf khtay hyn kh hm slym bn abyd kay sath thay kh lwgwn myn say ayk aadmy kw chhynk aayy awr kha: alslam alykm! (yh sn kr) slym nay kha: tm pr awr tmhary man pr۔ aysa lgta tha kh as shkhs nay apnay dl myn kchh narazgy mhsws ky۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: snw، myn nay tm say why kha hay jw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya tha۔ (ayk dfah) ayk aadmy kw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky bargah myn chhynk aayy awr kha: alslam alykm! aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \tm pr awr tmhary man pr۔\"" (phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya:) jb tm myn say ksy kw chhynk aayay tw wh khay: ((alhmdllh rb alaalmyn))، awr jw as ky bat ka jwab day wh khay: ((yrhmk allh))، awr phr khay: allh mjhay awr tmhary mghfrt frmayay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4742","abyd bn rfaah rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tyn bar chhynknay walay ky daa ka jwab dw، agr as say zyadh chhynk aayay tw tm chahw tw asay jwab dw، awr agr chahw tw jwab nh dw“۔ abwdaod، trmzy، awr anhwn nay kha: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay abwdaod awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4743","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh apnay (mslman) bhayy kay lyay (as ky chhynk kay jwab myn) tyn mrtbh daa kya krw، agr chhynk zyadh hw jayay tw yh zkam hay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔ awr (rawy) sayd mqbwry nay kha: myn an kay baray myn srf atna janta hwn kh anhwn nay hdys kw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say mrfwa qrar dya hay۔"
"4744","nafa rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh ayk aadmy kw abn amr rzy allh anh kay pas chhynk aayy awr kha: tmam taryfyn allh kay lyay hyn، awr allh kay rswl sly allh alyh wslm pr slam hw۔ (yh sn kr) abn amr rzy allh anh nay kha: myn bhy khta hwn: tmam taryfyn allh kay lyay hyn، awr slam hw allh kay rswl sly allh alyh wslm pr۔ lykn as trh khna qaym nhyn hay۔ allh kay rswl sly allh alyh wslm nay hmyn yh khna skhaya kh: tmam taryfyn hr hal myn allh kay lyay hyn۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4745","aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw kbhy as qdr hnstay hwyay nhyn dykha kh myn aap kay glay ka byzh dykh skwn۔ wh srf mskrayay ga. asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4746","jryr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh jb say myn nay aslam qbwl kya hay، rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay (apny mjls myn aanay say) kbhy nhyn rwka، awr jb bhy mjhay dykhtay، mskratay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4747","Jabir bin Samurah, may Allah be pleased with him, narrates that the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him, would not rise from the place where he had performed prayer until the sun had risen. And when the sun had risen, he would stand up, and (during this time) the noble Companions, may Allah be pleased with them, would converse and discuss matters from the days of ignorance and would laugh, while the Prophet, peace and blessings be upon him, would only smile. And in the narration of Tirmidhi: they would recite poetry. Narrated by Muslim and Tirmidhi."
"4748","abdallh bn hars bn jaz rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say zyadh mskratay hwyay ksy kw nhyn dykha۔ as ky snd zayf hay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4749","Qatadah (may Allah have mercy on him) narrates: Ibn Umar (may Allah be pleased with him) was asked: Did the companions of the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) use to laugh? He replied: Yes! And the faith in their hearts was greater than a mountain. And Bilal bin Sa’d (may Allah have mercy on him) narrates: They used to practice archery and would laugh looking at each other, and when night fell, they would become monks (i.e., ascetics), engaging in the worship of Allah. Weak, narrated in Sharh al-Sunnah."
"4750","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm bazar myn thay kh ayk aadmy nay aawaz dy: abwalqasm! jb aap sly allh alyh wslm as ky trf mtwjh hwyay tw as aadmy nay kha kh myn asay (ksy awr kw) bla rha tha۔ phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myray nam kay sath apna nam rkhw lykn myry knyt nh lw“۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4751","sydna jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myray nam pr apna nam rkhw، lykn myry knyt nh lw، kywnkh mjhay qasm bnaya gya hay، myn tm myn tqsym krta hwn۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4752","abn amr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tmharay namwn myn say abdallh awr abdalrhmn allh kay nzdyk sb say zyadh mhbwb hyn۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4753","smrh bn jndb rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”apnay ghlam (bchay ya ghlam) ka nam ysar (aasany)، rbah (nfa)، njyh (kamyab) awr aflh (khwshhal) nh rkhw، kywnkh tm khw gay: kya wh yhan hay؟ agr wh whan nhyn hay tw pwchhnay wala khay ga: wh yhan nhyn hay۔\ awr as ky rwayt myn yh zkr hay: aap nay frmaya: \""apnay ghlam ka nam rbah، ysar، aflh awr nafa nh rkhw۔\"" asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4754","jabr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay yalyٰ، brk، aflh، ysar، nafa awr an jysay namwn kay sath nam rkhnay say mna frmaya۔ phr myn nay dykha kh bad myn aap sly allh alyh wslm nay as pr khamwshy akhtyar ky، phr aap sly allh alyh wslm ka antqal hw gya awr as say mna nhyn frmaya۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4755","Abu Huraira (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \On the Day of Resurrection"","" the most detestable name in the sight of Allah will be that of a person who is called 'Shahanshah' (King of Kings).\"" (Bukhari) And in the narration of Muslim"","" it is stated: \""On the Day of Resurrection"","" the person who will be most anger-provoking and have the most wicked name in the sight of Allah will be the one whose name is 'Shahanshah"",""' whereas only Allah is the Shahanshah.\"" (Agreed upon)"""""
"4756","zynb bnt aby slmh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh myra nam brh rkha gya tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: apny taryf nh krw، allh khwb janta hay kh tm myn say kwn salh hay، as ka nam zynb rkhw۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4757","abn abas rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn: jwyryh rzy allh anha ka nam brh tha۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an ka nam bdl kr jwyryh rkha awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay yh napsnd frmaya kh yh kha jayay kh wh brh say chly gyy hyn۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4758","It is narrated from Ibn Umar (may Allah be pleased with him) that a daughter of Umar (may Allah be pleased with him) was called Asiyah. The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) changed her name to Jameelah. Narrated by Muslim."
"4759","Sahl bin Sa’d (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates: When Mundhir bin Abi Usaid was born, he was brought to the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him). The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) placed him on his thigh and asked, “What is his name?” He said: So-and-so. The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said, “No, rather his name is Mundhir.” Agreed upon."
"4760","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm myn say kwyy yh nh khay: myra lwndy، myry lwndy، kywnkh tm sb allh kay bnday awr bnday hw، awr tmhary tmam awrtyn lwndy hyn، tm allh ky lrkyan khw۔ awr bndh yh nh khay kh aay myray rb! blkh wh khay: 'myra aaqa'۔\ dwsry rwayt myn hay: wh khay: 'myra srdar، myra srprst۔' ayk dwsry rwayt myn hay: \""ghlam apnay aaqa say yh nh khay: myra mwlyٰ، kywnkh tmhara wly allh hay۔\"" asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4761","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” (angwr) kw ”krm“ nh khw، kywnkh ”krm“ mwmn ka dl hay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4762","awr mslm myn wayl bn hjr rzy allh anh say mrwy hdys myn hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ’’krm‘‘ nh khw، blkh ’’anab‘‘ awr ’’hblh‘‘ (angwr) khw۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4763","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” angwr kw krm nh khw awr wqt kw bra nh khw، kywnkh allh taalyٰ khwd wqt hay۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4764","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm myn say kwyy shkhs wqt kay baray myn bra nh khay، kywnkh allh taalyٰ khwd wqt hay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4765","am almomnyn aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm myn say kwyy yh nh khay kh myra nfs napak hw gya hay، blkh wh khay: myry jan bwjhl hw gyy hay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔ awr abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh abn aadm mjhay tklyf dyta hay۔ ayman kay bab myn phlay hy zkr hw chka hay۔"
"4766","shryh bn hany apnay wald say rwayt krtay hyn kh jb wh apny qwm kay sath rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay tw aap nay anhyn apnay wald kw abw alhkm kay nam say pkartay hwyay sna۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay asay blaya awr frmaya: bay shk allh hy mnsf hay، awr fyslh srf asy ka hay، tmhyn abw alhkm ka lqb kywn dya gya؟ as nay kha: jb myry qwm myn ksy bat pr akhtlaf hwta hay tw wh myray pas aatay hyn awr myn an kay drmyan fyslh krta hwn awr dwnwn fryq myray fyslay pr razy hyn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: yh ktny achhy bat hay، tmharay ktnay bchay hyn؟ aap nay frmaya: shwryh، mslm awr abdallh۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: an myn sb say bra kwn hay؟ rawy khtay hyn: myn nay kha: swryh۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm abw shryh hw۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4767","msrwq khtay hyn kh myn amr rzy allh anh say mla tw anhwn nay kha: tm kwn hw؟ myn nay kha: msrwq bn ajdh۔ amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: ajdh shytan ka (nam) hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4768","abw drdaa rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt kay dn tmhyn tmharay namwn awr tmharay bapwn kay namwn say pkara jayay ga، lhza achhay nam rkhw“۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4769","It is narrated from Abu Hurairah, may Allah be pleased with him, that the Prophet, peace and blessings be upon him, forbade that anyone should combine his name and his kunyah in such a way as to name himself Muhammad Abu al-Qasim. Sahih, narrated by al-Tirmidhi."
"4770","sydna jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm (ksy ka) nam myray nam kay sath rkhw tw myry knyt kw knyt nh krw۔ awr amam trmzy khtay hyn: yh hdys ghryb hay، awr abwdaod ky rwayt myn hay: jw shkhs myray nam kay sath (ksy ka) nam rkhay wh myry knyt nh rkhay awr jw myry knyt astamal kray wh myray nam kay sath (ksy ka) nam nh rkhay۔ shyh، asay trmzy، abn majh awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4771","sydh aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh ayk awrt nay kha: ya rswl allh! myray han ayk bchh pyda hwa hay awr myn nay as ka nam mhmd rkha hay awr knyt abw alqasm rkhy hay، lykn myn nay sna hay kh aap kw yh napsnd hay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: wh kwn hay js nay myray nam kw hlal awr myry knyt kw hram kya ya kwn hay js nay myry knyt kw hram awr myray nam kw hlal kya؟ abwdaod awr mhy alsn rhmh allh khtay hyn: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4772","mhmd bn hnfyh apnay wald say rwayt krtay hyn، anhwn nay kha: myn nay pwchha، ya rswl allh! btao agr tmharay bad myray han kwyy bchh pyda hw tw kya myn as ka nam tmharay nam pr rkhwn awr asay tmhary knyt dwn؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: han۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4773","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn ayk bwty chnta tha، tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay as ky wjh say knyh (abw hmzh) ata frmayy۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay، awr anhwn nay kha: hm as hdys kw srf asy rastay say jantay hyn، awr msbah myn hay kh anhwn nay asay shyh qrar dya۔ as ka slslh bht kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4774","aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm bray nam bdl dya krtay thay۔ shyh، trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4775","bshyr bn mymwn apnay chcha asamh bn akhdry say rwayt krtay hyn kh asrm namy ayk shkhs an lwgwn myn say tha jw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay pwchha: tmhara nam kya hay؟ as nay jwab dya: asram۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: nhyn، blkh tm zra hw۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4776","awr abw daod khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay aas، azyz، atlh، shytan، hkm، ghrab، hbab awr shhab kay nam bdl dyay awr frmaya: myn nay akhtsar ky wjh say an ky rwaytwn ka zkr nhyn kya۔ shyh، abwdaod nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"4777","abw msawd ansary rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh ya tw anhwn nay abw abdallh say kha ya abw abdallh nay abw msawd rzy allh anh say kha: tm nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw lfz \zmw\"" (wh dawyٰ krtay hyn) kay baray myn kya frmatay sna hay؟ anhwn nay kha kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna hay kh aadmy kay lyay as trh ky bat krna bra hay۔ abwdaod، awr anhwn nay kha: abw abdallh say mrad hzyfh hay۔ shyh، abw daod nay rwayt ky hay۔"""""
"4778","Hudhayfah (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates from the Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him), he (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \Do not say: 'Whatever Allah wills and so-and-so wills"",""' but rather say: 'Whatever Allah wills"","" then so-and-so wills.'\"" Its chain is authentic; narrated by Ahmad and Abu Dawood."""""
"4779","And in a disconnected narration, it is stated: \Do not say: Whatever Allah wills and whatever Muhammad (peace and blessings be upon him) wills"","" but rather say: Whatever Allah alone wills.\"" Hasan"","" narrated in Sharh al-Sunnah."""""
"4780","Hudhayfah (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates from the Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him), he (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \Do not call a hypocrite 'Sayyid' (master)"","" because if he is a Sayyid (leader"","" master)"","" then you have angered your Lord.\"" Its chain is weak"","" narrated by Abu Dawood."""""
"4781","abdalhmyd bn jbyr bn shybh byan krtay hyn kh myn sayd bn msyb kay pas bytha hwa tha kh anhwn nay mjh say ayk hdys byan ky kh an kay dada hzn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay pwchha tmhara nam kya hay؟ as nay jwab dya myra nam hzn hay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya (nhyn) blkh tm shl hw۔ anhwn nay kha kh myn apnay wald ka dya hwa nam nhyn bdlwn ga۔ abn msyb nay kha: as kay bad hmaray drmyan skhty baqy rhy۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4782","abw whb aljshmy rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”anbyaa kay namwn pr apnay nam rkhw، allh kay nzdyk sb say zyadh pyaray nam abdallh awr abdalrhmn hyn، schay nam hars awr hmam hyn، jb kh sb say mkrwh nam hrb awr mrh hyn۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4783","abn amr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn: dw aadmy mshrq say aayay awr (lwgwn say) khtab kya۔ lwg an ky tqryr pr hyran rh gyay، tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk baz batwn myn jadw ka asr hwta hay۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4784","Ubayy bin Ka'b (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \Indeed"","" some poetry contains wisdom.\"" Narrated by al-Bukhari."""""
"4785","abn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw lwg pyar say bat krtay hyn wh hlak hw gyay۔ yh bat anhwn nay tyn bar khy۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4786","Abu Huraira (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \The most truthful statement ever uttered by a poet is the saying of Labid: Behold! Everything except Allah is perishable.\"" Agreed upon."""""
"4787","amrw bn shryd apnay wald say rwayt krtay hyn، anhwn nay kha: myn ayk dn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pychhay swar tha۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya tmhyn amyh bn aby slt ka kwyy shar yad hay؟ myn nay jwab dya: han! aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: asay prhw! myn nay asay ayk aayt prh kr snayy۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: zyadh prhw! phr myn nay asay ayk awr aayt prh kr snayy۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: zyadh prhw! yhan tk kh myn nay asay sw aayat prh kr snayyn۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4788","It is narrated from Jundub (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) was participating in a battle when blood started to flow from his finger. The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \It is only a finger that has bled"","" and whatever pain you have suffered is in the way of Allah.\"" Agreed upon."""""
"4789","Bara’ (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates: On the day of (the siege of) Banu Qurayzah, the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said to Hassan bin Thabit (may Allah be pleased with him): “Satirize the polytheists, Allah (and His help) is with you.” And the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) was saying to Hassan (may Allah be pleased with him): “Respond on my behalf, O Allah! Help him through Jibreel (peace be upon him).” Agreed upon."
"4790","It is narrated from Aisha (may Allah be pleased with her) that she said: I heard the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) say: \Satirize the Quraysh"","" for it is more severe upon them than shooting arrows at them.\"" Narrated by Muslim."""""
"4791","aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw hsn rzy allh anh say frmatay sna: jb tk tm allh awr as kay rswl sly allh alyh wslm kay dfaa myn mshrkwn pr tnz krtay rhw gay، jbrayyl alyh alslam tmhary mdd krtay rhyn gay۔ aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: hsn nay an pr tnz kya awr mslmanwn kw tsly dy awr apnay aap kw tsly dy۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4792","braa rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm khndq kay dn zmyn kw atha rhay thay yhan tk kh aap ka pyt mty say dhk gya۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm (shar) prh rhay thay: allh ky qsm agr allh hmyn hdayt nh dyta tw hm hdayt nh patay، nh sdqh dytay، nh nmaz prhtay، tw hm pr skwn nazl frma awr jb hm (dshmnwn say) mlyn tw hmaray qdm jma day، kywnkh anhwn nay hm pr zyadty ky، jb anhwn nay hm say ankar kya tw hm nay ankar kya۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm an alfaz pr apny aawaz blnd frmatay: \hm nay ankar kya، hm nay ankar kya۔\"" pr atfaq hwa۔"""""
"4793","Anas (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates: The Muhajirun and Ansar (may Allah be pleased with them) were digging the trench, carrying the earth, and saying: \We are those who have pledged allegiance to Muhammad (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) for jihad as long as we live.\"" In response"","" the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) was saying: \""O Allah! True life is the life of the Hereafter"","" so forgive the Ansar and the Muhajirun.\"" Agreed upon."""""
"4794","Abu Huraira (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \It is better for a man's belly to be filled with pus that corrodes it than to fill his belly with (blameworthy) poetry.\"" Agreed upon."""""
"4795","It is narrated from Ka'b bin Malik (may Allah be pleased with him) that he said to the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him): Allah Almighty has revealed a command regarding the condemnation of poetry. The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \Indeed"","" the believer strives with his sword and his tongue. By the One in Whose hand is my soul! (This satire is such) as if you are shooting arrows at them.\"" In Al-Isti'ab by Ibn Abd al-Barr"","" it is mentioned that he said: O Messenger of Allah! What do you say about poetry? The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \""Indeed"","" the believer strives with his sword and his tongue.\"" Its chain is authentic"","" narrated in Sharh al-Sunnah."""""
"4796","abwamamh rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hya awr km bwlna ayman ky shakhyn hyn، awr fhsh klamy awr ghlw nfaq ky dw shakhyn hyn۔ as ka slslh shyh hay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4797","abw salbh khshny rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk tm myn say wh hay jw mjhay as dnya myn sb say zyadh azyz awr mhbwb hw awr qyamt kay dn wh shkhs jw myray sb say zyadh qryb hw ga، tm myn say wh hay js ka akhlaq sb say achha hw awr as dnya myn tm myn sb say zyadh napsndydh shkhs hw۔ qyamt kay dn mjh say sb say zyadh dwr hw ga، tm myn say wh shkhs hay jw bd akhlaq hw، bht zyadh bat krnay wala hw، bdtmyzy say bat krta hw awr bat krtay wqt chykhta hw۔ hsn kw byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4798","amam trmzy nay jabr rzy allh anh say asy trh rwayt kya hay۔ as ky rwayt myn hay kh shabh kram rzy allh anhm nay pwchha: ya rswl allh! hm bat krnay walay awr bat krnay walay kay baray myn jantay hyn، lykn \almtafaywn\"" say kwn mrad hay؟ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: mtkbr۔ as ka slslh achha hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4799","sad bn aby wqas rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt as wqt tk qaym nhyn hw gy jb tk kh ayk qwm zahr nh hw gy jw apny zban say as trh khayay gy js trh gayay apny zban say khaty hay۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4800","abdallh bn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk allh taalyٰ fsyh w blygh bwlnay walay say as trh dshmny rkhta hay js trh gayay apny zban say khaty hay۔ (trmzy، abwdaod) awr amam trmzy nay kha: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4801","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”maraj ky rat myn kchh lwgwn kay pas say gzra jn kay hwnt aag ky qynchy say katay ja rhay thay، myn nay pwchha: aay jbryl! yh kwn lwg hyn؟ aap nay frmaya: ''yh tmhary amt kay wh mblgh hyn jn kay qwl w fal myn tzad tha۔'' (trmzy) awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ hsn، trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4802","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay srf as lyay bwlna sykha kh wh as kay zryaay lwgwn ya lwgwn kay dlwn pr qbzh kr lay، tw qyamt kay dn allh taalyٰ as ky kwyy nfl ya frz abadt qbwl nhyn kray ga۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4803","amrw bn alaas rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh ayk dn aap nay frmaya: ayk aadmy khra hwa awr fsaht w blaght kay lyay apny bat kw twl day dya۔ tw amrw rzy allh anh nay kha: agr wh bwltay hwyay aatdal kw akhtyar krta tw as kay lyay bhtr hwta، kywnkh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: \myn nay jan lya hay ya mjhay hkm dya gya hay kh bat myn mkhtsr rhw، kywnkh akhtsar bhtr hay۔\"" as ka slslh hsn hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4804","skhr bn abdallh bn brydh apnay wald say awr wh apnay dada say rwayt krtay hyn، anhwn nay kha: myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: bay shk kchh klam jadw ky trh asr rkhta hay، kchh alm jhalt hay، kchh shar hkmt hay awr kchh batyn bwjh hyn۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4805","aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hsn rzy allh anh kay lyay msjd myn ayk mnbr rkha hwa tha۔ wh as pr khra hwta awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky trf say fkhr krta ya aap ka dfaa krta، awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm frmatay: ”bay shk allh jbrayyl alyh alslam kay zryaay hsn ky tayyd krta hay jb tk kh wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky trf say dfaa ya fkhr krtay rhyn۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay bkhary nay almlk ky swrt myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4806","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn: ayk shkhs tha jw aap kay lyay awntwn kay gyt gata tha۔ wh anjsha kay nam say jana jata tha، awr as ky aawaz bht khwbswrt thy۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay as say frmaya: \anjashh! aahsth chlw، aahsth chlw، shyshay kay brtn mt twrw۔\"" qtadh rhmh allh khtay hyn kh anhwn nay awrtwn ky lzt kw dykhtay hwyay yh kha۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"""""
"4807","aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky bargah myn shar ka tzkrh hwa tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yh klam ky ayk qsm hay، as myn jw kchh achha hay wh achha hay awr jw as say bra hay wh bra hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay darqtny nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4808","amam shafay rhm allh alyh nay asay arwh say mrsl qrar dya hay۔ as ky rwayt ka slslh bht kmzwr hay۔ asay shafay nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4809","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh hm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath (ymn kay alaqay) myn sfr kr rhay thay kh ayk shaar hmaray samnay aaya awr shar khnay lga۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as shytan kw pkrw“ ya frmaya: ”as shytan kw (shaary prhnay say) rwkw، kywnkh aadmy ka pyt pyp say bhrna shaary say bhrnay say bhtr hay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4810","Jabir (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \Singing creates hypocrisy in the heart just as water makes crops grow.\"" Its chain of narration is weak; it was narrated by Al-Bayhaqi in Shu'ab al-Iman."""""
"4811","nafa khtay hyn kh myn abn amr rzy allh anh kay sath ayk rastay pr tha kh anhwn nay bansry ky aawaz sny۔ as nay apnay dwnwn kanwn myn anglyan dalyn awr srk kay knaray chla gya۔ kchh dwr janay kay bad as nay mjh say kha: ’’nfy! kya tm ab kchh sn rhay hw؟‘‘ myn nay kha، ’’nhyn۔‘‘ phr as nay apnay kanwn say anglyan htayyn awr kha: myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas tha، aap nay bansry ky aawaz sny tw aap nay wysa hy kya jysa myn nay kya hay۔ nafa nay kha: as wqt myn jwan tha۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4812","shl bn sad rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay mjhay as chyz ky zmant dy jw as kay jbrwn kay drmyan hay awr jw as ky tangwn kay drmyan hay، myn asay jnt ky zmant dyta hwn۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4813","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk bndh kwyy aysy bat khta hay js say allh taalyٰ razy hwta hay awr wh asay ahmyt nhyn dyta، lykn as ky wjh say allh taalyٰ as kay drjat blnd kr dyta hay، awr bndh kwyy aysy bat khta hay js say allh taalyٰ naraz hwta hay awr wh asay ahmyt nhyn dyta، lykn as ky wjh say wh grta hay۔ yh bkhary kay alfaz hyn۔ awr bkhary w mslm ky rwayt myn hay: \as ky wjh say wh jhnm myn atna ghra hw ga jtna mshrq awr mghrb kay drmyan faslh hay۔\"" __QUR_N__، __XREF_N__، __REF_N__"""""
"4814","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (may Allah be pleased with him) reports that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \Abusing a Muslim is wickedness and fighting with him is disbelief.\"" Agreed upon."""""
"4815","Ibn Umar, may Allah be pleased with him, narrates that the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him, said: \If a person says to his (Muslim) brother: 'Disbeliever"",""' then surely one of them will return to disbelief (from faith).\"" Agreed upon."""""
"4816","Abu Dharr (may Allah be pleased with him) reports that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \If a person calls another person a fasiq (evildoer) or a kafir (disbeliever)"","" and if the one who is being called is not such"","" then that (statement) returns upon the one who said it.\"" Narrated by al-Bukhari."""""
"4817","Abu Dharr (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \Whoever calls someone a disbeliever or says: 'Enemy of Allah!' while he is not so"","" then that statement returns upon the one who said it.\"" Agreed upon."""""
"4818","sydna ans awr abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”dw aadmywn myn say jw ayk dwsray kw galy dyn، gnhgar wh hay jw as ky abtda kray، jb tk kh mzlwm ayk ky ayk say zyadh galy ka bdlh nh lay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4819","It is narrated from Abu Huraira, may Allah be pleased with him, that the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him, said: \It is not appropriate for a truthful person to be excessively cursing.\"" Narrated by Muslim."""""
"4820","abw drdaa rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”ksrt say lant krnay walay qyamt kay dn nh gwah hwn gay awr nh sfarsh krnay walay“۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4821","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb kwyy aadmy khta hay: lwg (apnay bray aamal ky wjh say) hlak hw gyay، tw wh an sb myn sb say zyadh hlak hwnay wala hay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4822","Abu Huraira (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \On the Day of Resurrection"","" you will find the worst person to be the one who is two-faced"","" who goes to some people with one story and to others with another story.\"" Agreed upon."""""
"4823","hzyfh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”khnay wala jnt myn dakhl nhyn hw ga۔ awr mslm ky rwayt myn lfz nam (\khany snanay wala\"") astamal hwa hay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"""""
"4824","abdallh bn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”sch kw apnao، kywnkh schayy nyky ky trf lay jaty hay awr nyky jnt ky trf lay jaty hay، aadmy sch bwlta rhta hay awr schayy ky tlash myn rhta hay yhan tk kh wh allh kay han scha lkha jata hay (sdyq hwnay awr amamt kay lyay)۔ gnah jhnm ky trf lay jata hay aadmy jhwt bwlta rhta hay awr jhwt ky tlash myn rhta hay yhan tk kh wh allh kay han jhwta lkha jata hay۔ awr mslm ky rwayt myn hay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \bay shk schayy nyky hay awr nyky jnt ky trf lay jaty hay، awr bay shk jhwt gnah hay awr gnah jhnm ky trf lay jata hay۔\"" pr atfaq hwa۔"""""
"4825","am klswm rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”lwgwn kay drmyan slh kranay wala jhwta nhyn hay، wh achhy bat krta hay awr achhy bat phnchata hay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4826","mqdad bn aswd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm an lwgwn kw dykhw jw dwsrwn ky bht zyadh taryf krtay hyn tw an kay chhrwn pr mty dalw“۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4827","hzrt abwbkrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh ayk aadmy nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky bargah myn dwsray aadmy ky taryf ky، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”afsws tm pr، tw nay apnay bhayy ky grdn kat dy“۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay yh tyn mrtbh frmaya۔ \agr ksy ky taryf krny chahyay tw wh khay: myn flan kw flan smjhta hwn، halankh allh taalyٰ as ky hqyqt kw khwb janta hay، agr wh shkhs jysa kh wh smjhta hay، tw asay allh kay samnay ksy ky pakyzgy ka yqyn kay sath aalan nhyn krna chahyay۔\"" pr atfaq hwa۔"""""
"4828","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya tm jantay hw kh ghybt kya hay؟ shabh kram rzy allh anhm nay arz kya kh allh awr as ka rswl bhtr jantay hyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tmhara apnay bhayy kay baray myn aysy bat ka zkr hay jsay wh napsnd krta hay۔ arz kya gya ya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm btayyay kh kya myn jw kchh khta hwn wh myray bhayy myn mwjwd hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: agr tm nay jw kha wh as myn hay tw tm nay as ky ghybt ky hay awr jw kchh tm khtay hw wh as myn nhyn hay tw tm nay as ky ghybt ky hay۔ ayk awr rwayt myn hay: \jb tm nay apnay bhayy kay baray myn kwyy aysy bat khy jw as myn hay tw tm nay as ky ghybt ky awr jb tm nay aysy bat khy jw as myn nhyn hay tw tm nay as ky ghybt ky۔\"" asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4829","am almomnyn aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh ayk aadmy nay nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm kay pas janay ky ajazt chahy، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” asay dakhl hwnay ky ajazt dw، kywnkh yh apny qwm ka bra aadmy hay۔ jb wh byth gya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay an kay chhray pr khwshy zahr ky awr aap sly allh alyh wslm kw dykh kr mskrayay۔ jb wh aadmy chla gya tw aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha ya rswl allh aap nay as kay baray myn flan flan kha، phr (jb wh aaya tw) aap kay chhray pr khwshy nzr aayy awr aap sly allh alyh wslm mskrayay۔ rswl allh (sly allh alyh waalh wslm) nay frmaya : tm nay mjhay kb bdtmyz paya kywn kh qyamt kay dn allh kay nzdyk sb say bra drjh wh hwga jsay lwg as kay shr say bchnay kay lyay tnha chhwr dyn۔ ayk awr rwayt myn hay: \as ky bd zbany say bchna۔\"" pr atfaq hwa۔"""""
"4830","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myry amt kay tmam gnah qabl maafy hyn swayay as kay jw alanyh gnah kray، awr khlm khla gnah krna yh hay kh kwyy shkhs rat kw kwyy kam kray، phr sbh kw yh khay kh flan flan rat myn nay flan flan kam kya، halankh allh taalyٰ nay flan flan kam kya tha! asay as kay lyay chhpaya awr as nay rat gzary jb kh as kay rb nay asay dhanp rkha tha، lykn jb sbh hwty hay tw wh allh ka prdh apnay awpr say hta dyta hay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔ awr abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hdys: \jw allh pr ayman rkhta hay...\"" mhman nwazy kay bab myn mzkwr hay۔"""""
"4831","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay jhwt bwlna chhwr dya، halankh wh ghlt tha، as kay lyay jnt kay knaray ayk ghr bnaya jayay ga، awr js nay hq pr hwtay hwyay jhgra chhwr dya، as kay lyay jnt kay bychwn bych ayk ghr bnaya jayay ga، awr js nay as kay lyay jnt kay hsay myn ayk ghr bnaya hay، awr js nay as kay krdar ky aslah ky، as kay lyay jnt kay knaray pr ayk ghr bnaya jayay ga۔ jnt۔\ amam trmzy nay as hdys kw rwayt kya hay awr asay hsn kha hay awr asy trh shrh alsn awr msbahy myn hay، anhwn nay kha: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay awr shrh alsn myn rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4832","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kya tm jantay hw kh kwn sy chyz zyadh tr lwgwn kw jnt myn dakhl kray gy؟ (phr frmaya:) allh ka khwf awr hsn akhlaq، kya tm jantay hw kh kwn sy chyz zyadh tr lwgwn kw jhnm myn dakhl kray gy؟ (phr frmaya:) dw chyzyn: mnh awr shrmgah۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4833","sydna blal bn hars rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk bndh achhy bat khta hay awr asay as ky ahmyt ka ahsas nhyn hwta، phr bhy allh taalyٰ as ky wjh say qyamt tk as kay lyay apny rza lkhta rhta hay، awr bay shk bndh as bat kw lkhta hay kh allh taalyٰ as ky ahmyt nhyn smjhta awr as ky ahmyt nhyn rkhta۔ qyamt tk as ky narazgy rhay gy۔\ shrh alsn۔ awr amam malk، trmzy awr abn majh nay asy trh ky rwayt nql ky hay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ shrh alsnn، malk، trmzy awr abn majh myn rwayt hay۔"""""
"4834","bhz bn hkym apnay wald say awr wh apnay dada say rwayt krtay hyn، wh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tbahy hay as shkhs kay lyay jw jhwt bwlta hay takh lwgwn kw hnsayay، tbahy hay as kay lyay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay ahmd، trmzy، abwdaod awr aldarmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4835","Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \Indeed"","" a servant speaks merely to make people laugh"","" and because of that he falls into Hell farther than the distance between the earth and the sky. And he does not slip as much by the slipping of his feet as he slips by the slipping of his tongue.\"" Its chain is weak. It was narrated by Al-Bayhaqi in Shu'ab al-Iman."""""
"4836","abdallh bn amrw rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw khamwsh rha as nay njat payy“۔ as ka slslh achha hay۔ asay ahmd، trmzy، aldarmy awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4837","aqbh bn aamr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say mla tw myn nay pwchha: njat ka zryah kya hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: apny zban kw qabw myn rkhw، tmhara ghr tmharay lyay kafy hw، awr apnay gnahwn pr rwya krw۔ zayf، asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4838","abwsayd rzy allh anh nay as hdys kw mrfwa qrar dya hay، anhwn nay kha: jb abn aadm sbh kw bydar hwta hay tw tmam aazaa zban say yh khtay hwyay khta hay: hmaray baray myn allh say drw، kywnkh hm aap pr mnhsr hyn، agr aap sydhay hyn tw hm bhy tyrhay hw jayyn gay، awr agr hm bhy tyrhay hw jayyn gay۔ as ka slslh achha hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4839","aly bn hsyn rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” aadmy kay aslam ky khwby yh hay kh wh an chyzwn kw chhwr day js say as ka kwyy talq nhyn“۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay malk awr ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4840","amam abn majh nay asay abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt kya hay۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4841","amam trmzy awr byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn an dwnwn (aly bn hsyn rzy allh anh awr abwhryrh rzy allh anh) say rwayt kya hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4842","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn: ayk shaby rzy allh anh ka antqal hwa، tw ayk aadmy nay kha: asay jnt ky bshart hay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya tm nhyn jantay، shayd as nay kwyy aysy bat khy hw js say asay kwyy srwkar nh hw، ya as nay aysy bat ky hw js say as myn kmy nh hw۔ as ky snd zayf hay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4843","sfyan bn abdallh sqfy rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myn nay arz kya ya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm aap kw myray baray myn sb say zyadh ks chyz ka khwf hay؟ rawy khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apny zban pkry awr frmaya yh۔ (trmzy، awr as nay asay shyh qrar dya۔) mstnd، trmzy nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"4844","abn amr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb bndh jhwt bwlta hay tw as ky bdbw ky wjh say frshth as say ayk myl dwr hw jata hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4845","sfyan bn asd hzrmy rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: ”sb say bry khyant yh hay kh tm apnay (mslm) bhayy say bat krw awr wh tmhyn scha smjhay، halankh tm as say jhwt bwltay hw“۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4846","Ammar (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates: The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \Whoever is two-faced in this world"","" on the Day of Resurrection his tongue will be of fire.\"" Hasan"","" narrated by al-Darimi."""""
"4847","abn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mwmn nh tanay dynay wala hay، nh lant krnay wala hay، nh galy glwch krnay wala hay awr nh galy dynay wala hay۔ (trmzy، byhqy nay shab alayman myn۔) awr byhqy ky ayk awr rwayt myn hay: \wh nh tw fhsh zban astamal krnay wala hay awr nh hy galyan dynay wala۔\"" amam trmzy nay kha: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ hsn kw trmzy awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4848","abn amr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mwmn wh nhyn hay jw lant kray۔ ayk awr rwayt myn hay: ’’mwmn kay lyay yh mnasb nhyn kh wh lant krnay wala hw۔‘‘ as ka slslh achha hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4849","Samurah bin Jundub (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \Do not say to one another: 'May Allah's curse be upon you"",""' 'May Allah's wrath be upon you"",""' or 'Go to Hell.'\"" And in another narration: \""Do not even say: 'Go into the (Hell) Fire.'\"" Its chain is weak. Narrated by al-Tirmidhi and Abu Dawood."""""
"4850","abw drdaa rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”jb bndh ksy chyz pr lant bhyjta hay tw wh lant aasman ky trf brh jaty hay، lykn as kay phnchnay say phlay aasman kay drwazay bnd kr dyay jatay hyn، phr wh zmyn ky trf atrta hay، awr as kay drwazay bhy bnd hw jatay hyn، phr jb wh bayyn trf mrta hay، awr jb asay bayyn trf ka rasth mlta hay tw wh bnd hw jata hay۔ js pr lant bhyjy gyy hay as ky trf lwtta hay، bshrtykh wh as ka msthq hw، bswrt dygr، as kay khnay walay ky trf lwtta hay۔\ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4851","abn abas rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh hwa nay ayk aadmy ky chadr ara dy tw as nay as pr lant ky۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as pr lant nh krw، kywnkh yh srf hkm ky tamyl hay، awr jw kwyy aysy chyz pr lant bhyjay jw as kay layq nh hw، as pr lant lwt aaty hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4852","abn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myray sathywn myn say kwyy mjhay ksy dwsray shaby kay baray myn kwyy bat (nagwar) nh phnchayay، kywnkh myn yh psnd krta hwn kh jb myn aap kay pas aata hwn tw myra dl saf hwta hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4853","am almomnyn aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say arz kya: aap kay lyay sfyh rzy allh anha kay baray myn atna hy kafy hay kh wh flan hyn، yany an ka qd chhwta hay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm nay aysa klmh kha hay jw agr smndr kay sath ml jayay tw asay mghlwb kr day ga (yany as ky nwayt bdl jayay gy)۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay ahmd، trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4854","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hr chyz myn bay hyayy asay ayb dar bna dyty hay awr ksy chyz myn hya asay zynt dyty hay“۔ as ka slslh shyh hay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4855","khald bn madan maaz rzy allh anh say rwayt krtay hyn، anhwn nay kha: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay apnay (mslman) bhayy kw ksy (gzshth) gnah ky wjh say mlamt ky tw yh shkhs mrnay say phlay as (gnah) ka artkab kr lay ga۔ as say mrad wh gnah hay js say wh phlay hy twbh kr chka hay۔ (trmzy) awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay، as ka slslh mtsl nhyn hay kywnkh khald rzy allh anh nay maaz bn jbl rzy allh anh say mlaqat nhyn ky۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4856","hzrt waslh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: apnay (mslman) bhayy ky msybt pr khwshy ka azhar nh krw، kywnkh mmkn hay allh taalyٰ as pr rhm kray awr as (msybt) say tmhary aazmaysh kray۔ trmzy، awr frmaya: yh hdys hsn ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4857","aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn ksy ky mshabht psnd nhyn krty، chahay mjhay flan flan mal hy kywn nh dya jayay۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr asay shyh qrar dya hay۔ as ka slslh shyh hay jsay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4858","jndb rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk aaraby aaya، as nay apnay awnt kw bthaya، asay bandha awr msjd myn dakhl hwa۔ as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pychhay nmaz prhy۔ jb nby sly allh alyh wslm nay slam phyr kr nmaz prhy tw aaraby apny swary pr gya، asay khwla، as pr swar hw gya awr blnd aawaz myn pkara: \aay allh! mjh pr awr mhmd sly allh alyh wslm pr rhm frma، awr ksy kw hmary rhmt myn shaml nh krna۔\"" rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya tm asay zyadh jahl smjhtay hw ya as ka awnt، kya tm nay nhyn sna kh as nay kya kha؟ shabh kram rzy allh anhm nay jwab dya: han، hm nay sna hay۔ as ky snd zayf hay۔ asay abw daod nay rwayt kya hay۔ awr abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh: aadmy kay jhwtay hwnay kay lyay yhy kafy hay kh wh hr sny snayy bat byan kray۔ as ka zkr (ktab w snt kw) mzbwty say pkrnay kay bab kay phlay hsay myn hw chka hay۔"""""
"4859","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb ksy gnhgar ky taryf ky jaty hay tw rb alazt naraz hw jata hay، awr as ky wjh say as ka arsh kanp jata hay۔ as ka slslh rwayt zayf hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4860","abwamamh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mwmn khyant awr jhwt ka aady nhyn hw skta، albth as myn an kay alawh kchh bhy hw skta hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ ahmd nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"4861","amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn sad bn aby wqas rzy allh anh say rwayt ky hay۔ as ka slslh rwayt zayf hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4862","sfwan bn slym rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha gya: kya mwmn bzdl hw skta hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: han۔ phr pwchha gya: kya mwmn bkhyl hw skta hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: han۔ phr pwchha gya: kya mwmn jhwta hw skta hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya: \nhyn\""۔ malk awr byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn mrsl qrar dya hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay malk awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4863","abn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn: shytan ansanwn kay pas aata hay، anhyn jhwty batyn btata hay، phr jb lwg mntshr hw jatay hyn tw an myn say ayk khta hay: myn nay ayk aadmy kw sna۔ myn as ka chhrh phchanta hwn lykn as ka nam nhyn janta۔ wh yh byan kr rha tha. (mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔)"
"4864","amran bn htan rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn: myn abwzr rzy allh anh kay pas aaya awr anhyn msjd myn akyla paya، wh ayk srhd waly syah chadr myn lptay hwyay thay۔ myn nay as say kha abwzr! yh tnhayy kywn؟ anhwn nay jwab dya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: \khlwt bray sathy say bhtr hay، awr achha sathy khlwt say bhtr hay، achhy bat lkhna khamwshy say bhtr hay، awr khamwshy bra lkhnay say bhtr hay۔\"" as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4865","It is narrated from Imran bin Husain (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \A man's maintaining silence (from saying bad things) is better than sixty years of worship.\"" Its chain is weak; it was narrated by Al-Bayhaqi in Shu'ab al-Iman."""""
"4866","abwzr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn hazr hwa، aap nay pwry hdys byan ky، yhan tk kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: myn nay arz kya، ya rswl allh! mjhay mshwrh dyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: myn tmhyn allh say drnay ky nsyht krta hwn، kywnkh yh tmharay tmam kamwn kay lyay sb say zyadh mzyn hay۔ myn nay kha: mzyd btao! aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \qraan ky tlawt krw awr allh kw yad krw jw ghalb w bzrg hay، kywnkh yh tmharay lyay aasmanwn myn zkr awr zmyn myn tmharay lyay nwr hay۔\"" myn nay kha: mjhay mzyd nsyht krw۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: hmyshh khamwsh rhw، kywnkh yh shytan kw dwr krta hay awr tmharay dyn kay maamlat myn tmhary mdd krta hay۔ myn nay kha: mzyd btao۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \""zyadh hnsy say bchw، kywnkh yh dl kw mar dalta hay awr chhray say nwr kw khtm kr dyta hay۔\"" myn nay kha: mjhay mzyd nsyht krw۔ rawy khtay hyn kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: sch bwlw agrchh krwy hw۔ myn nay kha: mzyd btao۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: allh kay maamlay myn ksy mlamt krnay walay ky mlamt say nh drw۔ myn nay kha: mzyd btao۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ’’tmharay apnay aybwn ka alm tmhyn dwsrwn kay ayb tlash krnay say rwkay‘‘۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4867","ans rzy allh anh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”abw zr! kya myn tmhyn dw khsltyn nh btaon jw pyth pr tw bht hlky hyn lykn myzan myn bht bhary hyn؟ wh byan krtay hyn، myn nay kha han! btao۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”khamwsh rhna awr hsn akhlaq akhtyar krna، as zat ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay! mkhlwq nay an jysay dw kam nhyn kyay“۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4868","aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm abwbkr rzy allh anh kay pas say gzray jb aap apnay ghlamwn myn say ayk kw bra bhla khh rhay thay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay as ky trf dykha awr frmaya: kya lant krnay wala awr sdyqyn akthay hw sktay hyn؟ rb kabh ky qsm! kbhy nhyn۔ chnanchh abwbkr rzy allh anh nay as dn apnay kchh ghlamwn kw (kfarh kay twr pr) aazad kr dya، phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay awr kha: myn dwbarh aysa nhyn krwn ga۔ amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn panchwn hdysyn nql ky hyn۔ hsn kw byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4869","(amr bn khtab rzy allh anh kay aazad krdh ghlam aslm rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh ayk dn amr rzy allh anh abwbkr sdyq rzy allh anh kay pas gyay tw dykha kh wh apny zban khynch rhay hyn، yh mnzr dykh kr) amr rzy allh anh nay kha: allh abw bkr sdyq rzy allh anh ky mghfrt frmayay، allh taalyٰ aap kw maaf frmayay۔ jwab dya: as nay mjhay tbahy kay grhwn tk phncha dya، as ka slslh shyh hay، malk nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4870","abadh bn samt rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mjhay apny trf say chh chyzwn ky zmant dw myn tmhyn jnt ky zmant dyta hwn: jb tm bat krw tw sch bwlw، jb wadh krw tw asay pwra krw، jb tm pr kwyy chyz rkhy jayay tw asay waps krw، apny shrmgahwn ky hfazt krw، apny shrmgahwn ky hfazt krw naansafy)۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay ahmd awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4871","abdalrhmn bn ghnm awr asmaa bnt yzyd rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh kay bhtryn bnday wh hyn jnhyn dykhtay hy allh yad aata hay، awr allh kay bndwn myn sb say bray bnday wh hyn jw khnay walay hyn، wh hyn jw aaps myn jhgra krtay hyn awr mhbt myn bghz rkhtay hyn“۔ hsn، jsay ahmd awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4872","abd alrhmn bn ghnm awr asmaa bnt yzyd ؓ say rwayt hay kh nby ﷺ nay frmaya :’’ allh kay bhtryn bnday wh hyn kh jb anhyn dykha jayay tw allh yad aٓ jayay ، jbkh allh kay bndwn myn say bdtryn lwg chghl khwr ، pyarwn kay drmyan jdayy dalnay walay awr (gnahwn say) latalq lwgwn pr brayy ka alzam lganay walay hyn ۔‘‘ hsn ، rwah ahmd w albyhqy fy shab alayman ۔"
"4873","abn abas rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh dw aadmywn nay zhr ya asr ky nmaz as hal myn prhy kh wh rwzay say thay۔ jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nmaz say fargh hwyay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm dwnwn apna wzw dwbarh krw، nmaz kw dhrao، apna rwzh pwra krw awr ksy awr dn as ky qza krw۔ dwnwn nay pwchha: ya rswl allh! kywn؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm nay flan ky ghybt ky hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4874","abwsayd awr jabr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ghybt zna say zyadh skht hay۔ shabh kram rzy allh anhm nay arz kya ya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ghybt zna say zyadh skht kysay hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: bay shk aadmy zna krta hay، phr twbh krta hay، awr allh as ky twbh qbwl krta hay۔ ayk awr rwayt myn hay: \wh twbh krta hay، awr allh asay maaf kr dyta hay، jbkh ghybt krnay walay kw as wqt tk maaf nhyn kya jata jb tk kh wh js ky ghybt nh kr lay، asay maaf nh kr day۔\"" as ka slslh bht kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn bhy rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4875","abwsayd awr jabr ؓ byan krtay hyn ، rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya :’’ ghybt zna say bhy zyadh sngyn hay ؟ shabh ؓ nay arz kya : allh kay rswl ! ghybt zna say kysay zyadh sngyn hay ؟ ap ﷺ nay frmaya :’’ bay shk admy zna krta hay tw wh twbh krta hay awr allh as ky twbh qbwl frma lyta hay ۔‘‘ ayk dwsry rwayt myn hay :’’ wh twbh krta hay tw allh asay bkhsh dyta hay ۔ jbkh ghybt krnay walay kw maaf nhyn kya jata hty kh wh shkhs js ky ghybt ky gyy hay ، wh asay maaf kr day ۔‘‘ asnadh zayf jza ، rwah albyhqy fy shab alayman ، ayzaً ۔"
"4876","awr ans rzy allh anh ky rwayt myn hay: \zna krnay wala twbh krta hay، jbkh ghybt krnay walay ky twbh nhyn hwty۔\"" (kywnkh wh as bat kw ahm nhyn smjhta kh yh bhy gnah hay awr as trh wh twbh krnay say qasr hay۔) amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn tynwn hdysyn nql ky hyn۔ as ka slslh rwayt zayf hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4877","Anas (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \The expiation for backbiting is that you pray for forgiveness for the one you have backbitten; say: O Allah! Forgive us and him.\"" (Bayhaqi in Al-Da'awat Al-Kabir). And he said: There is weakness in its chain of narration. Its chain is weak. It is narrated by Al-Bayhaqi in Al-Da'awat Al-Kabir."""""
"4878","Jabir (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates: When the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) passed away and wealth came to Abu Bakr (may Allah be pleased with him) from Alaa bin Hadrami (may Allah be pleased with him), Abu Bakr (may Allah be pleased with him) said: \Whoever had a debt upon the Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) or to whom he had promised to give something"","" let him come to us (we will pay that debt and fulfill his promise).\"" Jabir (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates: I said"","" \""The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) promised me that he would give me such and such and such"",""\"" and Jabir (may Allah be pleased with him) spread his hands three times. Jabir (may Allah be pleased with him) said that he gave me a handful"","" and when I counted them"","" they were five hundred. Abu Bakr (may Allah be pleased with him) said: \""Take the same amount two more times.\"" Agreed upon."""""
"4879","abw jhyfh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw dykha kh an ky rngt srkhy mayl thy awr aap kay kchh bal sfyd hw chkay thay awr hsn bn aly rzy allh anh aap sly allh alyh wslm say mshabh thay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay hmaray lyay tyrh awntnyan mngwayyn۔ hm an kw lynay gyay tw an ky mwt ky khbr hm tk phnchy tw hmyn kchh nh mla۔ tahm jb abwbkr nay khlaft ky zmh dary snbhaly tw frmaya: agr ksy kay pas rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky trf say kwyy wadh hay tw wh aayay۔ myn as kay pas gya awr asay khbr dy tw as nay hkm dya kh awnt hmyn dyay jayyn۔ shyh، trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4880","abdallh bn aby hmsh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh aalanِ nbwt say phlay myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say kchh khryda، awr kchh adayygy baqy thy jw mjh pr wajb thy۔ myn nay wadh kya tha kh baqy rqm asy jgh lay aaon ga، lykn bhwl gya۔ tyn dn kay bad، mjhay yad aaya (awr chla gya) awr wh abhy tk asy jgh pr tha۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm nay mjhay tklyf myn dala، myn yhan tyn dn say tmhara antzar kr rha hwn۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4881","Zaid bin Arqam (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates from the Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him), he (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \When a man makes a promise to his brother with the intention of fulfilling it"","" but he is unable to fulfill the promise and does not reach at the appointed time"","" then there is no sin upon him.\"" Its chain is weak"","" narrated by Abu Dawood."""""
"4882","abdallh bn aamr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk dn myry waldh nay mjhay blaya jb kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hmaray ghr myn mwjwd thay۔ myry man nay kha: snw، adhr aao، myn tmhyn kchh dwn gy۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as say frmaya: tm asay kya dynay ka aradh rkhty hw؟ as nay jwab dya: myn asay ayk tarykh dynay ka aradh rkhty hwn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: snw، agr tm asay kchh nh dytay tw tm pr jhwt lkha jata۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay abwdaod awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4883","It is narrated from Zaid bin Arqam (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \If a person makes an appointment with another man"","" but one of them does not arrive by the time of prayer"","" and the one who has come goes to perform the prayer"","" then there is no sin upon him.\"" Weak"","" narrated by Razeen."""""
"4884","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hmaray sath rsmy twr pr kam nhyn krtay thay (aap sly allh alyh wslm hmaray drmyan ghyr rsmy twr pr rhtay thay) yhan tk kh myray chhwtay bhayy say frmatay: \abw amyr! chhwtay prnday nay kya kya؟\"" abw amyr kay pas ayk chhwta prndh tha js say wh khyla krtay thay awr wh mr gya۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"""""
"4885","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh shabh kram rzy allh anhm nay arz kya ya rswl allh aap hm say mzaq krtay hyn؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya kh myn srf sch bwlta hwn۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4886","sydna ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh ayk aadmy nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say swary ka swal kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn tmhyn awntny ky awlad pr swar krwn ga۔ as aadmy nay kha: myn awntny ky awlad ka kya krwn ga؟ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: awntny hy awntwn kw jnm dyty hay۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4887","It is narrated from Anas (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said to him: \O two-eared one!\"" Sahih"","" narrated by Abu Dawood and Tirmidhi."""""
"4888","ans rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk bwrhy awrt say frmaya: ”kwyy bwrhy awrt jnt myn nhyn jayay gy۔ as nay pwchha: an (rwknay) ky kya wjh hay؟ awr wh qraan ky tlawt krty thyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay as say frmaya: kya tm qraan nhyn prhty، bay shk hm nay anhyn (jnt ky lwndywn) kw khas tryqay say pyda kya، phr knwaryan bna dyn۔ razyn۔ shrh alsn myn lfz mshkw say hay۔ zayf، rzyn nay rwayt kya hay awr shrh alsn myn hay۔"
"4889","It is narrated from Anas (may Allah be pleased with him) that a Bedouin named Zahir bin Haram used to bring gifts from the desert for the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), and when he intended to return, the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) would give him (provisions). The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \Zahir is our agent in the desert and we are his caretakers in the city.\"" And the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) used to love him"","" even though he was not handsome. One day"","" the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) came while he was selling his goods"","" and the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) embraced him from behind"","" and he could not see who it was. He said: \""Let me go"","" who is this?\"" He looked from one side and recognized that it was the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him). When he recognized him"","" he pressed his back firmly against the blessed chest of the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him)"","" and the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) began to say: \""Who will buy this slave?\"" He said: \""O Messenger of Allah! By Allah"","" you will find me of little value.\"" The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \""But you are not of little value in the sight of Allah.\"" Its chain is authentic. It is narrated in Sharh al-Sunnah."""""
"4890","awf bn malk ashjay rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myn nay jng tbwk kay mwqa pr apnay aap kw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn pysh kya۔ wh chmray kay ayk chhwtay say khymay myn tha۔ myn nay aap kw slam kya، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay myray slam ka jwab dya awr frmaya: andr aajao۔ myn nay kha: ya rswl allh! kya mjhay mkml twr pr (sb kw) andr aana chahyay؟ aap (sly allh alyh waalh wslm) nay frmaya: ’’pwry trh (tm sb) aajao۔ myn andr chla gya۔ asman bn aby atyqh (rawy) khtay hyn: anhwn nay kha: kya myn chhwtay khymay myn pwry trh dakhl hw jaon؟ shyh، abw daod nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"4891","naman bn bshyr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh abwbkr rzy allh anh nay nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aanay ky ajazt chahy tw anhwn nay aayshh rzy allh anha ky aawaz blnd hwty sny۔ jb aap sly allh alyh wslm andr dakhl hwyay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay aayshh rzy allh anha kw thpr marnay kay lyay pkra awr frmaya: myn tmhyn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky aawaz pr aawaz blnd krtay hwyay nhyn dykh rha۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay abwbkr rzy allh anh kw rwkna shrwa kya tw aap ghsay ky halt myn whan say chlay gyay۔ jb abwbkr rzy allh anh bahr nklay tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kya tm nay dykha kh myn nay tmhyn as shkhs (yany abwbkr rzy allh anh) say kysay bchaya؟ rawy khtay hyn: chnd dnwn kay bad abwbkr rzy allh anh phr aayay awr dakhl hwnay ky ajazt chahy، tw anhwn nay (rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm awr aayshh rzy allh anha kw) slh ky halt myn paya، aap nay an say frmaya: mjhay bhy apny slh myn shaml krw js trh tm nay mjhay apny slh myn shaml kya tha۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: hm nay aysa kya، hm nay aysa kya۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4892","sydna abn abas rzy allh anhma nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”apnay (mslm) bhayy say jhgra nh krw، as kay sath mzaq nh krw، awr nh as say kwyy wadh krw jsay tm twr dw gay۔ __REF_N__ trmzy، awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4893","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha gya: lwgwn myn sb say zyadh azt wala kwn hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: allh kay nzdyk an myn sb say zyadh azt wala wh hay jw an myn sb say zyadh mtqy awr prhyzgar hw۔ shabh kram rzy allh anhm nay arz kya: hm aap say as baray myn nhyn pwchh rhay hyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: phr sb say zyadh azt walay ywsf alyh alslam hyn، allh kay nby، allh kay nby kay bytay، allh kay nby kay nwasay، allh kay dwst kay nwasay (abrahym alyh alslam)۔ shabh nay arz kya: hm aap say as baray myn nhyn pwchh rhay hyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya tm mjh say arb kay qbayl kay baray myn pwchh rhay hw؟ khnay lgay: han! aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm myn say jw zmanh jahlyt myn sb say achhay thay wh tm myn say aslam myn sb say achhay hyn bshrtykh wh (shryat kay aadab ky) smjh hasl kr lyn۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4894","Ibn Umar (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \The noble"","" son of the noble"","" son of the noble"","" son of the noble is Yusuf"","" son of Yaqub"","" son of Ishaq"","" son of Ibrahim (peace be upon them).\"" Narrated by al-Bukhari."""""
"4895","Bara bin Azib (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates: On the day of the Battle of Hunayn, Abu Sufyan bin Harith (may Allah be pleased with him) was holding the reins of your (i.e., the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him) mule. When the polytheists surrounded you from all sides, you dismounted and said: \I am the Prophet"","" there is no lie in this"","" and I am the son of Abdul Muttalib.\"" The narrator states: On that day"","" no one was seen braver than the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) among all the people. Agreed upon."""""
"4896","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh ayk aadmy nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn hazr hwa awr aap say pwchha: mkhlwq myn sb say afzl kwn hay؟ rswl allh (sly allh alyh waalh wslm) nay jwab dya: wh abrahym (alyh alslam) hyn۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4897","amr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myry taryf myn mbalghh nh krw jysa kh aysayywn nay abn mrym ky taryf myn ghlw kya، myn tw srf as ka bndh hwn، lhza tm khw: allh ka bndh awr as ka rswl۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4898","ayaz bn hmar mjashy rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk allh taalyٰ nay myry trf why ky hay kh tm twaza akhtyar krw takh kwyy ksy pr fkhr nh kray awr kwyy ksy pr zlm nh kray۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4899","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”lwg apnay bzrgwn pr fkhr krna chhwr dyn، wh mhz jhnm kay angarh hyn، ya allh kay nzdyk as gwbr kay chqndr say bhy zyadh hqyr hyn jw apny nak say gndgy kw dhkylta hay awr allh taalyٰ nay apny nak say gndgy kw dwr kr dya hay۔ aap kay aabaa w ajdad kay baray myn zmanh jahlyt hay، ya tw nyk، salh mwmn hay ya bdkar، tmam lwg aadm ky awlad hyn، awr aadm (alyh alslam) mty say hyn۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4900","mtrf bn abdallh bn shkhyr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay، wh (apnay wald say rwayt krtay hyn) kh myn bnw aamr kay wfd kay sath rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn hazr tha۔ hm nay kha: aap hmaray aaqa hyn۔ as nay jwab dya: \aaqa allh hay۔\"" phr hm nay kha: tm hm say fzylt myn brtr awr hm say brh kr hw۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw tm khh rhay hw wh khw، ya apnay alfaz ka kchh hsh khw، awr shytan tmhyn (batyn bnanay ky) hmt nh day۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4901","Hasan Basri (myn allh ky rhmt kay sath hw) smwrh (myn allh ky rza kay sath hw) say btata hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay kha: \as dnya myn azt srwt say hwty hay، awr allh kay satn (aakhrt myn) azt tqwy say hwty hay۔\"" as ky rwayt km zayf hay۔ altrmzy w abn majh nay as ky rwayt ky hay۔"""""
"4902","aby bn kab rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”jw shkhs apnay aap kw zmanh jahlyt say mnswb kray (awr as pr fkhr kray) tw as say khh dw kh apnay bap ky shrmgah kw kat lay awr as kw lghwyat kay twr pr nh khw“۔ znjyr kmzwr hay۔ shrh alsn، ahmd، awr albkhary nay aladb almfrd myn rwayt ky hay۔"
"4903","abdalrhmn bn aby aqbh rzy allh anh abw aqbh rzy allh anh say rwayt krtay hyn kh wh ahl fars kay aazad krdh ghlam thay۔ anhwn nay kha: myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath ghzwh ahd myn shrkt ky۔ myn nay ayk mshrk kw mara awr kha: yh mjh say lay lw، myn farsy nzhad hwn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm myry trf mtwjh hwyay awr frmaya: tm nay yh kywn nhyn kha kh yh mjh say lay lw awr myn ayk ansary jwan hwn، as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4904","abn msawd rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs apny qwm ky nahq mdd awr mdd krta hay wh as awnt ky trh hay jw knwyn myn gr jayay awr asay apny dm say khynch lya jayay۔ shyh، abw daod nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"4905","waslh bn asqa rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myn nay pwchha ya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm asabyh kya hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: yh kh tm apny qwm ky zlm myn mdd krw۔ (zayf slslh) abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4906","sraqh bn malk bn jsham rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hmyn khtbh dytay hwyay frmaya: tm myn say bhtryn mhafz wh hay jw apnay ahl w ayal ka dfaa kray، bshrtykh wh gnah nh kray۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4907","sydna jbyr bn mtam rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”wh hm myn say nhyn jw asbyt ky trf blayay، wh hm myn say nhyn jw asbyt kay lyay lray، awr wh hm myn say nhyn jw asbyt pr mray“۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4908","abw drdaa rzy allh anh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ksy chyz ky mhbt ansan kw andha awr bhra kr dyty hay۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4909","abadh bn ksyr alshamy apny (flstyny) bywy fsylh say rwayt krtay hyn، anhwn nay kha: myn nay apnay wald kw byan krtay hwyay sna، myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say ayk msylh kay baray myn pwchha، anhwn nay kha: ya rswl allh! kya as bat kw bhy asbyt smjha jata hay kh aadmy apnay lwgwn say mhbt krta hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”nhyn، blkh yh hay kh aadmy apnay lwgwn ky brayywn myn mdd kray awr as ky mdd kray۔ zayf، asay ahmd awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4910","aqyb bn aamr (myn allh ky rza kay sath hw) byanat krta hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay kha: \yh tarykhh aap kay sb kw zyan nhyn hay۔ aap sb lwan hy aadm kay bchay hw awr aap sb brabr hy hw jysay ayk sa say dygr sa brabr hay۔ kwyy bra nhyn awr kwyy chhwta nhyn، bghyr dyn kay awr tqwy kay۔ sb kw zyadh alant ya bht bwlnay wala awr bkawt wala awr knghwta wala hy kafy hay۔\"" hsn ky rwayt hay، ahmd w albyhaqy nay shab alayman myn as ky rwayt ky hay۔"""""
"4911","6.\nAbu Hurairah (radiyallahu anhu) rivayat karte hain: Ek aadmi ne poocha, \Aye Allah ke Rasool! Kiska mujh par sab se zyada haq hai ke main us ke saath accha sulook karun?\"" Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne jawab diya"","" \""Teri maan ka.\"" Us ne poocha"","" \""Phir kis ka?\"" Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya"","" \""Teri maan ka.\"" Us ne poocha"","" \""Phir kis ka?\"" Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya"","" \""Teri maan ka.\"" Us ne poocha"","" \""Phir kis ka?\"" Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya"","" \""Tere baap ka.\"" Ek aur riwayat mein"","" Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya"","" \""Teri maan"","" phir teri maan"","" phir teri maan"","" phir tera baap"","" phir tere rishtedaar jo sab se qareeb ho"","" phir jo is se qareeb ho.\"" Muta’faqun alaih."""""
"4912","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as ky nak khak aalwd hw، as ky nak khak myn ml jayay، as ky nak khak aalwd hw“۔ pwchha gya: ya rswl allh! ks ka؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay apnay waldyn myn say ayk ya dwnwn kw brhapay myn paya awr phr (an kay sath hsn slwk kr kay) jnt myn dakhl nh hwa۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4913","asmaa bnt aby bkr rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh myry waldh myray pas as wqt aayyn jb wh mshrk thyn۔ yh as wqt ky bat hay jb qrysh kay sath (hdybyh ka) maahdh hwa tha۔ myn nay kha: ya rswl allh! bay shk myry waldh myray pas aayy hyn awr wh mjh say hsn slwk ky khwahsh rkhty hyn، tw kya myn an kay sath slh rhmy krwn؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: han! as kay sath slh rhmy krw۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4914","amrw bn alaas rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: abw flan kay ghr walay myray dwst awr mddgar nhyn hyn، myra mddgar allh awr salh mwmn hyn، albth an kay sath ayk rshth dary hay jsay myn rshth dary kay zryaay nbhaon ga۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4915","mghyrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk allh taalyٰ nay maon ky nafrmany، bytywn kw zndh drgwr krna، bkhl awr mangnay kw tm pr hram qrar dya hay، awr tm pr byhwdh gftgw، lwgwn ka ksrt say swal krna awr mal ky zyadty kw napsnd kya hay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4916","abdallh bn amrw rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aadmy ka apnay waldyn kw galy dyna kbyrh gnah hay۔ shabh kram nay arz kya ya rswl allh! kya aadmy apnay waldyn kw galy dyta hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: han، wh dwsray aadmy kay bap kw galy dyta hay، tw (as kay bdlay myn) wh shkhs apnay bap kw galy dyta hay، awr wh dwsray aadmy ky man kw galy dyta hay، tw wh shkhs as ky man kw galy dyta hay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4917","abn amr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk aadmy kay wald kay antqal kay bad as kay wald kay dwstwn say talq qaym rkhna sb say bry nyky hay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4918","ans rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs yh chahta hay kh as kay rzq myn kshadgy hw awr as ky amr draz hw tw asay chahyay kh slh rhmy kray۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4919","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ nay mkhlwq kw pyda kya، phr jb as kw khtm kr lya tw rhm nay khra hw kr rhmn ky psht pr hath rkha، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yh kya hay؟ as (rhm nay) kha: 'yh as shkhs ky jgh hay jw rshth twrnay say tjh say pnah mangta hay۔' aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya tm as bat pr razy nhyn hw kh jw tm say talq rkhay myn as say rshth qaym rkhwn awr jw tm say talq twray as say rshth twr dwn؟ rhm nay kha: 'han، myray rb، myn razy hwn۔' as nay kha: 'phr yh tmharay lyay hay۔' \atfaq hwa۔"""""
"4920","abw hyrh (myn allh ky rza kay sath hw) byanat krta hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay kha: \rhm az rhmn nkla hw gya hay۔ allh nay kha: 'jw lwg tyray sath qrbany rkhtay hyn، myn an kay sath qrbany rkhwn ga، awr jw lwg tyray sath twrtay hyn، myn an kay sath twr dwn ga۔'\"" albkhary nay as ky rwayt ky hay۔"""""
"4921","am almomnyn aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: rhm arsh say ltka hwa hay، as myn kha gya hay: js nay mjhay snbhala، allh as kw snbhalay ga، awr js nay mjhay twra، allh as kw kat day ga۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4922","jbr bn mtym (myn allh ky rza kay sath hw) byanat krta hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay kha: \jw lwg khandan kay talqat twrtay hyn، wh prdys myn nhyn dkhlay gay۔\"" mtfq hay۔ altrmzy awr abn majh nay as ky rwayt ky hay۔"""""
"4923","sydna abn amr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ahsan kay bdlay ahsan krta hay wh qtay twr pr rshth dary kw qaym rkhnay wala nhyn hay، blkh scha wh hay jw rshth dary kw brqrar rkhta hay، jb bhy as kay talqat mnqta hw jayyn tw phr bhy asay brqrar rkha jayay“۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4924","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh ayk aadmy nay arz kya: ya rswl allh! myray kchh rshth dar hyn jn say myn rshth dary krta hwn lykn wh mjh say rshth twr dytay hyn۔ myn an kay sath achha slwk krta hwn، lykn wh myray sath bra slwk krtay hyn۔ myn an kay sath sbr krta hwn، lykn wh mjh pr zlm krtay hyn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr tm jw khtay hw sch hay tw gwya tm an kay mnh myn grm rakh dal rhay hw، jb tk tm asy trh chltay rhw gay، an pr allh ky nsrt hw gy۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4925","swban rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”daa tqdyr kw bdl dyty hay، nyk aml amr kw brhata hay، awr bay shk bndh gnahwn ky wjh say rzq say mhrwm hw jata hay۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4926","am almomnyn aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn jnt myn dakhl hwyy tw myn nay whan qraat sny، tw myn nay pwchha: yh (tlawt) kwn hay، tw anhwn nay kha: yh harsh bn naman hay، yh nyky ka bdlh hay، achhay akhlaq ka ajr as trh hay۔ awr wh apny man kay sath bhtryn slwk krnay wala tha۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay awr dwsry rwayt myn \myn jnt myn dakhl hwa\"" kay bjayay yh alfaz hyn: \""myn nay khwab myn apnay aap kw jnt myn dykha۔\"" as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay shrh alsnn myn awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4927","abdallh bn amrw (myn allh ky rza kay sath hw) byanat krta hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay kha: \pryshany walay ka pryshan hy allh ka hay، awr khwsh hal walay ka khwsh hal hy allh ka hay۔\"" as ky rwayt hsn hay؛ altrmzy nay as ky rwayt ky hay۔"""""
"4928","abw drdaa rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh ayk aadmy an kay pas aaya awr kha: myry ayk bywy hay، lykn myry man mjhay hkm day rhy hay kh myn asay tlaq dwn۔ (yh sn kr) abw drdaa rzy allh anh nay an say kha kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: bap jnt ka bhtryn drwazh hay، agr chahw tw as drwazay ky hfazt kr، awr chahw tw zaya kr dw۔ hsn، asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4929","bhz bn hkym apnay wald say awr wh apnay dada say rwayt krtay hyn، anhwn nay kha: myn nay arz kya ya rswl allh! mjhay ks kay sath hsn slwk krna chahyay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: apny man kay sath۔ myn nay pwchha phr kwn؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: apny man kay sath۔ myn nay pwchha phr kwn؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: apny man kay sath۔ myn nay pwchha phr kwn؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: apny man kay sath۔ myn nay pwchha phr ks kay sath؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: apnay wald kay sath، phr qryby awr phr qryby rshth darwn kay sath (an kay sath hsn slwk krw)۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4930","abdalrhmn bn awf rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: allh taalyٰ frmata hay: myn allh hwn awr myn rhmn (rhmn) hwn، myn nay rhm (rhm) kw pyda kya awr as ka nam apnay nam say rkha js nay as kay sath talq qaym rkha، as kay sath jw bhy as ka talq qaym rkhay ga۔ tw kya myn asay (apny rhmt say) mhrwm kr dwn؟ shyh، abw daod nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"4931","abdallh bn aby awrf (myn allh ky rza kay sath hw) byanat krta hay kh: \myn nay rswl allh (ﷺ) say sna kh: 'rhmt kw ksy qwm pr nazl nhyn kya jata jb wh zndh hwn js kay pas khandan kay talqat twrnay wala hw۔'\"" as ky rwayt km zayf hay۔ albyhaqy nay shab alayman myn as ky rwayt ky hay۔"""""
"4932","abwbkrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”zlm، srkshy awr rshth daryan twrna aysay gnah hyn kh allh taalyٰ an kay mrtkb kw dnya myn sza dyta hay awr as kay alawh aakhrt myn bhy as kay lyay azab mhfwz rkhta hay۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4933","abdallh bn amrw rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”dwsrwn kw as kay ahsanat yad dlanay wala، waldyn ka nafrman awr shrab pynay wala jnt myn dakhl nhyn hw ga۔ as ka slslh achha hay۔ asay nsayy awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4934","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”apnay hsb w nsb kw as hd tk sykhw kh qrabt dary kw qaym rkhw، kywnkh qrabt dary say rshth darwn myn mhbt pyda hwty hay، mal myn azafh hwta hay awr amr draz hwty hay“۔ (trmzy) awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4935","sydna abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh ayk shkhs rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn hazr hwa awr arz kya: ya rswl allh! myn nay bht bra gnah kya hay tw kya myray lyay twbh ky kwyy gnjaysh hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya tmhary man hay؟ as nay jwab dya، nhyn، nby krym sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya tmhary khalh hay؟ as nay jwab dya، han۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: as kay sath hsn slwk krw۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4936","abw asyd saydy rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh hm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn thay kh qbylh bnw slmh ka ayk aadmy aaya awr khnay lga: ya rswl allh! kya myray waldyn kay mrnay kay bad an kay sath ahsan krnay ka kwyy tryqh hay js kay zryaay myn an kay sath achha slwk krta rhwn؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \han! an kay lyay daa krw، an kay lyay astghfar krw، an kay bad an kay ahd kw pwra krw، an kay rshth darwn kw qaym rkhw، awr an kay dwstwn ky azt krw۔\"" as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4937","abw tfyl rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw jranh kay mqam pr gwsht tqsym krtay dykha۔ achank ayk awrt aayy yhan tk kh wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay qryb phnchy tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay as kay lyay chadr bchha dy awr wh as pr byth gyy۔ myn nay pwchha wh kwn hay؟ anhwn nay jwab dya: \wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky rzaay waldh hyn۔\"" as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4938","Ibn Umar (RA) Nabi (SAW) se rivayat karte hain, aap ne farmaya: \Teen aadmi ek zamaane mein ek safar par gaye"","" baarish aayi"","" to wo ek pahad mein ek ghaar mein ja pahunche. Itne mein pahad se ek chattan gir padi aur ghaar ka muh band kar diya. Pas unhon ne aapas mein kaha: Tum apne a’maal ko jo tumne sirf Allah ki raza ke liye kiye the dobara yaad karo"","" aur unke zariye Allah se dua karo"","" shayad wo yeh pareshani (chattan) door kar de. Un mein se ek ne kaha: Aye Allah! Mere buzurg maa baap the aur chhote bachche the"","" aur main unki parwarish ka zimmedar tha. Jab shaam ko janwaron ke saath wapas aata to doodh nikaalta aur pehle apne maa baap ko pilaata phir bachcho ko. Ek baar main door jangal mein chala gaya to dair se ghar wapas louta aur un dono ko sota paya. Hamesha ki tarah maine janwaron ke doodh nikaale"","" phir doodh ka pyala lekar unke saron ke paas khada ho gaya. Mujhe unhe jagana munasib nahi laga"","" aur na hi un se pehle apne bachcho ko dena chahta tha"","" halaanke bachche bhook se mere paaon mein ro rahe the. Yeh halat raat bhar rahi. (Aye Allah!) Agar tu jaanta hai ke maine yeh sirf teri khushi ke liye kiya hai to humare liye koi raasta nikaal de taake hum aasmaan dekh sakein. Allah ne unke liye kuch raasta nikaal diya yahan tak ke wo aasmaan dekhne lage. Doosre ne kaha: Aye Allah! Meri ek chacha zad behn thi jisse main utna chahata tha jitna ek mard ek aurat se chah sakta hai. Mainne uske saath bura kam karne ki khwahish ka izhaar kiya"","" lekin usne inkar kiya"","" yahan tak ke maine usse sau dinar dene ka wada kiya. Maine mehnat kar ke sau dinar jama kiye aur uske paas laya"","" aur jab main uske dono paon ke beech mein baith gaya (ta ke bura kam karo)"","" to usne kaha: Aye Allah ke bande! Allah se dar aur na-jaayaz tareeqe se mohar tod. (Yeh sun kar) main uske upar se uth gaya. Aye Allah! Agar tu jaanta hai ke maine yeh sirf teri raza ke liye kiya hai to humare liye koi raasta nikaal de! Allah ne unke liye kuch raasta nikaal diya. Teesre shaks ne kaha: Aye Allah! Maine ek mazdoor ko ek measure (chhiyar) chawal ki mazdoori par rakha tha. Jab usne kaam mukammal kar liya to usne kaha: Mera haq muje do. Jab maine usse uska haq diya to usne use chhota samjha aur chhod kar chala gaya. Mainne us paise ko kheti mein laga diya yahan tak ke maine us se gaayein aur ek charewala jama kar liya. Wo mere paas aaya aur kaha: Allah se dar aur mujh par zulm na kar"","" aur mera haq muje de. Maine kaha: Yeh gaayein aur charewala le ja. Usne kaha: Allah se dar! Mera mazaq na uda. Maine kaha: Main mazaq nahi uda raha"","" yeh gaayein aur charewala le ja. Pas usne use le kar chala gaya. Agar tu jaanta hai ke maine yeh tere liye khushi hasil karne ke liye kiya hai to jo rasta baaki hai wo humare liye khol de. Pas Allah ne unke liye rasta khol diya (aur un ki pareshani door kar di).\"" Mutafaq Alaihi."""""
"4939","maawyh bn jhmh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh jhymh rzy allh anh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn hazr hwyay awr arz kya ya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm myn aap say jhad myn shrkt kay baray myn mshwrh krna chahta hwn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay pwchha kya tmhary man hay؟ as nay jwab dya kh han! aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh jao، as kay pas rhw، kywnkh jnt as kay qdmwn myn hay۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay ahmd، nsayy awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4940","abn amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myry ayk bywy thy jsay myn psnd krta tha lykn amr rzy allh anh asay napsnd krtay thay۔ as nay mjh say kha: asay tlaq day dw۔ myn nay ankar kr dya tw amr rzy allh anh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gyay awr aap say yh waqah byan kya۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjh say frmaya: asay tlaq day dw۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4941","abwamamh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh ayk aadmy nay pwchha: ya rswl allh! waldyn ka apny awlad pr kya hq hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: yh dwnwn tmhary jnt (sbb) awr tmhary jhnm (sbb) hyn۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4942","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ksy bnday kay man bap ya an myn say kwyy ayk as hal myn mr jata hay kh wh an ka nafrman tha، phr (an kay mrnay kay bad) an kay lyay daa krta rhta hay awr an kay lyay astghfar krta rhta hay، tw allh taalyٰ asay apnay waldyn kay sath nyky krnay wala lkhta hay۔ zayf، jsay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4943","abn abas rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay sbh kw allh ky ataat myn apnay waldyn kay hqwq kay baray myn gzara، as kay lyay jnt kay drwazay khwl dyay jatay hyn، awr agr srf ayk (waldyn) hw tw ayk hy drwazh hwta hay، awr js nay sbh kw allh ky nafrmany krtay hwyay gzara، as kay lyay as kay waldyn kay hqwq khlay hwyay hyn، tw as kay lyay jnt kay drwazay khlay hyn۔ ayk (waldyn)، phr (srf) ayk drwazh۔\ ayk aadmy nay pwchha، chahay wh as pr zlm kryn؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: khwah wh as pr zlm kryn، khwah wh as pr zlm kryn، awr khwah wh as pr zlm kryn۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4944","sydna abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb nyk bchh apnay waldyn ky trf rhmt ky nzr say dykhta hay tw allh taalyٰ as kay lyay hr as nzr kay bdlay myn mqbwl hj ka swab lkh dyta hay۔ shabh kram rzy allh anhm nay arz kya: \chahay wh rwzanh sw bar dykhay؟\"" aap (sly allh alyh waalh wslm) nay jwab dya: \""han، allh bht bra hay (js ka tswr bhy nhyn kya ja skta) awr (hr ayb say) pakyzh hay۔\"" as ka slslh mn ghrt hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4945","abw bkrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”waldyn ky nafrmany kay alawh allh taalyٰ jtnay gnah chahta hay bkhsh dyta hay، kywnkh jw shkhs yh (gnah) krta hay asay mwt say phlay asy zndgy myn sza dyta hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4946","sayd bn aas (myn allh ky rza kay sath hw) byanat krta hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay kha: \bray bhayy ka hq an kay chhwtay bhayywn pr aysa hy hay js trh bap ka hq bchwn pr hwta hay۔\"" amyr byhaqy nay as ky tmam panch hkmyat kw shab alayman myn rwayt ky hay۔ as ky rwayt km zayf hay۔ altrmzy w abn majh nay as ky rwayt ky hay۔"""""
"4947","7.\nJarir bin Abdullah (radiyallahu anhu) bayaan karte hain ki Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Allah ta’ala us shakhs par reham nahi karta jo logon par reham nahi karta.\"" Muta’faqun alaih."""""
"4948","aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh ayk aaraby nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya awr pwchha: kya aap bchwn kw bwsh dytay hyn، kywnkh hm anhyn nhyn chwmtay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya kh agr allh taalyٰ nay tyray dl say rhmt nkal dy hay (kh myn asay waps la skta hwn) tw myra tm pr kwyy akhtyar nhyn۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4949","aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh myray pas ayk awrt aayy awr as ky dw bytyan thyn۔ as nay mjh say (kchh kay lyay) pwchha، awr myray pas srf ayk tarykh thy، tw myn nay asay day dy۔ as nay asay apny dw bytywn myn bant dya awr khwd kchh nhyn khaya۔ phr wh ath kr chly gyy۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm myray pas tshryf layay tw myn nay aap sly allh alyh wslm say as ka zkr kya۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: jw shkhs an bytywn kay sath ksy bhy trh say aazmaya jayay awr an kay sath achha slwk kray tw yh as kay lyay jhnm ky aag say dhal bnyn gy۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4950","ans rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay dw bytywn ky prwrsh ky yhan tk kh wh balgh hw jayyn، wh qyamt kay dn myray sath as trh aayay ga“، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay apny anglyan aaps myn jwr lyn۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4951","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: bywh awr mskyn ky zrwryat ka khyal rkhnay wala allh ky rah myn jhad krnay walay ky trh hay۔ awr myra khyal hay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay yh bhy frmaya: \wh as shkhs ky trh hay jw bghyr thkay (rat kw nmaz myn) khra hw، awr as shkhs ky trh hay jw bghyr aftar kay mslsl rwzay rkhta hay۔\"" pr atfaq hwa۔"""""
"4952","shl bn sad rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn awr ytym ky kfalt krnay wala، khwah wh ytym apna hw ya ksy awr ka، jnt myn as trh hwn gay۔ awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay shhadt awr drmyany anglywn say asharh kya awr phr an kay drmyan thwra sa faslh kr dya۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4953","naman bn bshyr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm mwmnyn kw an ky bahmy shfqt، mhbt awr ayk dwsray kay sath hsn slwk myn ayk jsm ky trh pao gay، jb ayk azw kw tklyf phnchty hay tw pwra jsm bydary awr bkhar kay sath jwab dyta hay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4954","naman bn bshyr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tmam mwmn ayk jsm ky mannd hyn، agr as ky aankh tklyf myn hw tw sara jsm drd mhsws krta hay، awr agr as kay sr myn tklyf hw tw sara jsm tklyf mhsws krta hay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4955","Abu Musa (Razi Allah Anhu) Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) se riwayat karte hain, Aap (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: \Momin momin ke liye aik imarat ki tarah hai"","" jis ka ek hissa doosre hisse ko mazboot karta hai.\"" Phir Aap (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ne aik haath ki ungliyan doosre haath ki ungliyon mein mila li. Muttafiq Alayhi."""""
"4956","Abu Musa (Razi Allah Anhu) Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) se riwayat karte hain ke jab Aap (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ke paas koi maangne wala ya zaroorat mand aata to Aap (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) farmaya karte: \Sifarish karo"","" tumhen ajr milega"","" aur Allah Ta'ala apne Rasool ki zuban se jo chahe ga farmayega.\"" Muttafiq Alayhi."""""
"4957","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”apnay (mslman) bhayy ky mdd krw، khwah wh zalm hw ya mzlwm“۔ ayk aadmy nay pwchha: ya rswl allh! myn mzlwm ky mdd krwn ga، lykn zalm ky mdd kysay krwn؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \asay zlm say rwkna، yh hay kh tm as ky mdd krw۔\"" pr atfaq hwa۔"""""
"4958","sydna abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mslman mslman ka bhayy hay، nh as pr zlm krta hay awr nh asay (zalm kay hwalay krta hay)، jw shkhs apnay bhayy ky hajt pwry krnay myn lga rhta hay، allh taalyٰ as ky hajt pwry krta hay، awr jw shkhs mslman ky ayk mshkl kw dwr krta hay، allh taalyٰ as ky ayk mshkl dwr kr dyta hay“۔ js nay ksy mslman ky prdh pwshy ky allh taalyٰ qyamt kay dn as kay ayb chhpayay ga۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4959","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mslman mslman ka bhayy hay، wh as pr zlm nhyn krta، nh asay bay shara chhwrta hay awr nh asay hqyr janta hay، tqwyٰ yhan hay“، aap nay tyn bar apnay synay ky trf asharh kya۔ ’’aadmy kay lyay yhy kafy hay kh wh apnay mslman bhayy kw hqyr smjhay۔ hr mslman ka khwn، mal awr azt dwsray mslman pr hram hay۔‘‘ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4960","ayaz bn hmar rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jnt walay tyn qsm kay hyn: ayk aadl، sdqh krnay wala awr kamyab hkmran، (dwsra) wh shkhs jw hr rshth dar (khswsaً) awr hr mslman (aam twr pr) kay sath nrm dl hw، awr (tysray) khandan say adawt rkhnay wala۔ jhan tk ahl jhnm ka talq hay tw wh panch qsm kay hyn: kmzwr wh jw aql nhyn rkhta (js say wh brayy say bch skta hay)، wh jw aap kay matht hyn، jn kw (hlal) ahl w ayal ky kwyy khwahsh nhyn، khyant krnay wala wh jw ksy chhwty chyz ky bhy lalch kray tw as myn khyant kray، wh shkhs jw sbh w sham (hr mwqa pr) tmhyn tmharay ahl w ayal kay baray myn dhwkh dyta hay۔ awr bkhyl ya jhwtay ka zkr kya۔ \awr wh bdtmyz shkhs jw bd zban hw۔\"" asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4961","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as zat ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay، tm myn say kwyy shkhs as wqt tk mwmn nhyn hw skta jb tk wh apnay bhayy kay lyay why psnd nh kray jw apnay lyay psnd krta hay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4962","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh ky qsm! wh mwmn nhyn، allh ky qsm! wh mwmn nhyn، allh ky qsm! wh mwmn nhyn hay۔ pwchha gya: ya rswl allh! kwn (mwmn nhyn hay)؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: wh shkhs js ka prwsy as kay shr say mhfwz nh rhay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4963","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js ka prwsy as kay shr say mhfwz nh hw wh jnt myn dakhl nhyn hw ga۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4964","aayshh awr abn amr rzy allh anhma nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” jbrayyl mjhay prwsy kay baray myn nsyht krtay rhay yhan tk kh myn nay swcha kh wh asay wars bnadyn gay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4965","abdallh bn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm tyn sal kay hw jao tw tm myn say dw aadmy tysray kw chhwr kr chpkay say bat nh kryn jb tk kh dwsray lwgwn say nh ml jayyn، kywnkh yh tryqh asay (tysray kw) ghmgyn kray ga۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"4966","tmym dary rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay tyn bar frmaya: ”dyn akhlas awr khyr khwahy hay“۔ hm nay pwchha ks kay lyay؟ frmaya: allh kay lyay، as ky ktab kay lyay، as kay rswl kay lyay، mslmanwn kay qaydyn kay lyay awr aam mslmanwn kay lyay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4967","jryr bn abdallh (myn allh ky rza kay sath hw) byanat krta hay kh: \myn nay rswl allh (ﷺ) pr byat ky thy kh pryshany، zkat ka adayygy، awr hr mslman kay sath nyk snt rkhnay kay lyay hwn۔\"" mtfq hay۔"""""
"4968","abw hyrh (myn allh ky rza kay sath hw) byanat krta hay kh: \myn nay abw alqasm alsadq (ﷺ) say sna kh: 'rhmt srf ayh hwty hay jw bhtyar shkhs say nkl jaty hay۔'\"" as ky rwayt hsn hay۔ altrmzy awr ahmd nay as ky rwayt ky hay۔"""""
"4969","abdallh bn amrw rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: rhm krnay walwn pr rhm krnay wala rhm krta hay، zmyn walwn pr rhm krw، aasman wala tm pr rhm kray ga۔ as ka slslh achha hay۔ asay abwdaod awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4970","abn abas rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw hmaray chhwtwn pr rhm nhyn krta، hmaray brwn ky azt nhyn krta، nyky ka hkm nhyn dyta awr brayy say mna nhyn krta، wh hm myn say nhyn“۔ (trmzy) awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4971","ans rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay ksy bwrhay ky as kay brhapay ky wjh say tazym ky، allh taalyٰ as kay brhapay myn as ky tazym kay lyay ksy kw mqrr kray ga۔ as ky snd zayf hay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4972","sydna abw mwsyٰ rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bzrg mslman ky tazym krna، aysay hafz qraan ky tazym krna jw hd say zyadh kam nh kray، awr aadl hkmran ky tazym allh ky tazym myn say hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay abwdaod awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4973","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mslmanwn myn sb say bhtr ghr wh hay js myn kwyy ytym hw awr as kay sath achha slwk kya jata hw، awr mslmanwn myn sb say bra ghr wh hay js myn kwyy ytym hw awr as kay sath bra slwk kya jata hw“۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4974","abwamamh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay allh ky rza kay lyay apna hath ksy ytym kay sr pr phyra tw as kay hath kay gzrnay walay hr bal kay bdlay as kw ayk nyky mlay gy، awr js nay ksy ytym kay sath hsn slwk kya، wh as ky prwrsh myn as lrkay awr lrky ky trh hwn gay، jysa kh myn as ky srprsty myn hwn ga۔ awr as nay apny dwnwn anglyan aaps myn jwr dyn۔ (asay ahmd، trmzy nay rwayt kya hay، awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay، as ky snd zayf hay۔ asay ahmd awr trmzy nay bhy rwayt kya hay۔)"
"4975","sydna abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay ksy ytym kw apnay khanay pynay myn shaml kya، allh taalyٰ as kay lyay jnt wajb kr dyta hay، bshrtykh as nay kwyy naqabl maafy gnah nh kya hw، awr jw shkhs tyn bytywn ky prwrsh krta hay ya zyadh say zyadh bhnwn ky prwrsh krta hay، tw wh tmam bhnwn ky prwrsh krta hay۔ an ky zrwrtwn pr allh taalyٰ as shkhs pr jnt wajb kr dyta hay۔ ayk aadmy nay pwchha: ya rswl allh! as kay baray myn kya khyal hay jw dw ka khyal rkhta hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: han، dw bhy۔ as nay pwchha bhy tw ayk ka kya؟ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm frmatay: ayk bhy۔ ’’awr agr allh taalyٰ ksy shkhs say dw qymty chyzyn chhyn lay tw as kay lyay jnt wajb hw jaty hay۔‘‘ pwchha gya: ya rswl allh! dw qymty chyzwn say kya mrad hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: as ky dwnwn aankhyn۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay shrh alsn myn rwayt kya gya hay۔"
"4976","jabr bn smrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aadmy ka apnay bchay ky achhy prwrsh as kay lyay ayk saa sdqh krnay say bhtr hay۔ trmzy، awr anhwn nay kha: yh hdys ghryb hay، awr nash rawy mhdsyn kay nzdyk qwy nhyn hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4977","aywb bn mwsyٰ apnay wald say awr wh apnay dada say rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: man bap ka apny awlad kw bhtryn thfh an ky achhy prwrsh hay۔ trmzy، byhqy، shab alayman myn۔ awr amam trmzy nay kha: myray nzdyk yh hdys mrsl hay۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay trmzy awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4978","awf bn malk ashjay rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn awr syah chhray waly awrt (wh bywh js ka chhrh mhnt ky wjh say syah hw gya hw) qyamt kay dn as trh hwn gay۔ awr yzyd bn zray nay apny drmyany angly awr shhadt ky angly ky trf asharh kya۔ \nyz wh awrt js ka shwhr fwt hw jayay awr wh apnay ytym bchwn ky wjh say as wqt tk shady nhyn krty jb tk kh wh bray nh hw jayyn ya mr jayyn۔\"" as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4979","sydna abn abas rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: js ky byty hw awr wh asay zndh dfn nh kray، as ky tzlyl nh kray awr apnay bytay kw as pr trjyh nh day tw allh asay jnt myn dakhl kray ga۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4980","ans rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs apnay mslman bhayy ky as ky mwjwdgy myn ghybt kray awr wh as ky hmayt awr dfaa pr qadr hw awr wh aysa kray tw allh taalyٰ dnya awr aakhrt myn as ky mdd w nsrt kray ga، lykn agr as ky taqt hwnay kay bawjwd as ky mdd nh kray tw dnya awr aakhrt myn allh taalyٰ as ky mdd kay bghyr asay chhwr day ga۔ kmzwr، yhan tk kh mn ghrt۔ shrh alsn myn rwayt hay۔"
"4981","asmaa bnt yzyd rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs apnay (mslman) bhayy ky ghyr mwjwdgy myn as ky ghybt nh kray tw allh taalyٰ pr yh hq hay kh wh asay jhnm ky aag say aazad kr day۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4982","abw drdaa rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”js nay apnay mslman bhayy ky azt ka dfaa kya، allh taalyٰ pr yh frz hay kh wh qyamt kay dn as ky jhnm say hfazt kray۔ phr aap nay yh aayt tlawt frmayy: ’’mwmnyn ky mdd krna hm pr frz hay‘‘۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay shrh alsn myn rwayt kya gya hay۔"
"4983","sydna jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay ksy mslman kw aysy jgh chhwr dya jhan as ky azt w aabrw mjrwh hw rhy hw، allh taalyٰ asay aysy jgh chhwr day ga jhan asay mdd ky zrwrt hw gy، awr jw shkhs ksy mslman ky aysy jgh mdd kray ga jhan as ky azt w aabrw mjrwh hw rhy hw، allh taalyٰ as ky aysy mdd kray ga jhan as ky azt w aabrw mjrwh hw rhy hw“۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4984","aqbh bn aamr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay (ksy ka) ayb dykha awr asay chhpaya tw wh as shkhs ky trh hay js nay ksy zndh dfn kw zndh kya۔ ahmd، trmzy awr anhwn nay asay shyh qrar dya۔ hsn، asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4985","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk tm myn say hr ayk apnay (mslm) bhayy kay lyay aayynh hay، agr wh as myn kwyy ayb dykhay tw asay as say dwr kr day۔ __REF_N__ trmzy nay asay zayf qrar dya hay۔ trmzy awr abwdaod ky rwayt myn hay: \ayk mwmn dwsray mwmn ka aayynh hay، awr ayk mwmn dwsray mwmn ka bhayy hay، wh asay nqsan nhyn phnchata awr as ky ghyr mwjwdgy myn as ky (as ky jan، mal awr azt) ky hfazt krta hay۔\"" __REF_N__ zayf jza، jsay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔ hsn، abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4986","maaz bn ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ksy mwmn ky azt kw mnafq say bchata hay، allh taalyٰ qyamt kay dn ayk frshth bhyjay ga jw as kay gwsht kw jhnm ky aag say bchayay ga، awr js nay ksy mslman pr kwyy thmt lgayy، allh taalyٰ as kw rswa kr day ga، yhan tk kh allh taalyٰ as kw rswa kr day ga۔ as nay kya kha۔\ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4987","abdallh bn amrw rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh kay nzdyk bhtryn sathy wh hay jw apnay sathy kay lyay bhtryn hw، awr allh kay nzdyk bhtryn prwsy wh hay jw apnay prwsy kay lyay bhtryn hw۔ trmzy، darmy awr trmzy nay kha: yh hdys hsn ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay trmzy awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4988","abn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh ayk aadmy nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha: ya rswl allh! mjhay kysay pth chlay ga kh myn achha hwn ya bra؟ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \jb tm apnay prwsywn kw yh khtay hwyay snw kh tm achhay hw tw tm achhay hw، awr jb tm anhyn yh khtay hwyay snw kh tm bra hw tw tm bra hw۔\"" as ka slslh shyh hay jsay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4989","aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”lwgwn kay sath an kay mrtbay awr mrtbay kay mtabq slwk krw۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4990","Abdur Rehman bin Abi Qurad (Razi Allah Anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek din Nabi Kareem (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ne wuzu kiya, to Aap ke sahaba (Razi Allah Anhum) ne Aap ke wuzu ka pani apne jismon par malna shuru kar diya. Aap (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ne un se farmaya: \Tumhen is cheez ne aisa karne par majboor kiya?\"" Unhone kaha: Allah aur uske Rasool ki muhabbat. Aap (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: \""Jo shakhs Allah aur uske Rasool se muhabbat karna chahe"","" ya chahe ke Allah aur uske Rasool us se muhabbat kare"","" to jab baat kare to sach bole; jab koi cheez uske paas amaanat rakhi jaye to woh use wapas kare; aur apne padosiyon aur un logon ke saath jo us se milte hain"","" nek sulook kare.\"" Is ki sanad zaeef hai. Al-Bayhaqi ne Shu'ab al-Iman mein riwayat kiya."""""
"4991","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: ”wh mwmn nhyn jw pyt bhr kr khayay awr as ka qryby prwsy bhwka hw۔ amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn dwnwn hdysyn nql ky hyn۔ as ka slslh rwayt zayf hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4992","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh ayk aadmy nay arz kya: ya rswl allh! flan awrt apny ksrt nmaz، rwzh awr sdqh ky wjh say mshhwr hay، lykn wh apny tyz zban say prwsywn kw ayza dyty hay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh wh jhnm myn hay۔ as aadmy nay arz kya ya rswl allh! flan awrt nmaz، rwzay awr sdqh ky tngy kay lyay mshhwr hay awr wh srf chnd pnyr sdqh krty hay lykn zban say apnay prwsywn kw tklyf nhyn dyty۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh wh jnt myn hay۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay ahmd awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4993","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kchh lwgwn kay pas khray hwyay jw bythay hwyay thay، awr frmaya: kya myn tmhyn tmharay bdtryn awr bhtryn lwgwn kay baray myn nh btaon؟ rawy khta hay، wh khamwsh rhay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay yh tyn bar frmaya، tw ayk aadmy nay arz kya ya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm yqynaً hmyn hmaray bdtrynwn myn say bhtryn kay baray myn bta dyn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm myn say bhtryn wh hay js say khyr ky amyd ky jayay awr lwg as kay shr say mhfwz rhyn، awr tm myn say bdtryn wh hay js say khyr ky amyd nh hw awr lwg as kay shr say mhfwz nh hwn۔ (trmzy، byhqy shab alayman myn) awr amam trmzy nay kha: yh hdys hsn shyh hay۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay trmzy awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4994","abn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk allh taalyٰ nay tmharay drmyan tmharay krdar kw asy trh tqsym kr dya hay js trh as nay tmharay mal kw tqsym kya hay، bay shk allh taalyٰ dnya hr as shkhs kw dyta hay، chahay wh asay psnd kray ya napsnd، lykn dyn srf asy kw dyta hay js say wh mhbt krta hay، phr wh js say mhbt krta hay asay dyn ata krta hay۔ as zat ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay kwyy bndh as wqt tk mslman nhyn hw skta jb tk as ka dl awr as ky zban mslman nh hw jayay awr wh as wqt tk mwmn nhyn hw skta jb tk as ka prwsy as kay shr say mhfwz nh hw jayay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay ahmd awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4995","Abu Huraira (Razi Allah Anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: \Momin mukammal muhabbat karne wala hota hai"","" aur jo shakhs na muhabbat kare aur na us se muhabbat kiya jaye"","" us mein koi khair nahi.\"" Ahmad aur Bayhaqi ne Shu'ab al-Iman mein riwayat kiya. Sahih hai"","" Ahmad aur Al-Bayhaqi ne Shu'ab al-Iman mein riwayat kiya."""""
"4996","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay myry amt myn say ksy ky hajt pwry ky js kay zryaay wh asay khwsh krna chahay tw as nay mjhay khwsh kya، js nay mjhay khwsh kya as nay allh kw khwsh kya، awr js nay allh kw khwsh kya، allh asay jnt myn dakhl kray ga۔ as ka slslh mn ghrt hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4997","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ksy msybt zdh ky mdd krta hay، allh taalyٰ as kay lyay thtr (73) bkhshshyn lkhta hay، an myn say ayk as kay tmam amwr ky aslah kay lyay hay، awr bqyh 72 (72) gnah as kay rwzِ qyamt aafyt ka zryah hwn gay۔ as ka slslh mn ghrt hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4998","ans awr abdallh rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mkhlwq allh ka knbh hay awr allh kay nzdyk mkhlwq myn sb say zyadh mhbwb wh hay jw as kay knbay kay sath achha slwk kray۔ amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn tynwn hdysyn nql ky hyn۔ as ka slslh rwayt zayf hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4999","ans awr abdallh ؓ byan krtay hyn ، rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya :’’ mkhlwq allh ky ayal (zyr kfalt) hay ، awr mkhlwq myn say wh shkhs allh kw zyadh psnd hay jw as ky ayal say achha slwk krta hay ۔‘‘ amam byhqy nay tynwn ahadys shab alayman myn byan ky hyn ۔ asnadh zayf jza ، rwah albyhqy fy shab alayman ۔"
"5000","Uqbah bin Amir (Razi Allah Anhu) riwayat karte hain: Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: \Qayamat ke din do padosiyon ke darmiyan ka muqaddama pehle pesh kiya jayega.\"" Hasan hai"","" Ahmad ne riwayat kiya."""""
"5001","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh ayk aadmy nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say apnay dl ky skhty ky shkayt ky۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ytym kay sr pr hath marw awr mskyn kw khana khlao۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5002","sydna sraqh bn malk rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kya myn tmhyn bhtryn sdqh nh btaon؟ yh aap ky byty kw sdqh krna hay jw aap kay pas waps aayay (tlaq ya asy trh ky wjwhat ky bnaa pr) awr as kay lyay aap kay alawh kwyy kmanay wala nh hw۔\ as ky snd zayf hay، asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5003","am almomnyn aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: rwhyn bhrty hwyy fwjwn ky trh hyn، jw lwg (dnya myn) ayk dwsray say waqf hwn gay wh (dnya myn) ayk dwsray say dwsty kryn gay، awr jn lwgwn nay bygangy mhsws ky thy wh akhtlaf myn rhyn gay۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5004","amam mslm (myn allh ky rza kay sath hw) nay as ky rwayt ky hay۔ altrmzy w abn majh nay as ky rwayt ky hay۔"
"5005","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk allh taalyٰ jb ksy bnday say mhbt krta hay tw jbrayyl alyh alslam kw blata hay awr frmata hay: ”bay shk myn flan say mhbt krta hwn، tm bhy as say mhbt krw“۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: jbryyl alyh alslam as say mhbt krtay hyn، phr wh aasman walwn myn aalan krtay hyn: bay shk allh flan say mhbt krta hay، tm bhy as say mhbt krw۔ ahlِ aasman as say mhbt krtay hyn، phr ahlِ zmyn myn as ky qbwlyt hwty hay۔ awr jb allh taalyٰ ksy bnday kw napsnd krta hay tw jbrayyl alyh alslam kw blata hay awr khta hay kh myn flan kw napsnd krta hwn tw tm bhy asay napsnd krtay hw۔ jbrayyl alyh alslam asay napsnd krtay hyn، phr wh aasman walwn myn aalan krtay hyn kh allh taalyٰ flan kw napsnd krta hay، as lyay tm bhy asay napsnd krtay hw۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: wh asay napsnd krtay hyn، phr ahl zmyn kay dlwn myn as kay lyay nfrt pyda hw jaty hay۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5006","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk allh taalyٰ qyamt kay dn frmayay ga: khan hyn wh lwg jnhwn nay ayk dwsray say myry azmt awr bzrgy ky wjh say mhbt ky، aaj myn anhyn apnay sayay myn pnah dwn ga، as dn jb myray sayay kay swa kwyy sayh nh hw ga۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5007","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn kh ayk aadmy dwsray shhr myn apnay ayk (mslman) bhayy ky ayadt kay lyay nkla۔ tw allh nay as kay rastay pr ayk frshth mqrr kr dya jw as ka antzar kr rha tha۔ (jb wh frshtay kay pas say gzra tw) frshtay nay kha: tm khan jana chahtay hw؟ as aadmy nay jwab dya: myn as bsty myn apnay ayk (mslm) bhayy say mlnay ja rha hwn۔ frshtay nay pwchha: kya as nay tm pr kwyy ahsan kya hay js ka bdlh tm ada krw gay؟ as nay kha: as kay swa kwyy wjh nhyn kh myn as say allh kay lyay mhbt krta hwn۔ (frshtay nay) kha: myn allh ky trf say tmhary trf bhyja hwa hwn takh tmhyn khbr dwn kh js trh tm allh kay lyay as say mhbt krtay hw asy trh allh bhy tm say mhbt krta hay۔ \mslm nay rwayt ky hay۔\"""""""
"5008","abn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh ayk aadmy nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm ky khdmt myn hazr hwa awr arz kya ya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm aap as shkhs kay baray myn kya frmatay hyn jw kchh lwgwn say mhbt krta hay lykn an kay sath (shbt ya alm w aml myn) shryk nhyn hwa؟ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: aadmy an kay sath hw ga js say wh mhbt krta hay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5009","sydna ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh ayk aadmy nay pwchha ya rswl allh! qyamt kb aayay gy؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm pr afsws! tm nay as kay lyay kya tyary ky hay؟ as nay jwab dya kh myry tyary srf yh hay kh myn allh awr as kay rswl say mhbt krta hwn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya tm an kay sath hw gay jn say tm mhbt krtay hw۔ ans rzy allh anh nay kha kh myn nay mslmanwn kw aslam qbwl krnay kay bad as byan pr as say zyadh khwsh hwtay nhyn dykha۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5010","sydna abw mwsyٰ rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”achhay sathy awr bray sathy ky msal mshk bychnay walay awr lwhar ky sy hay jw bhndy phwnkta hay، mshk bychnay wala ya tw tmhyn kchh (mshk) thfay myn day skta hay، ya tm as say as kay awz khryd sktay hw ya as kay bdlay myn asay khryd lw۔ jw dharyn marta hay wh tmharay kpray jla skta hay wrnh tmhyn as say bdbw aayay gy۔\ pr atfaq hwa۔"""""
"5011","maaz bn jbl rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: ”allh taalyٰ ka arshad hay: jw lwg myry khatr ayk dwsray say mhbt krtay hyn، myry khatr ayk dwsray say mltay hyn awr myry khatr ayk dwsray pr khrch krtay hyn، as pr myry mhbt wajb hw jaty hay۔ (malk) awr trmzy ky rwayt myn hay: \allh taalyٰ ka arshad hay: myry azmt w bzrgy ky khatr ayk dwsray say mhbt krnay walwn kay lyay nwr kay mnbr hyn، jn say anbyaa awr shhdaa bhy rshk kryn gay۔\"" shyh، asay malk awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5012","amr rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh kay bndwn myn say kchh lwg aysay hyn jw nh nby hyn awr nh shhdaa، lykn qyamt kay dn anbyaa awr shhdaa bhy allh kay nzdyk an kay mrtbay awr mrtbay pr rshk kryn gay۔ shabh kram rzy allh anhm nay pwchha: ya rswl allh! brah krm hmyn btayyn kh yh kwn lwg hyn؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: yh wh lwg hyn jw aaps myn ksy khandany rshtay ky wjh say nhyn awr nh hy ksy maly lyn dyn ky wjh say ayk dwsray say mhbt krtay hyn blkh srf allh ky khatr awr qraan ky ataat kay lyay ayk dwsray say mhbt awr myl jwl rkhtay hyn، allh ky qsm an kay chhray nwrany hwn gay awr wh nwr kay mnbrwn pr hwn gay، jb dwsray khwfzdh hwn gay، ghmgyn nhyn hwn gay، jb wh khwfzdh nhyn hwn gay۔ phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay yh aayt tlawt frmayy: \dykhw، allh kay dwstwn pr nh kwyy khwf hw ga awr nh wh ghmgyn hwn gay۔\"" hsn، abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5013","awr as nay (amam bghwy) nay asay shrh alsnn myn abw malk ky snd say msbahy kay alfaz kay sath kchh azafay kay sath rwayt kya hay awr asy trh shab alayman myn bhy hay۔ hsn، shrh alsn، msbahy alsn، awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt ky hay۔"
"5014","abn abas rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay abwzr rzy allh anh say frmaya: ”abwzr! ayman ka kwn sa hsh (phlw) sb say mzbwt awr mzbwt hay؟ as nay jwab dya kh allh awr as ka rswl hy bhtr jantay hyn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: allh ky rza kay lyay ayk dwsray say mhbt awr hmayt krna، allh kay lyay mhbt krna awr allh kay lyay bghz rkhna۔ zayf، jsay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5015","sydna abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb kwyy mslman apnay (mslman) bhayy ky ayadt krta hay jw bymar hw ya as say mlaqat krta hay tw allh taalyٰ frmata hay: tmhary aakhrt ky zndgy achhy hw gyy، tmhara chlna phrna achha hw gya awr tw nay apnay lyay jnt myn jgh bna ly۔ (trmzy) awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5016","mqdam bn madykrb rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb aadmy apnay (mslm) bhayy say mhbt kray tw asay btana chahyay kh wh as say mhbt krta hay“۔ as ka slslh achha hay۔ asay abwdaod awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5017","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh ayk aadmy nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm kay pas say gzra awr kchh lwg aap sly allh alyh wslm kay sath thay۔ an lwgwn myn say ayk nay kha: myn as shkhs say allh kay lyay mhbt krta hwn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya tm nay asay khbr dy hay؟ as nay jwab dya: nhyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: as kay pas jao awr asay btao۔ chnanchh wh as shkhs kay pas gya awr as say kha (kh myn tm say allh ky khatr mhbt krta hwn)۔ as nay jwab dya: js ky khatr tw mjh say mhbt krta hay wh bdlay myn tjh say mhbt kray۔ rawy khtay hyn: phr wh shkhs waps aaya tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as say pwchha tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab say aagah kya۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm as kay sath hw gay js say tm mhbt krtay hw، awr tmhyn wh ajr mlay ga jw tm chahtay hw“۔ (byhqy nay shab alayman myn)۔ awr trmzy ky rwayt myn hay: \ayk shkhs as kay sath hw ga js say wh mhbt kray ga، awr asay as kay kyay ka bdlh mlay ga۔\"" as ky snd zayf hay jsay byhqy nay shab alayman awr altrmzy myn rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5018","sydna abw sayd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”tm srf mwmn ky shbt akhtyar krw، awr tmhara khana srf mtqy hy khayay“۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr aldarmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5019","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aadmy apnay dwst kay dyn pr hwta hay، lhza tm myn say hr ayk kw yh dykhna chahyay kh wh ks say dwsty kr rha hay۔ ahmd، trmzy، abwdaod، byhqy، shab alayman myn۔ awr amam trmzy rhmh allh khtay hyn: yh hdys hsn ghryb hay، awr amam nwwy rhmh allh nay kha: as ky snd shyh hay۔ asay ahmd، trmzy، abwdaod awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5020","yzyd bn namh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb kwyy aadmy ksy dwsray aadmy say bhayy charh kray tw asay chahyay kh as say as ka nam، as kay wald ka nam awr as kay qbylay kay baray myn pwchhay، kywnkh as say dwsty brh jaty hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5021","abwzr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hmaray pas tshryf layay awr frmaya: kya tm jantay hw kh allh kay nzdyk kwn sa aml sb say zyadh mhbwb hay؟ ayk shaby nay kha: nmaz، zkw، awr dwsray nay kha: jhad۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: allh kay nzdyk sb say psndydh aml allh kay lyay mhbt krna awr allh kay lyay bghz rkhna hay۔ (ahmd) awr abwdaod nay aakhry hsh rwayt kya hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5022","abw amamh (myn allh ky rza kay sath hw) byanat krta hay kh: \jw lwg dyn allh kay lyay pyaray krtay hyn، tw wh apnay prwrdgar ky azt، alazyz w aljlyl kw prstar krtay hyn۔\"" as ky rwayt hsn hay۔ altrmzy nay as ky rwayt ky hay۔"""""
"5023","asmaa bnt yzyd rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna: kya myn tmhyn tm myn say bhtryn kay baray myn nh btaon؟ shabh kram rzy allh anhm nay arz kya ya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hmyn btayyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm myn sb say bhtr wh hay kh jb anhyn dykha jayay tw allh ka zkr hw۔ hsn، abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5024","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb dw bnday allh taalyٰ kay lyay ayk dwsray say mhbt krtay hyn، ayk mshrq myn awr dwsra mghrb myn، tw qyamt kay dn allh taalyٰ an dwnwn kw aktha kray ga awr frmayay ga: yh why hay js say tm myry mhbt krtay thay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5025","abw rzyn (lwqyt bn aamr bn sbrh، myn allh ky rza kay sath hw) byanat krta hay kh: \kya myn aap kw btayyn kh as dyn ky bnyad kya hay js say aap dr dnya waakhrt myn khwshhaly hasl kryn؟ hr ksy ky mlaqat kw jwr dyn، awr jb aap akylay hw tw lsan kw allh ky zr myn rwk rkhyn، jysa kh bht zyadh kr sktay hyn، awr dwsty kay lyay pyar kryn awr dshmny kay lyay nfrt kryn۔ abw rzyn! kya aap jantay hyn؟ jb aadmy apnay (mslm) bhayy ky trf aata hay، bysbayyn frshtay hy sath as kay sath chltay hyn awr sb yh prstar krtay hyn kh: hmaray prwrdgar! as nay aap ky rza kay lyay talq qyam kya hay، tw aap as sath shaml hwn۔ agr aap apnay jsm kw yh kam krnay myn mjbwr hw tw aysa kryn۔\"" as ky rwayt km zayf hay؛ altrmzy w albyhaqy nay as ky rwayt ky hay۔"""""
"5026","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas tha، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jnt myn yaqwt kay stwn hyn، an pr zmrd kay hjray hyn، an kay drwazay khlay hwyay hyn awr wh rwshn starwn ky trh chmktay hyn۔ shabh kram rzy allh anhm nay arz kya: ya rswl allh! an myn kwn rhay ga؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: jw allh kay lyay ayk dwsray say mhbt krtay hyn، allh kay lyay akthay bythtay hyn awr allh kay lyay ayk dwsray say mlnay walay hyn۔ amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn tynwn hdysyn nql ky hyn۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5027","abw aywb ansary rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ksy aadmy kay lyay jayz nhyn kh wh apnay (mslman) bhayy say tyn dn say zyadh talqat mnqta rkhay، jb wh mltay hyn tw dwnwn ayk dwsray say mnh phyr lytay hyn، awr dwnwn myn bhtr wh hay jw slam ky abtda kray۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5028","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” bdgmany say bchw، kywnkh bdgmany sb say bra jhwt hay، ayk dwsray kay ayb tlash nh krw، nh ayk dwsray ky jaswsy krw، ayk dwsray pr qymtyn nh chrhao، nh ayk dwsray say bghz nh rkhw، nh hy ayk dwsray kay sath bghz rkhw، nh hsd krw۔ allh aaps myn bhayy bhayy bn jao۔\ ayk dwsry rwayt myn hay: (awr hsd ky wjh say ayk dwsray pr sbqt lynay ky kwshsh nh krw)۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"""""
"5029","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jnt kay drwazay swmwar awr jmarat kw khwlay jatay hyn، awr hr bndh jw allh kay sath ksy chyz kw shryk nhyn krta، as ky bkhshsh kr dy jaty hay، swayay as shkhs kay jw apnay bhayy say dshmny awr bghz rkhta hay، arshad hwta hay: anhyn mhlt dw yhan tk kh wh slh kr lyn۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5030","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”lwgwn kay aamal hr hftay myn dw bar pysh kyay jatay hyn، pyr awr jmarat kw، hr mwmn bnday ky bkhshsh ky jaty hay swayay as kay jw apnay bhayy say dshmny awr bghz rkhta hw، kha jata hay kh an dwnwn kw chhwr dw yhan tk kh wh slh kr lyn۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5031","am klswm bnt aqbh bn aby mayt rzy allh anh byan krty hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: ”lwgwn kay drmyan slh kranay wala jhwta nhyn hay، wh achhy bat khta hay awr achhy bat (dwnwn trf) phnchata hay۔ amam mslm nay yh azafh nql kya hay: am klswm rzy allh anha nay kha kh myn nay anhyn nhyn sna yany rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay tyn chyzwn kay alawh ksy bhy maamlay myn jhwt bwlnay ky ajazt nhyn dy: jng myn، lwgwn kay drmyan slh krnay myn، awr myan bywy kay drmyan gftgw myn۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5032","Narrated by Muslim from Jabir (may Allah be pleased with him): \Satan has despaired.\"" This is mentioned in the chapter of Waswasah."""""
"5033","asmaa bnt yzyd rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jhwt bwlna srf tyn swrtwn myn jayz hay: aadmy apny bywy kw khwsh krnay kay lyay jhwt bwlay، jng kay wqt jhwt bwlay، awr lwgwn kay drmyan slh kranay kay lyay jhwt bwlay۔ shyh، asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5034","Narrated by Abu Dawood from Aisha (may Allah be pleased with her): The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \It is not appropriate for a Muslim to cut off relations with another Muslim for more than three days. When he meets him"","" he should greet him with salam three times. If each time the other does not respond to the salam"","" then (the one who offered salam) is absolved of the sin of breaking relations.\"" The chain is Hasan."""""
"5035","sydna abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ksy mslman kay lyay jayz nhyn kh wh apnay (mslman) bhayy say tyn dn say zyadh talqat mnqta rkhay، jw shkhs tyn dn say zyadh talqat mnqta rkhay awr asy halt myn mray tw wh jhnm myn jayay ga۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5036","abwkhrash slmy rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: js nay apnay bhayy say ayk sal tk myl jwl twray tw gwya as nay apna khwn bhaya۔ hsn، abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5037","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ksy momn kay lyay jayz nhyn kh wh dwsray momn say tyn dn say zyadh dwr rhay، jb tyn dn gzr jayyn tw asay chahyay kh as say mlay awr asay slam kray، agr dwsra slam ka jwab day tw dwnwn as kay swab myn shryk hwn gay، lykn agr as nay jwab nh dya tw dwnwn ka hsh hay۔ js nay slam kya wh prhyzgary say bry hay۔\ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5038","abw drdaa rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kya myn tmhyn rwzay، sdqh awr nmaz say afzl aml nh btaon؟ rawy khtay hyn kh hm nay kha: hmyn btao۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: dw fryqwn، dwstwn ya rshth darwn kay drmyan slh krwana، kywnkh dw fryqwn kay drmyan akhtlaf nykywn kw brbad krnay waly sft hay۔ abwdaod، trmzy awr amam trmzy rhmh allh khtay hyn: yh hdys shyh hay۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5039","sydna zbyr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm myn pchhly amtwn ky bymary dakhl hw gyy hay، hsd، bghz awr adawt، awr yh wh chyz hay jw nykywn kw brbad kr dyty hay، myn yh nhyn khta kh yh balwn kw kat dyty hay، blkh yh dyn kw tbah kr dyty hay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5040","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hsd say bchw، kywnkh hsd nykywn kw as trh kha jata hay js trh aag lkry kw kha jaty hay۔ as ka slslh rwayt zayf hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5041","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”dwnwn (fryqwn، dwstwn، rshth darwn) kay drmyan jhgra krnay say bchw، kywnkh yh (dyn) kw tbah kr dyta hay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay jsay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5042","abwsrmh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ksy (mslman) kw tklyf phnchayay ga، allh taalyٰ as kay bdlay myn asay nqsan phnchayay ga، awr jw ksy kw tklyf myn dalay ga، allh asay skhty myn dalay ga۔ abn majh، trmzy، awr anhwn nay kha: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay abn majh awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5043","abwbkr sdyq rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mlawn hay as shkhs pr jw ksy mwmn kw ayza day ya asay dhwkh day“۔ trmzy، awr frmaya: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5044","abn amr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm mnbr pr tshryf lay gyay awr blnd aawaz say aalan frmaya: ”lwgw! tm myn say wh lwg jnhwn nay apny zbanwn say aslam qbwl kya jbkh ayman abhy tmharay dlwn myn dakhl nhyn hwa، mslmanwn kw nqsan nh phnchao، nh an kw rswa krw، awr nh an ky ayb tlash krw۔ (mslm) bhayy، allh as kay aybwn ka pychha kray ga، awr js kay aybwn ka allh taaqb kray ga، allh asay rswa kray ga، khwah wh apnay ghr myn hy kywn nh hw۔\ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5045","sayd bn zyd rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”swd ky sb say bry swrt yh hay kh mslman ky azt kay baray myn gstakhy ky jayay۔ as ka slslh shyh hay jsay abwdaod awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5046","ans rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb myra rb mjhay rat kay sfr pr lay gya tw myn aysay lwgwn kay pas say gzra jn kay pas tanbay kay nakhn thay jn say wh apnay chhrwn awr synwn kw nwch rhay thay، myn nay kha: aay jbryl yh kwn lwg hyn؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: yh wh lwg hyn jw lwgwn ka gwsht khatay thay (yany an ky ghybt krtay thay) awr an ky azt pr hmlh krtay thay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5047","mstwrd rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ksy mslman ky ghybt ky wjh say ayk lqmh khayay ga، allh taalyٰ asay jhnm say as kay brabr khana khlayay ga، awr js nay ksy mslman ky ghybt ky wjh say kwyy lbas phna، allh taalyٰ asay as jgh ky trh phnayay ga، jw as ky ghybt ky wjh say asay phnayay ga۔ dkhaway kay lyay، allh taalyٰ asay qyamt kay dn shhrt awr dkhaway kay mqam pr khra kray ga۔\ as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5048","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”achhy amyd (allh say) achhy abadt ka hsh hay۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay ahmd awr abw daod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5049","Narrated by Abu Dawood from Aisha (may Allah be pleased with her): Safiyyah’s (may Allah be pleased with her) camel became ill while Zainab (may Allah be pleased with her) had an extra mount. The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said to Zainab (may Allah be pleased with her): \Give her (Safiyyah) a camel.\"" She said: \""Should I give it to this Jewess!\"" The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) became upset and he refrained from her company for several days during Dhu al-Hijjah"","" Muharram"","" and a few days of Safar. The chain is authentic. And the hadith narrated from Mu’adh bin Anas (may Allah be pleased with him): \""Whoever protects the honor of a believer...\"" has already passed in the chapter of Compassion and Mercy."""""
"5050","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aysyٰ bn mrym rzy allh anh nay ayk aadmy kw chwry krtay hwyay dykha، tw aysyٰ alyh alslam nay as say kha: tm nay chwry ky hay“۔ as nay jwab dya as ky qsm js kay swa kwyy hqyqy mabwd nhyn! myray pas nhyn hay۔' (as pr) aysyٰ alyh alslam nay frmaya: myn allh pr ayman rkhta hwn awr apnay nfs ka ankar krta hwn۔"
"5051","Narrated by Al-Bayhaqi in Shu'ab al-Iman from Anas (may Allah be pleased with him): The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \Poverty is close to becoming disbelief (due to objecting to Allah)"","" and envy is close to overpowering destiny.\"" The chain is weak."""""
"5052","jabr rzy allh anh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay apnay (mslm) bhayy kay samnay azr pysh kya awr wh asay azr nh smjhay ya as ka azr qbwl nh kray tw as pr mhswl lynay walay kay brabr gnah hay۔ zayf، jsay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔ an dwnwn rwaytwn kw amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn nql kya hay awr frmaya: ((almkas)) say ashr (ayk qsm ka tyks) lynay wala mrad hay۔"
"5053","Narrated by Muslim from Abu Huraira (may Allah be pleased with him): The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \A believer is not bitten from the same hole twice.\"" This is agreed upon."""""
"5054","sydna abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay abdalqys kay srdar ashj say frmaya: tm myn dw khsltyn hyn jw allh kw psnd hyn: brdbary awr wqar۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5055","shl bn sad saady rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”brdasht allh ky trf say hay awr jld bazy shytan ky trf say hay۔ amam trmzy nay as hdys kw rwayt kya hay awr asay ’’ghryb‘‘ kha hay awr baz mhdsyn nay as hdys kay rawy abd almhymn bn abas ky yad pr bhs ky hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5056","abwsayd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”srf phslnay wala hy brdbar hay، awr tjrbh rkhnay wala hy aqlmnd hay۔ ahmd، trmzy awr amam trmzy nay kha: yh hdys hsn ghryb hay۔ hsn، asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5057","hzrt ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh ayk aadmy nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say drkhwast ky kh mjhay nsyht frmayyay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as maamlay myn ghwr krw، agr tm as kay ntyjay myn bhlayy awr faydh dykhw tw as pr aml krw، awr agr tmhyn gmrahy ka andyshh hw tw aysa nh krw۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay، awr wh rd hay۔ shrh alsn myn mrwy hay۔"
"5058","msab bn sad apnay wald say rwayt krtay hyn، jbkh aamsh rzy allh anh khtay hyn: myn yh (hdys) srf rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say janta hwn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” aakhrt kay kamwn kay alawh ksy kam myn jldy nh krna bhtr hay“۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5059","Narrated by Tirmidhi from Abdullah bin Sarjis (may Allah be pleased with him): The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \Good character"","" forbearance and dignity"","" and moderation are one twenty-fourth part of Prophethood.\"" The chain is Hasan."""""
"5060","Narrated by Abu Dawood from Ibn Abbas, may Allah be pleased with him: The Prophet, peace and blessings be upon him, said: \A good way and good character are one twenty-fifth part of Prophethood.\"" The chain is Hasan."""""
"5061","jabr bn abdallh rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb aadmy bwlay awr bat krtay hwyay adhr adhr dykhay (dykhay kh kwyy awr sn rha hay) tw yh amant hay۔ as ka slslh achha hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5062","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay abw alhyshm bn althan say frmaya: kya tmhara kwyy khadm hay؟ as nay jwab dya: nhyn، rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: jb qydy hmaray pas aayyn tw hmaray pas aao۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas dw ghlam layay gyay tw abw alhyshm bhy aap sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: an myn say ksy ayk kw chn lw۔ as nay kha: ya rswl allh! aap myray lyay antkhab kryn۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: js say mshwrh lya jayay wh sqh hay، asay lay lw، kywnkh myn nay asay nmaz prhtay hwyay dykha hay، myn tmhyn as kay sath hsn slwk ky wsyt krta hwn۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5063","jabr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tyn mjlsyn، swayay an kay jn myn qtl w ghart، zna، ya najayz twr pr mal hasl krnay ky bat hw، wh khfyh hyn (awr an myn jw kha jata hay wh amant hay)۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay abw daod nay rwayt kya hay۔ awr abwsayd rzy allh anh say rwayt ky gyy hdys kh: ’’bay shk yh bht bry amant hay‘‘ mbashrt kay bab kay phlay hsay myn zkr hw chka hay۔"
"5064","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb allh taalyٰ nay aql kw pyda kya tw as say kha: khra hw، tw wh khra hw gya، phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay frmaya: pychhay htw، tw wh pychhay hw gya، phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: aagay ky trf twjh krw، tw wh as kay samnay aagyy، phr myn nay kha: ”as nay nychay kr dya، phr myn nay kha: nychay kr dya“۔ tw myry tmam mkhlwqat myn sb say afzl awr bhtryn hay، tyry wjh say myn hsab krwn ga، tyry wjh say myn sza dwn ga، awr jza awr jza bhy tjh pr mnhsr hay۔ baz almaa nay as baray myn rayay dy hay۔ as ka slslh mn ghrt hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5065","abn amr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk aadmy nmaz prhnay، rwzay rkhnay، zkw dynay awr hj awr amrh krnay walwn myn say hw skta hay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay tmam nykywn ka zkr as trh frmaya hay۔ \lykn as shkhs kw as ky aql kay mtabq ajr dya jayay ga۔\"" as ka slslh rwayt zayf hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5066","abwzr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjh say frmaya: ”abw zr! tdbyr jysy kwyy aql nhyn، mshtbh amwr say prhyz jysa tqwyٰ nhyn awr achhay akhlaq jysy kwyy shraft nhyn۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5067","sydna abn amr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”khrch myn aatdal nsf rwzy hay، nyk lwgwn say dwsty awr mhbt aadhy hkmt hay، awr achhay swal krna aadha alm hay۔ amam byhqy nay an charwn ahadys kw shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔ as ky snd zayf awr mrdwd hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5068","am almomnyn aayshh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk allh nrm hay، nrmy kw psnd krta hay، awr wh nrmy pr wh dyta hay jw nh skhty kay bdlay dyta hay awr nh ksy awr chyz pr“۔ awr mslm ky ayk awr rwayt myn hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay aayshh rzy allh anha say frmaya: nrmy akhtyar krw، skhty awr bd zbany say prhyz krw، bay shk jb bhy ksy chyz myn nrmy payy jaty hay tw wh asay snwar dyty hay awr jb ksy chyz say ht jaty hay tw asay ayb dar bna dyty hay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5069","Narrated by Muslim from Jarir (may Allah be pleased with him): The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \Whoever is deprived of gentleness is deprived of all good.\"""""""
"5070","sydna abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk ansary aadmy kay pas say gzray jw apnay bhayy kw hya ky nsyht kr rha tha (khh rha tha kh atna shrm nh krw)۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: asay chhwr dw، kywnkh hya ayman ka hsh hay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5071","amran bn hsyn rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hyaa khyr kay swa kchh nhyn laty“۔ ayk awr rwayt myn hay: \hyaa apny pwry trh nyky kay swa kchh nhyn hay۔\"" pr atfaq hwa۔"""""
"5072","abn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”pchhlay anbyaa say jw aqwal lwgwn nay hasl kyay hyn، an myn say yh hay: agr tm myn hya nh hw tw jw chahw krw۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5073","nwas bn smaan rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say nyky awr gnah kay baray myn pwchha۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: nyky hsn akhlaq hay، jb kh gnah wh hay jw tmharay dl kw pryshan kray awr tm as bat kw napsnd krw kh lwgwn kw as ka alm hw۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5074","abdallh bn amrw rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mjhay tm myn sb say zyadh mhbwb wh hay js ka akhlaq tm myn sb say achha hw۔ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5075","Narrated by Abdullah bin Amr (may Allah be pleased with him) from the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him): \The best among you is the one who has the best character among you.\"" This is agreed upon."""""
"5076","am almomnyn aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js kw as ka hsh nrmy kay sath dya gya، asay dnya awr aakhrt ky bhlayywn myn say as ka hsh dya gya، awr jw shkhs nrmy kay as hsay say mhrwm rha، wh dnya awr aakhrt ky bhlayy say mhrwm rha۔ hsn، shrh alsnn myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5077","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hyaa ayman ka hsh hay awr mwmn jnt myn hwn gay، jb kh bay hyayy brayy hay awr bray lwg jhnm myn hwn gay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5078","qbylh mzynh kay ayk shkhs say rwayt hay، anhwn nay kha: shabh kram rzy allh anhm nay pwchha: ya rswl allh! sb say achhy chyz kya hay jw ksy shkhs kw dy gyy hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”achha akhlaq“۔ shyh، jsay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5079","Aur Sharh al-Sunnah mein Usamah bin Sharik se riwayat hai. Sahih hai, Sharh al-Sunnah mein riwayat hai."
"5080","harsh bn whb rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bd akhlaq awr skht dl aadmy jnt myn nhyn jayay ga۔ (abw daod، byhqy an shab alayman)۔ awr jama alslw kay msnf nay bhy asay rwayt kya hay awr as myn harsh say rwayt hay awr asy trh shrh alsn myn bhy an say rwayt hay awr as ka qwl yh hay kh aap ﷺ nay frmaya: ” mtkbr awr skht gyr jnt myn dakhl nhyn hw ga۔ \jzry\"" kay many hyn: \""skht tbyat awr skht zban\""۔ awr msbah kay nskhwn myn akrmh bn whb say mrwy hay awr as kay alfaz yh hyn: \""jwaz\"" ka many hay: mal jma krnay wala bkhyl، awr \""jzry\"" ka many hay: \""skht mzaj awr skht zban wala\""۔ shyh، jsay abw daod awr byhqy nay shab alayman awr shrh alsn myn rwayt kya hay awr msbah alsn myn zkr kya hay۔"""""
"5081","abw drdaa rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt kay dn mwmn kay myzan myn hsn akhlaq say zyadh kwyy chyz bhary nhyn hw gy، awr allh taalyٰ as shkhs kw psnd nhyn krta jw bdzbany krnay wala awr fhsh batyn krnay wala hw۔ (trmzy) awr frmaya: yh hdys hsn shyh hay، awr abwdaod nay phla hsh rwayt kya hay۔ as ka slslh shyh hay jsay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5082","am almomnyn aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”bay shk mwmn apnay achhay akhlaq ky wjh say rwzay dar awr rat kw qyam krnay walay kay drjh kw phnch jata hay۔ hsn، abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5083","abwzr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjh say frmaya: tm jhan khyn bhy hw allh say drw، awr brayy kay bad nyky krw، wh asay mta day ga، awr lwgwn kay sath achhay akhlaq say pysh aao۔ hsn، asay ahmd، trmzy awr aldarmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5084","abdallh bn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kya myn tmhyn an lwgwn kay baray myn nh btaon jn pr jhnm ky aag hram hay ya jn pr jhnm ky aag hram hay، yh wh lwg hyn jw nrm mzaj، mlnsar awr mlaymt walay hyn۔ ahmd، trmzy، awr anhwn nay kha: yh hdys hsn ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay jsay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5085","Narrated by Ahmad, al-Tirmidhi, and Abu Dawood from Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with him): The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \A believer is simple-hearted and generous"","" while a wicked person is deceitful and miserly.\"" The chain is weak."""""
"5086","mkwl rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mwmn nrm mzaj awr bawqar hwta hay، jysay nak myn awnt، jb as ky rhnmayy ky jaty hay tw wh pychhay chlta hay، awr jb asay pthr pr bthaya jata hay tw wh byth jata hay۔ amam trmzy nay asay mrsl rwayt kya hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5087","abn amr rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”lwgwn kay sath myl jwl rkhnay wala awr an ky tklyf pr sbr krnay wala mslman as say bhtr hay jw lwgwn say myl jwl nhyn rkhta awr an ky tklyf pr sbr nhyn krta“۔ shyh، trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5088","shl bn maaz rzy allh anh apnay wald say rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay apnay ghsay kw qabw myn rkha awr as pr aml krnay pr qadr hw، allh taalyٰ asay qyamt kay dn tmam mkhlwqat kay samnay blayay ga awr asay akhtyar day ga kh wh jsay chahay chn lay“۔ trmzy، abwdaod۔ awr amam trmzy nay kha: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5089","awr abw daod ky rwayt myn swyd bn whb nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay ashab ky awlad myn say ayk shkhs say rwayt ky hay، js nay apnay wald say rwayt ky hay، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ” allh taalyٰ as kay dl kw atmynan awr ayman say bhr day ga۔ awr swyd say rwayt ky gyy hdys: \js nay khwbswrt lbas phnna chhwr dya\"" lbas ky ktab myn mzkwr hay۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5090","Narrated by Imam Malik from Zaid bin Talha (may Allah be pleased with him): The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \Indeed"","" every religion has some distinguishing characteristics"","" and the distinguishing characteristic of Islam is modesty.\"" This is a mursal narration. The chain is weak."""""
"5091","abn majh awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn ans awr abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt ky hay۔ zayf jsay abn majh awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5092","abn majh nay awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn ans awr abn abas ؓ say rwayt kya hay ۔ zayf ، rwah abn majh w albyhqy fy shab alayman ۔"
"5093","sydna abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk hya awr ayman ayk sath chltay hyn، jb an myn say ayk chhyn lya jata hay tw dwsra bhy chhn jata hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5094","awr abn abas rzy allh anhma ky rwayt myn hay: \jb an myn say ayk mhrwm hw jata hay tw dwsra bhy as kay pychhay aata hay۔\"" as ka slslh rwayt zayf hay htyٰ kh mn ghrt hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5095","maaz rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh jb myn nay apna paon rkab myn rkha tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mjhay apny aakhry nsyht frmayy awr frmaya: maaz! lwgwn kay sath hsn slwk krw۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ malk nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"5096","amam malk rhm allh alyh frmatay hyn: mjhay yh bat phnchy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: mjhay achhay akhlaq ky tkmyl kay lyay bhyja gya hay۔ slslh zayf hay jsay malk nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5097","amam ahmd nay abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt ky hay۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5098","Narrated by al-Bayhaqi in Shu'ab al-Iman from Ja'far bin Muhammad: He narrates from his father that when the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him, looked into the mirror, he would recite this supplication: \All praise is due to Allah who has made my appearance and character good"","" and who has adorned me by protecting me from the faults that were in others.\"" It is a mursal narration. The chain is weak."""""
"5099","am almomnyn aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm yh daa kya krtay thay: \aay allh! tw nay mjhay achha pyda kya hay، lhza myray akhlaq kw bhy snwar day\""۔ as ka slslh shyh hay jsay ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5100","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kya myn tmhyn tm myn say bhtryn shkhs kay baray myn nh btaon؟ anhwn nay kha، brah krm hmyn btayyn۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tm myn say bhtryn wh hay js ky amr tm myn sb say zyadh hw awr js ka akhlaq tm myn sb say achha hw۔ hsn، ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5101","Narrated by Abu Dawood and Al-Darimi from Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with him): The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \A believer is simple-hearted and generous"","" while a wicked person is deceitful and miserly.\"" The chain is Hasan."""""
"5102","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh ayk shkhs nay hzrt abwbkr rzy allh anh kw galy dy jb kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm whan bythay hwyay thay۔ wh hyran hwa awr mskra dya۔ jb wh shkhs zyadh gstakh hw gya tw hzrt abwbkr rzy allh anh nay as ky ayk bat ka jwab dya js pr nby krym sly allh alyh wslm naraz hw gyay awr khray hw gyay۔ abwbkr rzy allh anh aap kay pas gyay awr kha: ya rswl allh! jb aap whan bythay thay tw wh mjhay galyan dyta rha lykn jb myn nay as kay ayk rymarks ka jwab dya tw aap naraz hw gyay awr khray hw gyay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: tmharay sath ayk frshth tha jw asay jwab day rha tha، lykn jb tm nay jwab dya tw shytan zahr hw gya۔ phr frmaya: aay abwbkr! tyn batyn balkl schy hyn: js pr zlm kya jayay awr allh kay lyay as say drgzr kya jayay، allh taalyٰ as kay bdlay myn asay taqt awr fth ata frmata hay، jw shkhs rshth dary qaym rkhnay kay lyay dyta hay، allh asay as kay bdlay myn awr zyadh dyta hay، awr jw shkhs apnay mal myn azafay kay lyay (bhyk) mangta hay، allh taalyٰ as ky fqr myn azafh krta hay۔ as ka slslh achha hay۔ ahmd nay rwayt ky hay۔"
"5103","am almomnyn aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb allh taalyٰ ksy ghr walwn kay sath bhlayy ka aradh frmata hay tw anhyn nrmy ata frmata hay awr jb ksy ghr kw as say mhrwm kr dyta hay tw as ky wjh say anhyn nqsan phnchata hay۔ shyh، jsay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5104","Narrated by al-Bukhari from Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with him): A man requested the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), \Advise me.\"" The Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \""Do not get angry.\"" He requested this several times"","" and the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) (each time) said: \""Do not get angry.\"""""""
"5105","Narrated by Muslim from Abu Huraira (may Allah be pleased with him): The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \A strong person is not the one who overpowers others in wrestling; rather"","" a strong person is the one who controls himself at the time of anger.\"" This is agreed upon."""""
"5106","harsh bn whb rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kya myn tmhyn ahl jnt kay baray myn nh btaon؟ hr wh kmzwr aadmy jsay lwg kmzwr awr bay akhtyar smjhtay hyn، lykn agr wh allh ky qsm khayay tw allh as ky qsm pwry kr dyta hay، kya myn tmhyn jhnmywn kay baray myn nh btaon؟ awr mslm ky rwayt myn hay: \hr knjws، bkhyl awr tkbr krnay wala۔\"" pr atfaq hwa۔"""""
"5107","abn msawd rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: js kay dl myn rayy kay danay kay brabr bhy ayman hw wh jhnm myn nhyn jayay ga awr js kay dl myn rayy kay danh kay brabr tkbr hw wh jnt myn dakhl nhyn hw ga۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5108","abn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: js kay dl myn rayy kay danh kay brabr bhy tkbr hw ga wh jnt myn nhyn jayay ga۔ ayk aadmy nay pwchha kh ayk shkhs yh psnd krta hay kh as kay kpray awr jwtay achhay hwn (kya yh bhy tkbr hay؟) aap sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya: \bay shk allh khwbswrt hay awr khwbswrty kw psnd krta hay، tkbr ka mtlb hq kw jhtlana awr lwgwn kw hqyr dykhna hay۔\"" asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5109","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tyn qsm kay lwg aysay hyn jn say allh taalyٰ qyamt kay dn bat nhyn kray ga awr nh anhyn pak kray ga۔ ayk awr rwayt myn hay: \awr nh hy wh an ky trf rhm ky ngah say dykhay ga، awr an kay lyay drdnak azab hay: bwrha zany، jhwta badshah awr mtkbr ghryb۔\"" asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5110","abwhryrh rzy allh anh rwayt krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ frmata hay: azmt myry chadr hay awr azmt myry chadr hay، jw an dwnwn myn say ksy ayk kay baray myn mjh say mqablh kray ga، myn asay jhnm myn dakhl krwn ga۔ ayk awr rwayt myn hay: \myn asay aag myn dalwn ga۔\"" asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5111","slmh bn akwa rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aadmy apnay aap kw as wqt tk bra smjhta rhta hay jb tk kh asay mtkbrwn awr zalmwn myn nh lkha jayay، awr as trh asay why (azab) dya jayay ga jw asay phnchaya gya tha۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5112","Narrated by al-Tirmidhi from Amr bin Shu’aib, from his father, and he from his grandfather: They narrated from the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him, who said: “The arrogant will be gathered on the Day of Resurrection in the form of tiny ants in the shape of men. Humiliation will cover them from every place. They will be driven to a prison in Hell called ‘Boulas’. The hottest fire will envelop them, and they will be given to drink the pus of the inhabitants of Hell, called ‘Teenat al-Khabal’.” The chain is Hasan."
"5113","atyh bn arwh sady rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ghsh shytan ky trf say hay، awr shytan aag say pyda kya gya hay، awr aag srf pany say bjhty hay، lhza jb tm myn say ksy kw ghsh aayay tw wh wzw kray۔ as ka slslh achha hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5114","abwzr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say ksy kw khray hwnay pr ghsh aayay tw asay chahyay kh byth jayay، agr ghsh as say nkl jayay tw achhy bat hay، wrnh lyt jayay۔ shyh، asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5115","asmaa bnt amys rzy allh anha khty hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”bdbkht wh bndh hay jw tkbr krta hay awr allh taalyٰ kw bhwl jata hay، bd bkht wh bndh hay jw zlm awr zyadty krta hay awr ghalb awr aalyٰ kw bhwl jata hay، wh bndh jw khyl myn mshghwl rhta hay tfryh، awr qbrwn kw awr apnay zwal kw bhwl jata hay، bd bkht wh bndh hay jw tkbr awr srkshy krta hay awr apnay aaghaz w anjam kw bhwl jata hay، bdbkht wh bndh hay jw dyn kay bdlay dnya tlash krta hay، bd bkht wh bndh hay jw shk kay zryaay dyn kw bgarta hay، bdtryn wh bndh hay js kw hrs w lalch awr lalch myn mbtla kr kay bnday kw bhtka dya jata hay۔ bdbkht hay wh bndh jsay dnya ky khwahsh zlyl kray۔ trmzy، byhqy nay shab alayman myn، dwnwn nay kha: as ka slslh mzbwt nhyn hay، awr amam trmzy nay bhy kha: yh hdys ghryb hay۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay trmzy awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5116","sydna abn amr rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw bndh allh taalyٰ ky rza kay lyay ghsay ka ayk ghwnt ngl lay tw wh ghwnt allh taalyٰ kay nzdyk sb say afzl hay“۔ as ka slslh zayf hay jsay ahmd nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5117","abn abas rzy allh anh nay allh taalyٰ kay as frman (brayy kw bhtr say dwr krnay) ky wzaht as trh ky hay: ghsh kay wqt sbr krna، ghlty hwnay pr maaf krna؛ jb wh aysa kryn gay tw allh an ky hfazt kray ga awr an kay dshmn as trh aajz hwn gay jysay wh ayk qryby awr qryby dwst hw۔ amam bkhary nay asay malq swrt myn rwayt kya hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay bkhary nay tfsyr myn rwayt kya hay (bab 4 phlay hdys 4816، bghyr slslh kay matl)۔"
"5118","bhz bn hkym apnay wald say awr wh apnay dada say rwayt krtay hyn، anhwn nay kha: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ghsh ayman kw as trh khrab kr dyta hay jysay aylw shhd kw khrab kr dyta hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5119","sydna amr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay، aap nay mnbr pr frmaya: lwgw! twaza akhtyar krw kywnkh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: jw allh kay lyay twaza akhtyar krta hay، allh asay blndy ata krta hay، wh apny nzr myn apnay aap kw chhwta smjhta hay lykn lwgwn ky nzrwn myn wh bra hwta hay، awr jw tkbr krta hay، allh asay pst kr dyta hay، wh lwgwn ky nzrwn myn chhwta hwta hay، yhan tk kh wh apnay aap kw bra awr hqyr smjhnay lgta hay۔ ktay ya swr say zyadh۔\ as ka slslh mn ghrt hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5120","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: mwsyٰ bn amran rzy allh anh nay pwchha: aay rb، tyray bndwn myn say tyry bargah myn sb say zyadh azt wala kwn hay؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: wh jw (bdlh lynay ky) taqt rkhnay kay bawjwd maaf kr day، as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5121","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw apny zban ky hfazt kray ga، allh taalyٰ as kay aybwn ky prdh pwshy kray ga، jw apnay ghsay kw rwkay ga، allh taalyٰ qyamt kay dn as say apnay azab kw rwkay ga، awr jw allh taalyٰ kay hzwr maafy mangay ga، allh taalyٰ as ky aybwn pr prdh dalay ga۔ as ka slslh rwayt zayf hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5122","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tyn chyzyn njat ka sbb hyn awr tyn chyzyn hlakt ka baas hyn، njat ka baas bnnay waly chyzyn yh hyn: zahry awr batny twr pr allh ka khwf akhtyar krna، lzt myn sch bwlna awr mal ky narazgy kw khtm krna، awr mal kw nagwar bnana۔ yh hyn: aysy khwahshat ky pyrwy jn ky ataat ky jaty hay، aysy knjwsy js ky pyrwy ky jaty hay، awr ansan ky khwd psndy، awr yh sb say zyadh tbah kn hay۔\ amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn panchwn hdysyn nql ky hyn۔ as ky snd zayf hay jsay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5123","Narrated by Muslim from Ibn Umar, may Allah be pleased with him: The Prophet, peace and blessings be upon him, said: \Oppression will be the cause of many darknesses on the Day of Resurrection.\"" This is agreed upon."""""
"5124","sydna abw mwsyٰ rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk allh taalyٰ zalm kw mhlt dyta hay، lykn jb pkrta hay tw asay janay nhyn dyta۔ phr rswl allh (sly allh alyh waalh wslm) nay yh aayt tlawt frmayy: ’’tmharay rb ky pkr aysy hwty hay jb wh bstywn kw as hal myn pkrta hay kh wh zlm krrhay hwn‘‘۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5125","sydna abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm jb hjr kay mqam say gzray tw aap nay frmaya: ”apnay awpr zlm krnay walwn kay ghrwn myn rwtay hwyay dakhl hw jao، aysa nh hw kh tmhyn bhy why azab phnchay jw an pr phncha tha۔ phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay apna sr dhanp lya awr apny rftar tyz kr dy yhan tk kh aap wady say gzr gyay۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5126","abwhryrh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay apnay (mslman) bhayy pr as ky azt ya ksy awr chyz pr zlm kya hay، tw asay chahyay kh as say (dnya myn) maafy mangay as say phlay kh wh dn aayay js myn nh dynar hw ga awr nh drhm، agr as kay pas nykyan hwn gy، tw as kay gnahwn ka bdlh lya jayay ga۔ zlm krnay walay kay gnah as pr dalay jayyn gay۔\ asay bkhary nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5127","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: kya tm jantay hw kh dywalyh kwn hay؟ anhwn nay jwab dya kh js kay pas nh drhm hwn nh mal w mtaa۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: myry amt ka mfls wh hay jw qyamt kay dn nmaz، rwzh awr zkw lay kr aayay ga، lykn wh bhy aayay ga kh ksy kw galy day ga، ksy ky ghybt kray ga، ksy ka mal nahq khaya hw ga، ksy ka khwn bhaya hw ga، ksy kw mara hw ga، tw as ky nykyan as kay hq ada krnay say phlay ada kr dy jayyn gy۔ pwra hw gya tw an kay gnah as pr dal dyay jayyn gay awr asay jhnm ky aag myn dal dya jayay ga۔ asay mslm nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5128","Narrated by Muslim from Abu Hurairah (may Allah be pleased with him): The Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: \On the Day of Resurrection"","" you will certainly pay the rights to those entitled to them"","" until even the horned goat will be recompensed for the hornless goat.\"" And the hadith narrated from Jabir (may Allah be pleased with him): \""Beware of oppression.\"" is mentioned in the chapter of spending."""""
"5129","hzyfh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tqlyd nh krw، tm yh khw kh agr lwg achha kryn gay tw hm bhy nyky kryn gay awr agr wh brayy kryn gay tw hm bhy zlm kryn gay، blkh apnay dl myn yh azm rkhw kh agr lwg nyky kryn gay tw tm bhy nyky krw gay، awr agr ansaf nh kryn gay tw tm bhy brayy kryn gay۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5130","maawyh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh anhwn nay aayshh rzy allh anha kw ayk kht lkha js myn an say kha kh wh anhyn ayk mkhtsr nsyht lkhyn۔ tw as nay lkha: alslam alykm! aagay brhnay kay lyay! myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: jw shkhs lwgwn ky narazgy kay bdlay allh ky khwshnwdy hasl kray ga، allh taalyٰ asay lwgwn ky brayywn kay lyay kafy hw jayay ga، awr jw allh ky narazgy pr lwgwn ky khwshnwdy hasl kray ga، allh taalyٰ asay lwgwn pr chhwr day ga۔ walykm alslam! as ky snd zayf hay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5131","abn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh jb yh aayt nazl hwyy: \wh lwg jw ayman layay awr apnay ayman kw zlm kay sath nhyn mlaya\"" tw yh bat rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay shabh rzy allh anhm pr skht hwyy awr anhwn nay arz kya: ya rswl allh! hm myn say ks nay apnay awpr zlm nhyn kya؟ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \""as ka mtlb yh nhyn hay، blkh as say mrad shrk hay، kya tm nay lqman ka apnay bytay kw yh khtay hwyay nhyn sna kh aay myray bytay! allh kay sath ksy chyz kw shryk nh krw، kywnkh shrk bht bra zlm hay۔\"" dwsry rwayt myn hay: \""lqman nay apnay bytay kw aysa nhyn kha jysa kh tm nay kha۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"""""
"5132","Abu Umamah (Razi Allah Anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alayhi wa Sallam) ne farmaya: \Qayamat ke din sab se zyada bure darje ka woh shakhs hoga jisne kisi aur ki duniya ki khatir apni aakhirat tabah kar di.\"" Is ki sanad zaeef hai"","" Ibn Majah ne riwayat kiya."""""
"5133","aayshh rzy allh anha byan krty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aamal ky tyn qsmyn hyn، ayk aysay aamal ka namh aamal jn kw allh maaf nhyn kray ga، awr wh hay allh kay sath ksy kw shryk thhrana، allh taalyٰ ka frman hay: ”bay shk allh taalyٰ as kay sath shryk hwnay walay kw maaf nhyn krta“۔ dwsra aamal ka namh hay jsay allh taalyٰ akyla nhyn chhwray ga، awr wh hay wh ghltyan jw lwgwn nay ayk dwsray pr kyn، yhan tk kh wh aaps myn maamlh tay kr lyn۔ awr tysra aamal ka namh aamal hay jn ky allh kw kwyy prwah nhyn hay، awr wh hay wh ghltyan jw lwgwn nay apnay awr allh kay drmyan ky hyn۔ yh allh pr mnhsr hay agr wh chahay ga tw sza day ga awr agr chahay ga tw maaf kr day ga۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5134","aly rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mzlwm ky daa say bchw، kywnkh wh allh say apna hq mangta hay، awr allh taalyٰ as kay malk say hq nhyn chhynta“۔ as ka slslh rwayt zayf hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5135","aws bn shrbyl rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna: ”jw shkhs ksy zalm ka sath day takh asay tqwyt phnchayay، halankh wh janta hay kh wh zalm hay، aysa shkhs aslam say nkl jata hay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5136","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh anhwn nay ayk aadmy kw yh khtay hwyay sna kh zalm srf apna hy nqsan krta hay۔ abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay kha: han، allh ky qsm! hwpw prndh bhy zalm kay zlm say kmzwr hw kr apnay ghwnslay myn mr jata hay۔ amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn charwn hdysyn nql ky hyn۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5137","Abu Sa'id al-Khudri, may Allah be pleased with him, narrates from the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings be upon him, that he said: \Whoever among you sees an evil"","" let him change it with his hand; if he is not able to do so"","" then with his tongue; and if he is not able to do that"","" then with his heart (by planning to change it and by hating it)"","" and that is the weakest level of faith.\"" Narrated by Muslim."""""
"5138","Nu’man bin Bashir (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \The example of the one who is lax in enforcing the limits set by Allah and the one who falls into them is like a people who drew lots for places in a boat. Some of them were in its lower deck and some in its upper deck. Those who were in the lower deck"","" when they needed water"","" would have to pass by those above them"","" which caused discomfort to the upper deck people. So the people in the lower deck took an axe and began to make a hole in the bottom of the boat. The people above came to them and asked: ‘What are you doing?’ They replied: ‘You are troubled when we pass above you"","" and we need water as well.’ If the people above stop their hands"","" they will save both themselves and the others; but if they leave them to what they want"","" they will destroy both themselves and the others.\"" Narrated by al-Bukhari."""""
"5139","asamh bn zyd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt kay dn ayk aadmy kw la kr jhnm myn dala jayay ga، as ky aantyn aag myn nklyn gy، awr wh an kay grd as trh chkr lgayay ga jysay gdha chky kay grd chkr lgata hay، jhnm walay pwchhyn gay kh as kay grd kya hwa awr tm say kya hwa؟ kya tw nay hmyn nyky ka hkm nhyn dya awr brayy say mna kya wh khay ga: myn tmhyn nyky ka hkm dyta tha lykn khwd nhyn krta tha awr myn tmhyn brayy say rwkta tha lykn khwd as ka artkab krta tha۔ pr atfaq hwa۔"
"5140","hzyfh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”as zat ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay، tm zrwr nyky ka hkm dw awr brayy say rwkw، wrnh qryb hay kh allh tm pr apna azab nazl kr day، phr tm as say daa krw gay lykn wh tmhary daa qbwl nhyn kray ga۔ hsn، trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5141","ars bn amyrh rzy allh anh nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt krtay hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb zmyn pr kwyy gnah srzd hwta hay awr whan mwjwd shkhs asay napsnd krta hay tw wh as shkhs ky trh hay jw whan mwjwd nhyn hwta، awr jw whan mwjwd nhyn hwta lykn as pr razy hwta hay tw wh as shkhs ky trh hwta hay jw whan mwjwd nhyn hwta“۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5142","sydna abwbkr sdyq rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh aap nay frmaya: \aay lwgw! tm yh aayt prhw: 'aay ayman walw! apny janwn ka khyal rkhw، agr tm hdayt yafth hw tw kwyy gmrah tmhyn nqsan nhyn phncha skta۔' myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: \""bay shk jb lwg ksy brayy kw dykhtay hyn awr as say baz nhyn aatay tw qryb hay kh allh taalyٰ an sb kw apnay azab myn ghyr lay۔\"" (abn majh، trmzy awr amam trmzy nay asay shyh qrar dya hay۔) awr abw daod ky rwayt myn hay: \""jb wh apnay hathwn kw dbatay ya dbatay hwyay nh dykhyn tw wh apnay hath kw dbatay hyn۔ phr qryb hay kh allh an sb kw azab myn ghyr lay۔\"" awr abw daod ky ayk awr rwayt myn hay: \""js qwm say gnah srzd hwn awr wh as pr qdrt rkhnay kay bawjwd an say baz nh aayyn tw qryb hay kh allh taalyٰ an sb kw azab myn ghyr lay\""۔ ayk awr rwayt myn hay: \""agr ksy qwm ky aqlyt gnah myn mbtla hw jayay awr aksryt agrchh khwd gnah nh kr rhy hw، tw an kw nh rwkay، (tw wh bhy azab myn mbtla hwn gay)\""۔ as ka slslh mstnd hay۔ asay abn majh، trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5143","jryr bn abdallh rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”jw shkhs ksy qwm myn gnah kray awr wh as ky taqt rkhnay kay bawjwd asay nh rwkay، tw as kay mrnay say phlay allh taalyٰ an sb kw apnay azab myn mbtla kr dyta hay۔ znjyr kmzwr hay۔ asay abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5144","allh taalyٰ kay as frman kay baray myn kh: ’’apnay nfs kw mzbwty say thamay rhw، jb tm rah rast pr hw tw gmrah lwg tmhara kchh nhyn bgar sktay،‘‘ abw salbh rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn: aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: snw! khda ky qsm myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say as baray myn dryaft kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”blkh tm nyky ka hkm dytay rhw awr brayy say rwktay rhw، yhan tk kh tm yh dykhw kh bkhl ky ataat ky gyy hay، khwahshat ky pyrwy ky gyy hay، dnya kw trjyh dy gyy hay، awr hr shkhs apny rayay awr aql pr razy hay، awr phr as say bchna mshkl hw jayay ga، phr asay chhwrna mshkl hw jayay ga۔ aam lwg apnay kamwn myn lg jayyn، kywnkh aagay sbr kay dn aanay walay hyn، jw an dnwn myn sbr kray ga، wh as shkhs ky trh hwga jw an dnwn myn kam kray ga، awr jw an dnwn myn aml kray ga، asay pchas aadmywn kay brabr ajr mlay ga۔\ shabh kram rzy allh anhm nay arz kya ya rswl allh!an myn say pchas aadmywn ka ajr؟ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya tm myn say pchas aadmywn ka ajr۔ as ka slslh hsn hay۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5145","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nmaz asr kay bad hmyn khtbh dynay kay lyay khray hwyay awr qyamt tk kay tmam waqaat ka zkr frmaya۔ kchh lwgwn nay asay yad kya، awr kchh asay bhwl gyay۔ anhwn nay apnay khtab myn jw kchh kha an myn say yh bhy tha: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \dnya pyary awr srsbz hay، bay shk allh tmhyn as myn janshyn bnayay ga، tw wh dykhay ga kh tm kysay aml krtay hw، khbrdar! dnya say hwshyar rhw، awr awrtwn kay ftnay say hwshyar rhw۔\"" awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \""qyamt kay dn hr khyant krnay walay kay lyay dnya myn as ky khyant ky hd kay mtabq ayk jhnda hw ga، awr aam rhnma (srbrah mmlkt) ky khyant say brh kr kwyy khyant nhyn، as ka jhnda as kay kwlhwn pr lga hwa hw ga، awr tm lwgwn kw yh khwf kh jb wh sch bwlnay say nh rwkay\""۔ ayk awr rwayt myn hay: \""agr wh brayy dykhay tw asay rwkay، awr lwgwn ka khwf asay as say baz nh rkhay۔\"" as trh (yh byan krnay kay bad) abw sayd rzy allh anh rwnay lgay awr kha: hm nay yh dykha tha lykn lwgwn kay khwf nay hmyn as kay baray myn bat krnay say rwk dya۔ phr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: snw، bny aadm mkhtlf qsmwn myn pyda kyay gyay، an myn say kchh mwmn bnayay gyay، wh aysay hy jyay awr asy trh mray، awr an myn say kchh kafr bnayay gyay، wh aysay hy jyay awr asy trh mray، awr an myn say kchh mwmn pyda hwyay، mwmn ky hysyt say zndh rhay، awr an myn say kwyy kafr ky hysyt say mray، awr an myn say kchh kafr ky hysyt say pyda hwyay۔ as trh، awr mwmnwn ky halt myn mrw۔\"" awr rawy khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ghsay ka zkr kya hay: \""an myn say baz kw jldy ghsh aata hay awr wh jldy khtm hw jata hay، ayk khslt dwsray kay bdlay hwty hay، awr an myn say baz kw ghsh aahsth hwta hay awr wh aahsth aahsth khtm hw jata hay، yh bhy ayk khslt hay، tm myn sb say bhtr wh hay jw ghsh myn aa jayay awr jw jldy say ghsay myn aa jayay، wh jldy khtm hw jayay، awr wh hay aahsth aahsth km hw jata hay۔\"" rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \""ghsh say bchw، kywnkh yh abn aadm kay dl pr jlta hwa kwylh hay، kya tm as ky rgwn ka swjn awr aankhwn ka srkh hwna nhyn dykhtay؟ jw shkhs aysy halt mhsws kray asay chahyay kh wh lyt jayay awr apnay aap kw zmyn say lga lay۔\"" rawy khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay qrz ka zkr krtay hwyay frmaya: tm myn say baz qrz ada krnay myn achhay hwtay hyn، lykn jb qrz lyna hw tw wswl krnay myn skht hwtay hyn، yh khslt dwsray ka bdl hay (albth yh khwby qabl taryf nhyn hay) baz ada krnay myn bray hyn lykn wswly myn achhay hyn، yh khwby dwsray kay bdlay bhy nhyn hay۔ tm myn say sb say bhtr wh hay jw qrz ada kray tw asay achhy trh ada kray awr jb asay qrz lyna hw tw wh wswl krnay myn nrmy say kam lay۔\"" yhan tk kh jb swrj ky rwshny khjwrwn ky chwtywn awr dywarwn kay atraf tk phnch gyy tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: snw، dnya ka srf atna hsh baqy hay jtna kh as dn ka hsh baqy hay۔ slslh zayf hay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5146","abwbkhtry rzy allh anh ayk shaby rzy allh anh say rwayt krtay hyn، anhwn nay kha: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”lwg gnahwn say hlak nhyn hwn gay jb tk kh wh apnay gnahwn kay jwaz kay lyay jhwtay azr pysh krnay lgyn۔ as ka slslh shyh hay jsay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"5147","ady bn ady kndy byan krtay hyn kh hm say hmaray aazad krdh ghlam nay byan kya kh anhwn nay myray dada kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”bay shk allh taalyٰ tmam lwgwn kw an myn say baz ky nafrmany ky wjh say azab nhyn dyta jb tk kh wh apnay samnay brayy nh dykh lyn awr as kw rwknay ky taqt rkhtay hwyay allh taalyٰ as kw psnd nh kryn awr jb sb as kw psnd nh kryn tw wh aam aadmy bn jayyn۔ (bht say awr chnd) - sza kay lyay۔\ hsn، shrh alsnn myn rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5148","abdallh bn msawd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb bny asrayyl gnahwn myn mbtla hw gyay tw an kay almaa nay anhyn mna kya، lykn jb wh baz nh aayay tw almaa an kay sath bythnay lgay awr an kay sath khana pyna shrwa kr dya، allh taalyٰ nay an kay dlwn kw ayk dwsray say mshabh kr dya awr as pr mrym alyha alslam awr daod alyh alslam ky lant bhyjy۔ as lyay hwa kh anhwn nay nafrmany ky awr zyadty ky۔ rawy khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm tyk lgayay bythay thay، phr ath kr byth gyay awr frmaya: nhyn (tm bhy kamyab nhyn hw gay) as zat ky qsm js kay hath myn myry jan hay، jb tk kh tm an (gnahgarwn، zalmwn) kw skhty say rwk nh lw۔ awr abwdaod ky rwayt myn hay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \kbhy nhyn، allh ky qsm، tm zrwr nyky ka hkm dw، tm pr lazm hay kh brayy say rwkw، tm pr lazm hay kh tm zalm ka hath zrwr pkrw، tm asay zrwr hq ky trf mayl krw، awr tm asay zrwr hq pr qaym rkhw، wrnh allh tmharay dlwn kw ayk dwsray kay mshabh kr day ga، phr tm pr lant bhyjay ga۔\"" as ky snd zayf hay، asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5149","sydna ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”maraj ky rat myn nay kchh aadmywn kw dykha jn kay hwnt aag ky qynchy say katay ja rhay thay، myn nay kha: aay jbryl! yh kwn lwg hyn؟ as nay jwab dya: yh aap ky amt kay mblgh hyn۔ wh lwgwn kw nyky ka hkm dytay thay lykn apnay aap kw bhwl jatay thay۔\\"" shrh alsn، albyhqy \""shab alayman\"" myn awr an ky rwayt myn hay: \""yh aap ky amt kay wh mblgh hyn jw khtay thay lykn aml nhyn krtay thay۔ wh allh ky ktab ky tlawt krtay thay lykn as pr aml nhyn krtay thay۔\"" hsn۔ shrh alsnn myn awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt ky hay۔"""""
"5150","amar bn yasr rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aasman say ayk dstrkhwan atara gya js myn rwty awr gwsht tha، awr anhyn hkm dya gya kh khyant nh kryn awr aglay dn kay lyay kchh nh rkhyn، lykn anhwn nay khyant ky، as kw zkhyrh kr lya، awr aglay dn as ky chaby ky wjh say as kw mhfwz kr lya۔ khnzyr۔\ as ky snd zayf hay، asay trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"5151","amr bn khtab rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aakhry zmanay myn myry amt kw apnay hkmranwn ky trf say ftnwn awr ftnwn ka samna krna pray ga، awr why njat payay ga js nay allh kay dyn kw phchantay hwyay، as kay khlaf apny zban، apnay hath say jhad kya، awr js kay dl myn sb say phlay rhmt hay، wh phchanay ga۔ allh ka dyn awr as ky tsdyq krnay wala، awr wh shkhs js nay allh kay dyn kw phchan lya lykn as ky (wzaht awr tfsylat) kay baray myn khamwshy akhtyar ky، agr as nay ksy kw achha kam krtay dykha tw asay psnd kya، awr agr as nay ksy kw bra kam krtay hwyay dykha tw as say naraz hwa، yh shkhs apny pwshydh psnd w napsnd say kamyab hwa۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5152","Jabir (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: \Allah"","" the Mighty and Majestic"","" revealed to Jibreel (peace be upon him) to overturn such-and-such city along with its inhabitants. He said: 'My Lord! Among them is Your such-and-such servant who has not disobeyed You even for the blink of an eye.' The Prophet (peace and blessings be upon him) said: 'Allah"","" the Exalted"","" said: Overturn it upon him and upon them"","" for his face never changed for My sake even for a moment.'\"" Its chain is weak. Narrated by Al-Bayhaqi in Shu'ab al-Iman."""""
"5153","abw sayd rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bay shk allh taalyٰ qyamt kay dn bnday say pwchhay ga: tjhay kya hwa kh jb tw nay brayy dykhy tw as say baz nh aaya؟ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: asay as ky hjt skhayy jayay gy awr wh khay ga: aay myray rb myn lwgwn say drta tha awr tjh say amyd rkhta tha۔ amam byhqy nay shab alayman myn tynwn hdysyn nql ky hyn۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"5154","abw mwsyٰ ashary rzy allh anh byan krtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qsm hay as zat ky js kay hath myn mhmd sly allh alyh wslm ky jan hay، bay shk nyky awr bdy dw alg alg mkhlwqat hyn، qyamt kay dn an kw lwgwn kay samnay khra kya jayay ga awr as ky tqlyd ky jayay gy۔ (yany salhyn) awr an say bhlayy ka wadh krw، jb kh brayy khay gy: dwr rhw، dwr rhw، lykn (jn lwgwn nay brayy ky hay) apnay aap kw as say alg nhyn kr skyn gay۔ as ka slslh kmzwr hay۔ asay ahmd awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
